<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZK" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow Ezekiel chekhai, now arui khin dow 593-571 BC takra kowi chekhai. Mami bowih dow Babulawn kowi kowh takhang mih Judauüa vüi hai pur prakowi kowh maru-uüa vüi Ezekiel ruiah mih chekhai. Ezekiel bowih dow Thurai maru-uüa kowi napela sakklamra kownkow hai napela süngürra kownkow chekhai. Mami bowih kowi dow Ezekiel mih pur prakowi tawng iawng chow Judauüa naown kown mih lawnguan kowi ruiah khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Babulawn kowi kowh takhang miuüa kowh owmra dow atawima chekhai. Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e uang rik plan dowi matchang Jerusalem marow kowi naia plan iawk kown mih tuak khai. Naiawng rakowi Jerusalem kowi uang plan kown now CHAKRAMANG tut-e nauang rik plan kown takla mih lawnguan amatni kowi Ezekiel tüngsangah khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Auown khe risi Ezekiel mih Judauüa ngak lawnguan kowi lawp pe hanow Thurai tara chet lawnguan hown amatni kowi hawiah khai. Amatni kowi aia tek pe mih, “Thurai dow aia maru-uüa kowi nacham pe takhangah kown, now Jerusalem marow paw napiakta kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nami kung kowi risi plan tek mih, “Aria aret kowi kowh pren kowi dow amatni kowh arup aren kowi chupiia mih hai Thurai maru-uüa kowi chang nowng chang powng mih rakowi Thurai naripah kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nami kung kowi amatni kowi risi plan tek pe mih, “Takhangra hownia nauang pawla hanow Israel, Juda hai lusa kowi kowh chenchap maten kowi Thurai mih arasang nakua nalawmah kown,” pakhai. Angak hownia maru tarip mih khin khe dow Thurai mih amatni kowh sak kowi lümlasai nauang peah kown. Akat ni dow Mesia mih aia maru-uüa tut-e nauang kown, now amatni kowh ransu-uüa kowi napiakta pe kown. Thurai chup kim dow naplan thawpah iawk kown, now Thurai kowh kraingra dow nakowi nauang plan uowi iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi kowh amülüng mih laiklow dow “Nami khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami amatni natuk kown” pami chekhai (6:7). Nami laiklow ahuma tekla mih auan dow aia klen kowi Thurai uowi dowi bowt pami maru pacham tuk lah pakowh chekhai. Lusa kowi lowra chap uang phaw mih dow Thurai low hown kowh chekhai pami alai hownia kawmat pat uang tatüng reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Khown: Khown pami dow luprak phaw dowi mih ning kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai. Khown kuak khe dow chang üa chang laih chepaw tawng luprak paw phaw dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Tapplawt: Tapplawt pami dow marow tapat lut mih kha kowi kowh aplawt chekhai. Israeluüa chowng khe kowh kha plawt dow auarma chekhai. Nakowi dow lawngtang aluchowuüa hai tara chet miuüa mih maru kowi chet pe tara reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Kraksa dawngh: Kraksa dawngh pami dow klowngkrua dawngh lak kowi kowh ü-ah mih dawngh chekhai. Nami dow bangla hown kowh tek pe Chengkia mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Ezekiel kowi Thurai hawah mih 1:1-3:27</para>
  <para style="io1">Jerusalem marow napiak kown mih lawnguan 4:1-24:27</para>
  <para style="io1">Chenchapuüa luk kowi Thurai kowh ripra nauang ting kown mih 25:1-32:32</para>
  <para style="io1">Aia maru-uüa tut-e Thurai kham pe lai mih 33:1-37:28</para>
  <para style="io1">Gawg vüi kowi kowh laiklow 38:1-39:29</para>
  <para style="io1">Thurai chup kim hai pren lawnguan kowi khi mukmang mih 40:1-48:35</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZK 1" />
  <para style="s">Babulawn kowi Ezekiel khi mukmang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 1:1" />Süngkawm ning nga tali la tanga ni khe cham takhang miuüa hown Kebar aw pang kowi ang tawi uowi khai. Nami khin khe mukuang dow uang tauow khai, now Thurai hownia kowh mukmang dow ang khi khai. <verse eid="EZK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 1:2" />Nami ang khi mih dow mang Jehoiakin cham takhang mih tanga ning khe chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 1:3" />Ang dow uamow Buzi kowh chapa uamow Ezekiel chekhai. Babulawn pren kowi kowh Kebar aw pang kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai, now CHAKRAMANG kür dow ang luk kowi uang uowi khai.<verse eid="EZK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 1:4" />Ang tang mü hanow tawngphak hownia kowh liku uangchak uang mih dow ang khi khai. Uangnim akraingma mih kowi maih dow pla nowi iawng nowi khai, now ariaret kowi dow anowima tavir lut chekhai. Nami maih nowi dawnglang kowi dow lawngha nowi iawng tawk pluplup chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 1:5" />Nakowi dow kaurawng uaramchak iawng tawng chünchü uang tatüng tali klüng khai. Amatni powm dow lusa maru iawng chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 1:6" />Tawkchedow amatni bowkbowk kowh dow lumowr uowi tali klüng chi chekhai, now alap paw uowi tali klüng chi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 1:7" />Amatni kowh klowng dow atengma chekhai, now amatni kowh khawkpha dow chia chah kowh keh iawng chekhai. Naiawngün dow sawkah sauah mih kri iawng dow tawk pluplup chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 1:8" />Amatni kowh alap tali klüng mih dak kowi dow lusa maru kowh rut iawng arut uowi tali klüng chi chekhai. Amatni kowh dow lumowr hai alap paw uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 1:9" />Amatni kowh alap pre buk chi mih dow akeng mih pre ia kowh lap kowi takak khai. Amatni bowkbowk dow atengma mang büah khai. Amatni mang mih khin khe ahawmsang taiua mang khai, now miapaw akeng prakowi ngeu büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 1:10" />Amatni kowh powm dow maiawng: amatni bowkbowk kowi pur prakowi lusa maru lumowr iawng lumowr uowi lowk chi chekhai, now hawmlawm prakowi dow krangsi lumowr iawng chekhai, lakuai prakowi dow chiala lumowr iawng chekhai, now kung prakowi dow uamu lumowr iawng mih lumowr paw uowi lowk chi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 1:11" />Amatni kowh lap pre buk chi mih dow aluk prakowi iangah hanow akeng mih pre ia kowh lap kowi takak khai. Now amatni kowh akeng mih lap pre buk chi mih dow phumla amatni kowh buk büah khai. <verse eid="EZK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 1:12" />Amatni kowh lümla tawng pra chow nau napra kowi cham kowi büah khai. Amatni mang mih khin khe ahawmsang taiua mang khai, now miapaw akeng prakowi ngeu büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 1:13" />Naiawngün kaurawng uaramchak hawmh dow mairing hai maitawng powm iawng chekhai. Amatni pungmadawng kowi dow maih mih pla nowi iawng uang lai powt lai chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 1:14" />Nami kaurawng uaramchak hawmh dow pla nowi khe kowh iawng dow uang lai powt lai chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 1:15" />Nami kaurawng uaramchak hawmh prakowi dow ang tang mü hanow tali klüng mih kaurawng uaramchak ria towng krawng kowi lawngkua khawk uowi lowk chi mih dow ang khi khai. <verse eid="EZK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 1:16" />Nami lawngkua khawk maten dow apowmsang chekhai. Nami lawngkua khawk powm dow asung khakma mih hua iawng tawk pluplup chekhai. Nami lawngkua khawk tali klüng mih kowi dow akhawk lak kowi akhawk kutplan uowi lowk chi tak chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 1:17" />Nami lawngkua khawk lün mih khin khe dow nami kaurawng uaramchak hawmh mih amatni nau prakowi atengma lün büah khai. Amatni lün mih khin khe akeng prakowi taplang büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 1:18" />Nami lawngkua khawk dow lainowmma iuk khai, now kramra paw lainowmma uowi chekhai. Nami lawngkua khawk tali klüng mih kowi dow mik tapat lut uowi khai. <verse eid="EZK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 1:19" />Nami kaurawng uaramchak hawmh mang mih khin khe amatni ria kowi kowh lawngkua khawk maten paw tawi taui khai. Kaurawng uaramchak hawmh che krawng hownia aluk prakowi awr tatowng hanow lawngkua khawk paw tawi tatowng khai. <verse eid="EZK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 1:20" />Kaurawng uaramchak hawmh kowh lümla mih aia nau prakowi cham kowi mih khin khe nami lawngkua khawk paw tawi khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami kaurawng uaramchak hawmh kowh lümla dow nami lawngkua khawk lak kowi uowi mih chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 1:21" />Kaurawng uaramchak hawmh che mang now lawngkua khawk paw tawi mang khai. Kaurawng uaramchak hawmh che tanai now nami lawngkua khawk paw tawi tanai khai. Now kaurawng uaramchak hawmh che krawng hownia awr tatowng hanow awr tatowng hown akrowksang nami lawngkua khawk paw tawi tatowng khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami kaurawng uaramchak hawmh kowh lümla dow nami lawngkua khawk lak kowi uowi mih chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 1:22" />Nami kaurawng uaramchak hawmh luk kowi dow matawng chünchü tabe mih uowi lowk. Nami dow nimrua iawng tawk pliplip chekhai, now lainowmma kramra paw uowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 1:23" />Nami dak kowi dow amatni kowh lap mih phatah büah khai, now lowk ia kowh lap dow alowk mih kowh lap kowi takak khai. Akeng mih lap pre buk chi mih hown dow phumla buk büah khai. <verse eid="EZK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 1:24" />Kaurawng uaramchak hawmh mang now amatni kowh lap tün ang ta khai. Nami lap tün dow tui lawt khe kowh tui hawr tün iawng, lang kri lang kraing mih kowh kraw tün iawng, now siphaiuüa kowh hek klow iawng chekhai. Amatni iowng mih khin khe dow amatni kowh lap mih kawpta büah khai. <verse eid="EZK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 1:25" />Kawpta lap now amatni iowng mih khin khe dow amatni luk kowi kowh uowi rah hownia maru lowk ia klow ang ta khai.<verse eid="EZK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 1:26" />Nakowi dow asung khakma mih hua hown kowh thawpah mih mang chowm rah ang khi lowk. Nami alowngma kowi kowh uowi mih mang chowm rah luk kowi dow lusa maru powm iawng uowi lowk ia chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 1:27" />Now nami dow kelang hownia aluk prakowi tawk pluplup mih kri iawng dow ang khi khai. Nami dow maih kangowh mih iawng chekhai. Now kelang hownia adak pra dow maih powm iawng chekhai; aia riaret kowi dow anowi tavir lut chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 1:28" />Uang ni khe kowh uangnim kowi tummapia iawng dow aia riaret kowi nami anowi dow uang tatüng khai. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG kraingra powm iawng chekhai. Nami ang khi hanow krawng kowi ang tabawk krawm khai, now maru lowk ia klang ang mih powm iawng ang ta khai.<verse eid="EZK 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZK 2" />
  <para style="s">Ezekiel kowi Thurai hawah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 2:1" />Now klang ang mih maru tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, awr rü diah; en hown ang taklang kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 2:2" />Nami maru klang ang reng tak khe Thurai Lümla mih ang tut-e uang kup hanow uang krüng ang khai, now klang ang mih maru tek lai reng tak mih dow ang ta khai.<verse eid="EZK 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 2:3" />Nami maru tek mih, “Aw maru chapa, kingküa hai sen ang mih chenchap Israeluüa tut-e ang uang chin en mih chekhai. Amatni hai amatni pipu-uüa dow ani mowr kingküa hai sen ang reng tak chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 2:4" />Ang kowchin en mih arah kowi kowh maru-uüa dow amiasiama chekhai, now ang kowi paw nü ang klowk ang büah dowi chekhai. Nami maru-uüa tut-e en nakowtek kown mih, ‘Mami chowtaih CHAKRAMANG Thurai laiklow,’ napape kown. <verse eid="EZK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 2:5" />Amatni dow nami laiklow hawt sünta büah dowi tham chepaw naia. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow kingküa hai sen mih chenchap chekhai. Nachenganchepaw amatni pungmadawng kowi risi uowi lowk ia pami dow natuk büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 2:6" />Aw maru chapa, amatni hai amatni kowh laiklow kowi hangkow kram diah. Amatni kawi krawk mih laiklow dow chuh mung kowi kowh cham uowi mih iawng hai krawng dak rowp takra kowi kowh cham uowi mih iawng chepaw hangkow kram diah. Amatni kowi khi hai amatni laiklow ta rakowi hangkow kram diah; amatni dow kingküa hai sen mih chenchap chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 2:7" />Amatni dow kingküa hai sen mih chenchap chekhai rakowi ang laiklow hawt sünta büah dowi tham chepaw naia. Nachenganchepaw sünta lah, sünta dowi lah amatni tut-e ang laiklow en nakowtek kown. <verse eid="EZK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 2:8" />Aw maru chapa, ang tek en mih sünta diah. Paimi kingküa hai sen mih chenchap iawng dow hang tawi own diah. En kowh nawr haah diah, now ang pe en mih cha diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 2:9" />Nami khin khe ang tang mü hanow ang prakowi rut uaitaiaw lowk mih ang khi khai. Nami rut kowi dow charam tua uowi lowk chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 2:10" />Now nami rut mih nami charam tua phat ang khai. Nami charam pre dam trui kowi dow arui uowi chekhai; naiawngün dow kar meng, uowila uiting uangtak mih laiklow hai taprüa taiiara laiklow chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 2:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZK 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 3:1" />Nami kung kowi Thurai tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, en pur kowi kowh uowi mih cha diah; mami charam tua mih chata diah. Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa tut-e kowkowiah hanow kowtek lai diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="EZK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 3:2" />Nami khin khe ang ha nawr hanow aia dow nami charam tua mih sawk ang khai.<verse eid="EZK 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 3:3" />Nami kung kowi Thurai plan tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, mami ang pe en mih charam tua cha diah, en kowh mu pacham duh lah,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi nami charam tua mih ang chata khai, now nami achak sowr dow ang nawr kowi kuai tui iawng dow adingma chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 3:4" />Nami kung kowi aia dow plan tek ang mih. “Aw maru chapa, kawmat Israeluüa tut-e kowkowiah now ang kowh laiklow kowkrawi tek diah. <verse eid="EZK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 3:5" />En kowi dow en tukah dowi mih maru-uüa, lai akratma mih tut-e nadowi ang kowchin en, ang chin en mih dow Israeluüa tut-e chowtaih. <verse eid="EZK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 3:6" />En tuktaah dowi mih hai en tuk tekah dowi mih lai akratma mih akeng chenchapuüa tut-e dow ang cham chin en dowi chekhai. Naiawng mih maru-uüa tut-e ang cham chin en panü dow en kowh laiklow nasünta büah ngengche kown. <verse eid="EZK 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 3:7" />Tawkchedow Israeluüa mih en laiklow nau sünta kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow ang laiklow nau sünta dowi chekhai. Nami auan dow Israel chenchap maten mih lai üa kürma hai kingküa dawma chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 3:8" />Tawkchedow en kowi paw amatni powm iawng saktuak akhawtma hai amiasiama ang nachang en kown. <verse eid="EZK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 3:9" />En kowh sak dow maiak iawng akhawtma ang changta en khowk. Amatni dow kingküa hai sen mih chenchap chekhai. Nachenganchepaw hangkow kram diah, amatni kowi khi chepaw hangkow kram diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 3:10" />Thurai kutplan tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, ang nau tek en kown mih laiklow srui sak hown süntaah hanow sakdawng kowi towah diah. <verse eid="EZK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 3:11" />Kawmat mih cham takhang mih en prenchakuüa tut-e kowkowi now kowtek lai diah. Amatni sünta lah, sünta dowi lah, amatni tut-e, ‘CHAKRAMANG tek mih maiawng,’ pahai kowtek pe diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 3:12" />Nami kung kowi Thurai Lümla dow towngla ang khai. Now ang kung prakowi lihowng mang tün iawng ang ta khai. Nami laiklow dow maiawng, “CHAKRAMANG uowi rah kowi dow aia kowh kraingra hai akiow pauowi lah,” pakhai. <verse eid="EZK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 3:13" />Ang mih nami kaurawng uaramchak hawmh kowh lowkkowlowk alap tahik mih atün dow ang ta khai. Nami klen kowi amatni riaret kowi kowh lawngkua khawk taui mih dow atünma ang ta khai. <verse eid="EZK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 3:14" />Thurai Lümla towngla ang mih khin khe lainowmma sak-hiah hai ang kunmarau khai. Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG kür dow ang luk kowi uowi mih ang tatuk chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 3:15" />Now Kebar aw ria kowi kowh Tel-Abib kowi takhang miuüa tut-e ang kowkowi khai, now amatni uowi rah kowi amatni tut-e amawlawma hown ranit ni mowr ang tawi uowi khai.<verse eid="EZK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ezekiel dow Israeluüa kowh kangchawng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 3:16" />Now ranit ni kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG laiklow mih ang tut-e uang ting khai. <verse eid="EZK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 3:17" />CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, Israeluüa vüi kangchawng mih ang thawp en khowk. Naiawng rakowi ang hownia en ta laiklow hown krowksang nauowi kaneu kown mih Israeluüa kowi kowkrawi tek diah. <verse eid="EZK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 3:18" />Maru ngak lowk ia kowi, ‘En nakowng ngengche kown,’ pahai ang tek pe mih khin nauowi kown. Nami khin khe aia kowh sak naplaila kownkow lup ngak hownia uang plan kown mih en tek pe dowi hanow nami maru ngak dow aia kowh angak rakowi nakowng kown. Tawkchedow nami kowng mih aprek dow en luk kowi ang natang en kown. <verse eid="EZK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 3:19" />Tawkchedow nami maru kowi aia kowh angak hownia natarip kown mih en tek pe khowk chepaw nau tarip dowi, chang ngak rengreng hanow aia kowh angak rakowi aia dow nakowng kown. Tawkche en dow chün ang laiklow khai rakowi naplai kown.<verse eid="EZK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 3:20" />“Maru iungma mih lowk ia che chang lup ngak khai hanow amatni kowh tiama kowi ang nakrawi hangah kown. Nachenganchepaw aia che lup ngak chang taingta dowi hanow aia dow nakowng kown. Aia kowi dow natarip kown en tek pe dowi hanow aia dow aia ngak rakowi nakowng kown. Now aia changah mih lup iung srui dow natuak pe kown nadowi; aia kowng mih aprek dow en luk kowi ang natang en kown. <verse eid="EZK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 3:21" />Tawkchedow nachang lup ngak dowi kownkow nami maru iung kowi en hangah khai, now en hangah mih laiklow chün hai chang angak dowi hanow aia dow nasing ngengche kown, now en matia kowh sak paw naplai kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 3:22" />Nakowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kür akraingma mih ang luk kowi uang uowi khai. CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Awr rü now lawngrawi kowi kowkowi diah, nakowi dow en hown ang nataklang kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ezekiel kowh dai krang kowi tadan mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 3:23" />Naiawng rakowi ang awr rü hanow lawngrawi kowi ang kowkowi khai. Kebar aw ria kowi kowh ang khi-ah mih CHAKRAMANG kraingra dow nakowi paw ang khi khai. Naiawng rakowi tabawk krawm se ang chupah khai.<verse eid="EZK 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 3:24" />Nami khin khe Thurai Lümla dow uangah now uang krüng ang khai. Now CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “En matia kim kowi kowkowi hanow büngta kim now alak kowi kowuowi phülü diah. <verse eid="EZK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 3:25" />Aw maru chapa, leng hown maru natawmta en kown. Now prang kowi kowh maru-uüa tut-e en tawi ia kowi kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 3:26" />Israeluüa dow kingküa hai sen mih chenchap chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ririmma en nauowila kownkow hai en ia pringhawila amatni dowi kownkow en kowh dai mih krang kowi ang nadanta en kown. <verse eid="EZK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 3:27" />Tawkchedow en hown ang taklang mih khin khe en kowh nawr dow ang nauow en kown. Now amatni tut-e en natek pe kown mih, ‘Mami chowtaih CHAKRAMANG laiklow,’ napape kown. Amatni pungmadawng kowi sünta kown nau miuüa dow pacham sünta lah, now sünta kown nau dowi miuüa dow hang pacham sünta lah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow kingküa dawma mih chenchap chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 3:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZK 4" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow kowi ransu-uüa uang rumah mih rup</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 4:1" />Thurai plan tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, kawmat mih cham paw ipbawn lowk diah, now nami ipbawn mih en pur kowi towah diah. Nami ipbawn luk kowi Jerusalem marow rup thawpah diah. <verse eid="EZK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 4:2" />Nami ipbawn tavir lut ransu-uüa uang rum Jerusalem marow mih powm iawng thawpah diah. Nami marow kowi tap hownia dow ransu-uüa nowng kupla kown mih powm iawng marow tapat lut plu pe bawn diah. Now marow ria kowi dow marow tapat lut siphaiuüa tanungra thawpah diah. Nami klen kowi khuela tap kown mih uanh paw marow tapat lut towah diah. <verse eid="EZK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 4:3" />Nami kung kowi cham paw pe lawngha pher lowk hanow en hown marow takra kowi tap iawng towah diah, now en kowh lumowr mih nami marow prakowi dangah diah. Naiawng hai marow dow umta lut khowk pami en natüngah kown. Nami dow Israel chenchap vüi amatra chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 4:4" />“Nami kung kowi dow lakuai prakowi rengkeng pah en namawk kown, now Israeluüa kowh angak ripra mih en kowi ang nape en kown. Rengkeng pah en mawk mih ni mowr dow amatni kowh ripra en nakur kown. <verse eid="EZK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 4:5" />Amatni nakaah kown mih ripra dow paning paning kowi pani pani chi ang nape kur en kown. Naiawng rakowi sumkawmkla takukawm ni mowr Israeluüa kowh ripra dow en nakur kown.<verse eid="EZK 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 4:6" />“Nami chur hanow en naplan mawk iawk kown. Nami khin khe dow hawmlawm prakowi rengkeng pah en namawk lai kown, now Judauüa kowh angak ripra dow en nakur kown. Amatni naka ripra kown mih paning paning kowi pani pani chi ang pe kur en kown. Naiawng rakowi likawm ni mowr ang nape mawk en iawk kown. <verse eid="EZK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 4:7" />Now rumta lut mih Jerusalem marow prakowi en nadang kown, now dowk takhüm kown khe kowh iawng lownta pe kowrmow bawng khükhü nami marow napiak kown mih lai en natek kown. <verse eid="EZK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 4:8" />Now naiawng en chang mih ni chur dowi mowr dow mapra paipra en ia rengkengla dowi kownkow leng hown ang natawmta en hüah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 4:9" />Now Thurai plan tek ang mih, “Püm, iakmow, daing, be nuk, prenbawng nuk hai chowtui mi ün dow pawah now puh aiukma mih kowi arasang towah diah, now thawpla kawmdi diah. Sumkawmkla takukawm ni rengkeng pah en mawk mih khin khe nami dow en nachaah kown. <verse eid="EZK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 4:10" />Nami kawmdi dow ni towng apuachowchi khaiah hanow en nathawpla kawm kown, now nami kawm dow ni chut kowi en nau mih khin khe ditchowchi en nachaah kown. <verse eid="EZK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 4:11" />Nami klen kowi tui paw akhuai kowi chüt ditchow ni towng lowra mih khin khe en nakhamah kown. <verse eid="EZK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 4:12" />Iakmow hown kowh thawpah mih kawm iawng dow nami chakkham en nachaah kown. Maru pur kowi lusa maru kih keu hown kowh maih kowi nami kawm dow en naheuah kown. <verse eid="EZK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 4:13" />Nami dow akeng pren kowi ang cham uetah mih khin khe asür alawkma mih chakkham Israeluüa nacham cha kown mih amatra chekhai,” padow CHAKRAMANG tek ang khai.<verse eid="EZK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 4:14" />Nami khin khe ang tek pe mih, “Uh! CHAKRAMANG Thurai, sakrauma hown naiawng pat dow hauang pe chang ang diah. Tawng khe paw ang tasür talawk dowi tak. Asowmchow hownia kawmat mowr pat kowng mih hai kaurawng uaramchak hawmh makah mih tawng chap paw ang cha dowi tak. Asür alawkma mih chaknga tawng chap paw ang nawr kowi ang phang dowi tak,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 4:15" />Now aia tek ang mih, “Naiawng chekhai hanow lusa maru kih keu takcha chia kih keu hown kowh maih kowi en kowh kawm mih naheuah kownkow ang pe en alow khowk,” pakhai. <verse eid="EZK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 4:16" />Nami kung kowi aia tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, Jerusalem marow kowh chakkham kramra dow ang napitta pe kown. Marow kowi kowh maru-uüa mih chakkham lawk dowi mih rakowi natuak krat kown. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow khaiah hanow nacha chakkham büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 4:17" />Chakkham hai tui mih lainowmma nakhawr büah kown. Amatni dow amawlawma natamüla mak büah kown, now amatni kowh angak rakowi amatni kowh chownglawng dow naura naurachow nachur kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZK 5" />
  <para style="s">Tara chet krang nauang ting kown mih amatra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 5:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, kawmat mih en kowh saichow hown en nachangla sam khai müa kown, now en kowh sam hai mawmpawi mih en nakhaiah kown. Nami kung kowi dow set hown en nakhaiah hanow nami sam mih sum bak en nachangah kown. <verse eid="EZK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 5:2" />Jerusalem marow pung en thawpah mih kowi kowh rumah mih ni chur khe dow nami sam sum bak kowi pabak mih marow lak kowi en natikah kown, pabak mih dow marow ria kowi tapat lut atown atownchow en nakrawi tawpah kown, now pabak mih dow li hown en narownah kown. Nami kung kowi maru-uüa kowi dow saidawng hown ang nakrawiah kown. <verse eid="EZK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 5:3" />Tawkchedow sam mih en napawah ne hanow en tawnguat kowi en naduaah kown. <verse eid="EZK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 5:4" />Nami kung kowi dow nami sam mih tawnguat hownia en nalaiah ne hanow maih kowi en natikah kown. Nami hownia dow Israel chenchapuüa maten tut-e maih mih nakrawi tauet kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 5:5" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG Thurai plan tek ang mih, “Mami pung dow Jerusalem kowh amatra chekhai. Jerusalem marow kowi dow akeng chenchapuüa takra kowi ang towah khai; aia riaret kowi dow akeng chenchapuüa pren tapat lut chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 5:6" />Nachenganchepaw aia dow aia ngak rakowi ang kowh ari aiang hai ang kowh ana pek chün dowi chekhai. Aia dow akeng pren hai akeng chenchapuüa lak-e kingküa hai lang sen ang khai. Aia dow ang kowh ari aiang nuata khai, ang kowh ana pek paw chün dowi chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 5:7" />“Naiawng rakowi ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek khowk, aw Jerusalem, en riaret kowi kowh pren maten lak-e paw en lang ngah khai. Ang kowh ana pek iawng en mang dowi, now ang kowh ari aiang paw en chün dowi chekhai. Nami klen kowi en riaret kowi kowh akeng chenchapuüa kowh ari aiang khowm padow en chün dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 5:8" />Naiawng rakowi ang CHAKRAMANG, ang matia ngengche kingküa en kown, now akeng chenchapuüa pur kowi ang narip en kown. <verse eid="EZK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 5:9" />Suiiai kaniaima mih lup maten en chang rakowi ang narip en kown; naiawng mih ripra dow nami dowi rawn khe katpaw ang chang dowi tak, nami kung kowi paw katpaw ang nachang kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 5:10" />En maru-uüa dow lainowmma sakkrai hown nauowi kown. Naiawng rakowi upa-uüa dow amatni chauüa nga nacha kown, amatni kowh chauüa dow u-pa nga nacha kown. Aw Jerusalem, ang narip en kown, now en maru ta sing uowi miuüa kowi dow pren tali nui kowi ang nacham uetah kown. <verse eid="EZK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 5:11" />En kowh asürlawkma mih arup maten hai suiiai kaniaima mih lup srui hown ang kowh chup kim dow en sürlawkah khai. Naiawng rakowi ang matia ngengche ang kowh sanara dow en hownia ang napawta kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG masing Thurai tek khowk, ang nasana en kown nadowi, ripra hownia mapaw ang nape powt en kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 5:12" />En kowh maru sum bak kowi pabak mih dow makowng hawi hown nadowi now khown hown marow kowi nakowng kown, pabak mih maru dow tasenra kowi nacham kowng kown, now pabak mih maru kowi dow pren tali nui kowi ang nacham uetah hanow saidawng hown ang nakrawiah kown.<verse eid="EZK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 5:13" />“Naiawng ang ki changta bowk kung kowi chiang mapaw ang sak-ih dowi mih dow nachur kown. Ang kowh kunmaraura maten amatni luk kowi ang ki sunta khü chiang ang kowh kunmaraura dow naprowng kown. Nami khin khe dow ang CHAKRAMANG amatni kowi khowrbownah mih kunmarau rakowi ang tek pe mih chekhai pami natuk büah kown.<verse eid="EZK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 5:14" />“Aw Jerusalem, ang napiakta en kown. En ria iawng mang miuüa pur kowi dow tapiak khowk mih rah ang nachangla en kown, now chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi dow rensi kau ang nachangla en kown. <verse eid="EZK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 5:15" />Kunmarauma hai sak-hiama hown ang rip en mih khin khe dow en riaret kowi kowh chenchapuüa khi en hanow takrow kowh amawlawma naown kown. Amatni dow khi en hanow nasui en kown, now nachangla en rensi kau kown. Now amatni vüi dow tarip müa en nachowng kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk. <verse eid="EZK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 5:16" />Napiakta en kownkow khown kri ang nauang kuak en kown, now en kowh chakkham kramra tiama dow ang napitta en kown; nami khin khe mih leba sek hown kowh ap-ah mih iawng dow sakkrai hown en nakawm kown. <verse eid="EZK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 5:17" />Khown hai langpranma mih kaurawng uaramchak dow ang nauang chin en kown. Naiawngün dow nakowngta en chauüa bowk kown. Makowng hawi hai tatu tasawtra en tut-e nauang ting kown, now ang nauang pawla en tasenra kown. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai. Mami laiklow dow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 5:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZK 6" />
  <para style="s">Arup aren kowi chupiia mih vüi ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 6:1" />Now CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang plankut ting khai iawk. <verse eid="EZK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 6:2" />CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, Israel kowi kowh hungma mawngma prakowi dangah now pur prakowi nauang ting kown mih laiklow ang takcha kowi tek pe dit. <verse eid="EZK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 6:3" />Israel kowi kowh hungma mawngma kowi tek pe dit. Hungma mawngma, awchawng hai lawngrawi maten kowi ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek pe mih laiklow dow pacham ta lah. Amatni kowi kingküara hai tasenra ang nauang pawla pe hanow arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara maten ang napiakta pe kown. <verse eid="EZK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 6:4" />Amatni kowh phuchuara maten ang napiakta pe kown, now amatni kowh maikhük towk müa phuchuara maten paw natimta pe kown. Amatni kowh arup aren pur kowi dow amatni kowh maru-uüa kowi ang nasatah kown. <verse eid="EZK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 6:5" />Israeluüa kowh uak dow amatni kowh arup aren pur kowi ang natowah kown, now amatni kowh phuchuara riaret kowi dow amatni kowh hut ang nauetah kown. <verse eid="EZK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 6:6" />Israeluüa uowi rah marow maten dow natapiak kown. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowh phuchuara hai arup aren maten paw natadi bowk kown. Amatni kowh maikhük towk müa phuchuara paw nataset plawt kown, now amatni thawpah mih chap maten paw natama bowk kown. <verse eid="EZK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 6:7" />Now amatni pungmadawng kowi amatni maru-uüa dow nakowng kown. Naiawng phaw mih kung kowi dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah bowt kown.<verse eid="EZK 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 6:8" />“Nachenganchepaw nami ripra hownia dow ang pe plaiah ne kown. Tawkchedow akeng pren kowi nacham uowi büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 6:9" />Now akeng pren kowi cham uowi büah khe dow amatni kowh sak ang hownia tala mih hai amatni kowh sak kaah sakowm dowi mih natuk büah kown. Nami klen kowi amatni kowh mik arup aren kowi cham irh rakowi amatni kowh mik hown pe ang arau mih paw natuk büah bowt kown. Amatni kowh angak hai suiiai kaniaima mih lup maten rakowi kowmatia kowi amatni natasui kown. <verse eid="EZK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 6:10" />Nami khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah bowt kown, now amatni luk kowi nauang pawla pe phih kown mih laiklow aiawnglowma ang tekah mih nadowi pami natuk büah bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 6:11" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG kutplan tek ang iawk mih, “Ezekiel, Israeluüa kowh angak hai suiiai kaniaima mih lup maten rakowi kunmarau kowh en kowh rut akürma phekla se akür akürma khowi krawng diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow tasenra, khown hai makowng hawi kowi amatni dow nakowng kown chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 6:12" />Alakma kowi kowh cham uowi miuüa dow makowng hawi hown nakowng kown, atawnchow kowi kowh uowi miuüa dow tasenra kowi nakowng kown, now ta sing uowi miuüa dow ransu-uüa rumta lut mih lak kowi khown hown nakowng kown. Naiawng hai ang kowh kunmaraura dow amatni luk kowi ang nasunta bowk kown. <verse eid="EZK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 6:13" />Israeluüa dow amatni kowh phuchuara riaret kowi kowh arup aren maten dawng kowi, hungh aiuk aiukma mih maten luk kowi, amia aiuk aklangma kangowh mih singh krüa maten kowi, aram chakma mih karpowng singh krüa maten kowi nacham kowng kown; amatni kowh arup aren vüi cham towk maikhük mih rah maten kowi amatni dow nacham kowng kown. Nami khin khe mih ta sing uowi miuüa dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 6:14" />Amatni cham uowi rah pren maten kowi Israeluüa kowi mih ang nakrawi ripah kown. Tawngphak pra kowh süngrüp süngkangma hownia mrawkphak pra kowh Ribla marow mowr pren mih dow mapaw lat dowi kowi akhaw aklaima ang nachangah kown. Nami khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 6:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZK 7" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh achur khin uang ting mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 7:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang plan ting khai iawk. <verse eid="EZK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 7:2" />CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, Israel prenchakuüa tut-e mami laiklow ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai takcha kowi kowkrawi tek pe dit: Enni kowh chur khin uang ting khai bowt! Enni kowh pren paprenma dow natapiak bowk kown. <verse eid="EZK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 7:3" />Nami akhin dow enni luk kowi kawmat uang ting khai bowt; ang kunmaraura dow enni luk kowi ang sunah bowt kown. Enni kowh chowm krang uowi krang iawng hai ang nachet enni tara kown, now enni kowh suiiai kaniaima mih lup maten rakowi ang narip enni kown. <verse eid="EZK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 7:4" />Enni kowi dow ang nasana enni kown nadowi bowt, ripra hownia ang nape powt enni kown nadowi bowt. Enni kowh chowm krang uowi krang hai enni pungmadawng kowi kowh suiiai kaniaima mih lup rakowi ang narip enni ngengche kown. Nami khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami enni natuk bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 7:5" />CHAKRAMANG plan tek mih, “Mü diah! Phih akraingma mih dow alowk kung kowi alowk mih uang tarü thüm khowk! <verse eid="EZK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 7:6" />Enni kowh chur khin dow uang tarü khowk. Nami dow nauang ting kown chowbowt. <verse eid="EZK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 7:7" />Israel pren kowi kowh uowi miuüa low, enni luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown chowbowt. Akhin dow uang na khai bowt. Hungma mawngma luk kowi piaw mih klow takcha kowi takrow kowh hek klow plak klow nauang ting kown mih ni dow atawnchow towbowt. <verse eid="EZK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 7:8" />Ang kowh kunmaraura maten dow enni luk kowi alenma ang nauang sunah kown. Enni kowh chowm krang uowi krang iawng hai ang nachet enni tara kown, now enni kowh suiiai kaniaima mih lup maten rakowi ang narip enni kown. <verse eid="EZK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 7:9" />Ang nasana enni kown nadowi bowt, ripra hownia ang nape powt enni kown nadowi bowt. Enni kowh chowm krang uowi krang hai enni pungmadawng kowi kowh suiiai kaniaima mih lup sung ang nape enni kown. Nami khin khe dow ang CHAKRAMANG rip enni khai nowm pami enni natuk bowt kown.<verse eid="EZK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 7:10" />“Sam mü madiah, nami ni dow uang ting khai bowt! Enni kowh piakra dow uang tarowng khai bowt! Enni kowh lup ngak hai bawrira dow thar kown chowbowt. <verse eid="EZK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 7:11" />Maru ngakuüa kowi dow amatni krawi changla nowng mih müa hown naripah kown, now amatni kowh maru iun, dawngthawnguan hai rowsira maten dow natama bowk kown. Naiawng rakowi ia chang bawri büah kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 7:12" />Akhin dow uang na khai bowt, nami ni dow uang tawn khai bowt. Ran krawng ran lai miuüa hang pacham awmrawm lah, asum miuüa paw hang pacham sak ngah lah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Thurai ripra dow amatni bowkbowk luk kowi nauang kla kown chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 7:13" />Mami mukmang dow maru maten vüi chekhai; nami dow nauang ting ngengche kown. Naiawng rakowi uanh sum uanh ran miuüa dow ta sing uowi bowk chepaw nachang kun kown nadowi bowt. Maru ngakuüa dow lowk iachow paw naplai kown nadowi. <verse eid="EZK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 7:14" />Tum pe baw hanow lowra sia kamrütia hown amatni dow nauowi kown. Nachenganchepaw miapaw cham tarü tasen kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh kunmaraura dow amatni bowkbowk luk kowi ang nasunah kown chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 7:15" />“Marow uat kowi dow tasenra uowi khai, now marow lak kowi dow khown hai makowng hawi uowi khai. Marow uat kowi uowi miuüa dow tasenra kowi nacham kowng kown, now marow kowi kowh uowi miuüa dow khown hai makowng hawi hown nakowng kown. <verse eid="EZK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 7:16" />Ta sing uowi miuüa dow hungh towng kowi nacham powt büah kown, now amatni bowkbowk dow amatni kowh ngak rakowi lawngrawi kowi kowh uatur iawng nakar büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 7:17" />Amatni bowkbowk kowh bawng dow nauak kown, now amatni bowkbowk kowh kung dow nachür klukluk kown. <verse eid="EZK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 7:18" />Amatni tarip mih krang natüngla büah kownkow nakhup sala uanh büah kown, now kram lai rakowi amatni dow nachür klukluk kown. Amatni rukrai mih dow amatni lumowr kowi nakhi-ah kown. Lainowmma amatni tarip mih dow natüngla büah kownkow nakhurta sam büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 7:19" />Amatni kowi angak prakowi cham pakla mih dow kuh hai tai chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowh kuh hai tai dow tiama towng nacham kuakah büah kown, naiawngün dow nachangla mawngchawng büah kown. Naiawngün dow CHAKRAMANG kunmaraura hownia nowng lawngah dowi chekhai. Nami dow amatni mu vüi chakkham ran müa khowm asun uang dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 7:20" />Amatni kowh klangiungma mih tatawng müa kuh hai tai rakowi chang bawri büah khai, now nami hown dow asürlawkma mih arup aren hai suiiai kaniaima mih arup aren ün thawpla büah khai. Naiawng rakowi naiawngün kuh hai tai dow ang nasür nalawkta pe kown. <verse eid="EZK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 7:21" />Naiawngün dow kür hown nacham pawla pe bowk kownkow prenlang maru-uüa hai lusa kowi kowh lang ngah mih maru-uüa rut kowi ang naapta pe kown. Nami dow prenlang maru-uüa hai maru ngakuüa nacham sürlawkah kown. <verse eid="EZK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 7:22" />Damrauüa dow ang kowh kim chimsaima mih kowi nauang kup hanow nauang piakah kown. Tawkchedow ang nacham dangta kown; naiawng dow ang pe phawah kown.<verse eid="EZK 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 7:23" />“Pren kowi tatu tasawt hai marow kowi nowng changra tek khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi ang maru-uüa tawm müa lawngha leng kamrütta hüah diah. <verse eid="EZK 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 7:24" />Amatni kowh kim hai üa nakhünta pe kownkow chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh lang nga mih chenchapuüa kowi ang nauang pawla pe kown. Akürma miuüa kowh bawrira dow ang napiakta pe kown, now amatni kowh arup chupra ün dow natasür talawk kown. <verse eid="EZK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 7:25" />Amatni luk kowi takrow takraira uang ting khe dow nakrawi cham thaulangra büah kown. Tawkchedow krum büah kown nadowi. <verse eid="EZK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 7:26" />Phih luk kowi phih nauang kla kown, satang ngak klen kowi satang ngak nata büah kown. Mukmang laiklow ta kown nau rakowi amatni dow nakrawi cham risi büah kown. Tawkche uamowuüa tüngsangra hai ari aiang laiklow ün uowi kown nadowi bowt, now aluchowuüa paw nowng pe prengia kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 7:27" />Manguüa paw nakar kown, mang chapauüa paw amawlawma naown kown, now pren kowi kowh maru-uüa rut dow nachür klukluk kown. Amatni kowh chowm krang uowi krang iawng hai amatni kowi ang nachangah kown, now amatni kak taing iawng hai ang naripah kown. Nami khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 7:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZK 8" />
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim lawnguan kowi Ezekiel kowh mukmang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 8:1" />Takhangra kowi cham uowi mih taruk ning nga taruk la kowi tanga ni khe ang matia kim kowi ang chowm phülü chowdiah. Nami khin khe Juda pren kowi kowh aluchowuüa paw ang ria kowi tawi uowi khai. Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG Thurai kür dow ang luk kowi uang ting khai. <verse eid="EZK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 8:2" />Now lusa maru powm iawng mih ang khi lowk ia chekhai. Aia kowh kelang hownia adak pra dow maih powm iawng chekhai, now kelang hownia aluk prakowi dow kri iawng dow tawk pliplip chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 8:3" />Nami maru dow rut iawng uai iaw hanow ang lu kowi kowh sam uai dowk ang khai. Nami khin khe mukmang kowi Thurai Lümla mih kuang kowi towngla ang khai. Now Jerusalem marow kowi kowh Thurai chup kim alak kowi kowh viadawng kowi kowpawla ang hanow tawngphak pra kowh tapplawt kowi kowtow ang khai. Nakowi dow Thurai lang khowrbownah mih suiiai kaniaima mih arup uowi lowk chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 8:4" />Mukmang kowi kowh Kebar aw pang kowi ang khi-ah mih Israeluüa kowh Thurai kraingra dow nakowi mih ang khi khai.<verse eid="EZK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 8:5" />Thurai tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, tawngphak prakowi sam mü madiah,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi tawngphak prakowi dow ang haimü khai, now tapplawt re-e kowh phuchuara ria kowi Thurai lang khowrbownah mih suiiai kaniaima mih arup ang khi khai. <verse eid="EZK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 8:6" />Now Thurai plan tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, tawng chow kowbüah chang mih en khi khowk bow? Mami re-e suiiai kaniaima mih lup Israeluüa chang mih sam mü madiah. Ang kowh kim chimsaima mih hownia naprütta ang kownkow amatni dow naiawng chang mih chekhai. Now mami lak-e kowh lang suiiai mih lup en nakhi küng tak,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 8:7" />Nami kung kowi dow Thurai chup kim uat kowi kowh viadawng plawt kowi pawla ang khai, now tap bang kowi kowh kua dow tüng ang khai. <verse eid="EZK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 8:8" />Now Thurai tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, tap bang kowi kowh kua mih uarah küng diah,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi tap bang kowi kowh kua dow ang uarah khai, now nakowi dow kimplawt uowi lowk mih ang khi khai.<verse eid="EZK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 8:9" />Now Thurai plan tek ang mih, “Nami kimplawt hownia alak kowi kowkup hanow lup ngak hai suiiai kaniaima mih lup maten Israeluüa chang mih dow kowsam mü madiah,” pakhai. <verse eid="EZK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 8:10" />Naiawng rakowi alak kowi dow ang kowkup hanow ang kowkrawi mü khai, now tap bang maten kowi dow sowr mih hai asür alawkma mih asadua rup ang kowkhi khai. Nami klen kowi Israeluüa chupah mih arup maten powm paw ang khi khai. <verse eid="EZK 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 8:11" />Nakowi dow Israeluüa kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa ranitkawm ia iowng mih ang khi khai. Nami ranitkawm ia dawnglang kowi Saphan chapa Jazania paw tawi uowi khai. Amatni rut kowi dow maikhük towng uowi lowk chi chekhai, now nami maikhük towng hownia dow kuang prakowi maikhük awr pün khai.<verse eid="EZK 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 8:12" />Now CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, Israeluüa kowh aluchowuüa kukpa tawng ngai chow chang mih en khi khowk bow? Amatni bowkbowk dow kim lak kowi kowh arup atekma mih kowi chup büah khai. Amatni dow, ‘Mami pren hownia CHAKRAMANG powt khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi khi a-i dowi chekhai,’ padow tatek büah khai,” pakhai. <verse eid="EZK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 8:13" />Now CHAKRAMANG plan tek ang mih, “Mami lak-e paw lang suiiai mih lup Israeluüa chang mih en nakhi kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 8:14" />Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG chup kim tawngphak pra kowh tapplawt kowi pawla ang khai, now Tammuz thurai vüi kar mih masiuüa hawmh kowi dow tüng ang khai. <verse eid="EZK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 8:15" />Now Thurai plan tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, tawng chow masiuüa hawmh chang mih en khi khowk bow? Nami lak-e kowh lang suiiai mih ang natüng en kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 8:16" />Now CHAKRAMANG chup kim alak kowi kowh viadawng kowi aia pawla ang khai. Nakowi dow CHAKRAMANG chup kim aplawt hai kri hown kowh phuchuara takra kowi kowh viadawng kowi pirmi laitanga ia ngia maru uowi mih dow ang khi khai. Nami maru-uüa dow CHAKRAMANG chup kim prakowi dang pe kung büah khai, now satlawt prakowi dang büah hanow sat kowi dow chup büah khai.<verse eid="EZK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 8:17" />Now CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, mami re-e suiiai kaniaima mih lup Juda prenchakuüa chang mih en khi khowk bow? Mami re-e naiawng kowbüah chang mih amatni tut-e dow anama chekhai. Mami pren kowi angak hown atekma changah mih hownia amatni dow towk ang kunmarau büah khai. Mün khowt chow amatni pe ang rukrai khai mih sam mü madiah. <verse eid="EZK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 8:18" />Naiawng rakowi ang kunmaraura lün pluplup mih dow amatni kowi ang natüng pe kown; Amatni kowi dow ang nasanaah kown nadowi, ripra hownia amatni kowi ang nape powtah kown nadowi bowt. Ang param ria kowi amatni uang lü uang leng chepaw ang nasünta pe kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZK 9" />
  <para style="s">Maru ngakuüa kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 9:1" />Nami kung kowi atünma Thurai tek lai mih dow ang ta khai. Thurai tek mih, “Marow kowi nakrawi rip kownkow ka ana miuüa low, enni bowkbowk dowkla rutchün khawkleng hanow mami re-e uang büa diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="EZK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 9:2" />Now tawngphak pra kowh dang mih aluk tapplawt hownia maru uang kup taruk ia mih ang khi khai; amatni rut kowi dow rutchün khawkleng uowi lowk chi chekhai. Now amatni hown adipükchow mih la hown kowh thawpah tawnguat khupma mih maru paw uang tawi lowk ia chekhai; nami maru dow kelang kowi tanla cha rui müa uanh khai. Amatni dow Thurai chup kim lak kowi uang kup hanow kri hown kowh thawpah mih phuchuara ria kowi uang iowng büah khai.<verse eid="EZK 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 9:3" />Nami khin khe Israel kowh Thurai kraingra dow cherupuüa dawnglang hownia awr tatowng hanow Thurai chup kim aplawt ria kowi dow kowuowi khai. Now adipükchow mih la hown kowh thawpah tawnguat khupma mih maru kowi dow CHAKRAMANG hawah khai. <verse eid="EZK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 9:4" />Now CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Jerusalem marow kowi en kowkrawi len diah. Now marow kowi kowh suiiai kaniaima mih lup rakowi sak kowi rau kowh kar hown nguk hown uowi miuüa maten kowi dow kau kowi plikla pe amat müa diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="EZK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 9:5" />Nami kung kowi dow maru taruk ia mih kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe lai mih ang ta khai. CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Marow kowi paimi maru kung kowtawi krawi büa diah. Kau kowi amat lawi uowi dowi mih maten kowi krawi saita büa diah. Mia kowi paw hangkow sana büah, now mia kowi paw ripra hownia hangkow pe powtah diah. <verse eid="EZK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 9:6" />Lawngtang matang, malauüa klanguüa, masiuüa kachakuüa hai ngeuchu ngeucha bowkbowk kowi saita büa diah. Tawkchedow kau kowi kowh amat lawi uowi miuüa kowi dow hangkow kakla büah. Thurai chup kim hownia naiawng dow uown chang büa diah,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi nami maru taruk ia dow Thurai chup kim ria kowi kowh uowi mih aluchow 70 ia kowi hown uown tarowng maru sai büah khai.<verse eid="EZK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 9:7" />Nami kung kowi Thurai plan tek pe mih, “Thurai chup kim dow sürlawkah büa diah; uak dow Thurai chup kim viadawng kowi atekma uang towah büa diah. Tarü büah,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi nami maru taruk ia mih dow nami hownia lawt hanow marow kowi krawi sai maru büah khai. <verse eid="EZK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 9:8" />Naiawng kowbüah cham krawi sai maru khe ang malowkchow Thurai chup kim kowi ta uowi khai. Nami khin khe tabawkah krawm now kar se, “Uh, CHAKRAMANG Thurai, en kowh kunmarau hown Jerusalem kowi kowh ta lat mih Israeluüa maten kowi en saita bowk kown chekhai bow?” Padow ang tek khai.<verse eid="EZK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 9:9" />Now Thurai mih, “Judauüa hai Israeluüa kowh angak lainowmma hu khai bowt. Paprenma kowi tatu tasawt tek khai bowt. Marow kowi dow lup ngak kangowh towbowt. Amatni dow, ‘Mami pren hownia CHAKRAMANG powt khai bowt. Tawng ngai chow own mih aia khi dowi bowt,’ pakhai. <verse eid="EZK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 9:10" />Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi mih ang nasanaah kown nadowi, ripra hownia ang nape powtah kown nadowi. Amatni kowh angak sung dow amatni luk kowi ang nauang pe tingah kown,” padow klang ang khai. <verse eid="EZK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 9:11" />Nami kung kowi adipükchow mih la hown kowh thawpah mih tawnguat khupma mih maru dow uang plan hanow, “En pe ang ana mih iawng lup dow ang ki changta khowk,” padow Thurai kowi uang tek pe khai.<verse eid="EZK 9:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZK 10" />
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim hownia CHAKRAMANG kraingra powt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 10:1" />Nami kung kowi mukmang kowi dow cherupuüa luk kowi kowh tabe mih prakowi ang tang mü khai, now nami tabe mih luk kowi dow asung khakma mih hua hown kowh thawpah mih mang chowm rah powm iawng ang khi lowk. <verse eid="EZK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 10:2" />Now adipükchow mih la hown kowh thawpah mih tawnguat khupma mih maru kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Cherupuüa dak kowi kowh taui lutlut mih lawngkua khawk pungmadawng kowi en mih kowkowi diah. Now cherupuüa dawnglang hownia pre rut pre pra mairing kowchawmah hanow Jerusalem marow luk kowi uetah diah,” pape khai. Nahanow adipükchow mih la hown kowh thawpah mih tawnguat khupma mih maru dow ang khi khe nakowi dow kowkup khai.<verse eid="EZK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 10:3" />Cherupuüa dow Thurai chup kim mrawkphak prakowi iowng khai, now nami maru kowkup mih khin khe alak kowi kowh viadawng dow uangnim hown atekma chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 10:4" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG kraingra dow cherupuüa luk hownia awr tatowng hanow Thurai chup kimplawt kowi kowkowi khai. Nami khin khe Thurai chup kim dow uangnim hown tek khai, now CHAKRAMANG kraingra nowi dow viadawng kowi atekma chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 10:5" />Now cherupuüa kowh lap tün dow prang kowi kowh viadawng hownia khowm padow taah khai. Nami tün dow lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek lai mih tün iawng chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 10:6" />Adipükchow mih la hown kowh thawpah mih tawnguat khupma mih maru kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Cherupuüa dawnglang kowi kowkowi diah, now lawngkua khawk takra hownia kowpaw mairing diah,” pakhai. Nami khin khe nami maru dow lawngkua khawk pungmadawng kowi kowkup khai, now lawngkua khawk ria kowi kowiowng khai. <verse eid="EZK 10:6" /><verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="EZK 10:7-8" />Cherupuüa lap krüa kowi dow lusa maru kowh iawng rut uowi bowk chekhai. Now cherupuüa pungmadawng kowi lowk ia mih dow maih prakowi haiiaw rut khai, now maih dow pawah sangrum hanow adipükchow mih la hown kowh thawpah mih tawnguat khupma mih maru rut kowi dow ap pe khai. Nami maih pawla hanow nami maru dow nami hownia uang lawt khai.<verse eid="EZK 10:7-8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 10:9" />Nami kung kowi dow ang tang mü hanow cherupuüa ria towng lawngkua khawk uowi lowk chi mih ang khi khai. Lawngkua khawk maten dow asung khakma mih hua iawng anowi tawk pluplup chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 10:10" />Nami lawngkua khawk tali klüng mih dow apowmsang chekhai; akhawk lak kowi akhawk kutplan uowi lowk chi mih powm iawng chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 10:11" />Cherupuüa dow mang mih khin khe amatni nau prakowi atengma lün büah khai. Amatni lün mih khin khe akeng prakowi taplang büah dowi chekhai. Cherupuüa kowh lumowr dang prakowi naiawngün lawngkua khawk paw tawi lün khai; lün mih khin khe tawng prakowi paw taplang kla dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 10:12" />Amatni kowh lawngkua khawk tali klüng mih kowi, buk kowi, kumlawng kowi, rut kowi hai alap kowi ün mik atekma chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 10:13" />Now amia iawng mih chünchü nami lawngkua khawk kowi, “Taui lutlut mih lawngkua khawk,” padow atünma hawah mih dow ang ta khai. <verse eid="EZK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 10:14" />Cherupuüa maten kowh dow lumowr uowi tali klüng chi chekhai: Cherup lumowr lowk chi, lusa maru lumowr lowk chi, krangsi lumowr lowk chi, now uamu lumowr lowk chi chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 10:15" />Now nami cherupuüa dow aluk prakowi awr tatowng khai. Nami cherupuüa dow Kebar aw pang kowi kowh ang khi-ah mih kaurawng uaramchak hawmh chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 10:16" />Cherupuüa che mang now amatni ria kowi kowh lawngkua khawk paw tawi lün khai. Krawng hownia awr tatowng kownkow cherupuüa che rowng lap now lawngkua khawk paw amatni ria kowi tawi lün khai. <verse eid="EZK 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 10:17" />Kaurawng uaramchak hawmh kowh lümla dow nami lawngkua khawk lak kowi uowi mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi cherupuüa che tanai now lawngkua khawk paw tawi tanai khai, now cherupuüa che tatowng now lawngkua khawk paw tawi tatowng khai.<verse eid="EZK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 10:18" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG kraingra dow Thurai chup kim kimplawt hownia powt hanow cherupuüa luk kowi kowuowi khai. <verse eid="EZK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 10:19" />Now ang khi khe dow nami cherupuüa mih rowng lap hanow krawng hownia aluk prakowi awr tatowng khai, now lawngkua khawk paw amatni hown tawi tatowng khai. Amatni dow Thurai chup kim satlawt pra kowh tapplawt kowi kowtanai khai, now Israel kowh Thurai kraingra dow nami cherupuüa luk kowi tawi uowi khai.<verse eid="EZK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 10:20" />Nami cherupuüa dow Kebar aw pang kowi kowh ang khi-ah mih kaurawng uaramchak hawmh chekhai. Amatni kowi dow Israel kowh Thurai dak kowi ang khi-ah khai. Now amatni dow cherupuüa chekhai pami ang tuk khai bowt. <verse eid="EZK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 10:21" />Amatni bowkbowk kowh dow lumowr uowi tali klüng chi, now alap paw uowi tali klüng chi chekhai. Amatni kowh lap krüa kowi dow lusa maru kowh rut iawng arut uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 10:22" />Amatni kowh lumowr powm dow Kebar aw pang kowi kowh ang khi-ah mih powm iawng chekhai. Amatni bowkbowk dow pur prakowi atengma mang büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EZK 11" />
  <para style="s">Israel aluchowuüa kowh ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 11:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG lümla dow krowngla ang now Thurai chup kim satlawt pra kowh tapplawt re-e kowpawla ang khai. Nami tapplawt re-e dow kachakuüa uowi pirmi laitanga ia mih ang khi khai. Nami pirmi laitanga ia pungmadawng kowi dow Azzur chapa Jazania hai Benaia chapa Pelatia iüah paw tawi uowi khai; Jazania hai Pelatia iüah dow Israeluüa kowh aluchow chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 11:2" />Now CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, Jerusalem marow kowi chang lup ngak kownkow kamrüt mih hai maru kowi pe prengia ngak miuüa dow nami maru-uüa chowbowt. <verse eid="EZK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 11:3" />Amatni dow, ‘Mami Jerusalem marow dow puh iawng chekhai, now a-i dow puh lak kowi kowh chaknga uowi mih iawng athaulangma chekhai. Kim chang khin iung mih kawmat chowbowt’ pakhai. <verse eid="EZK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 11:4" />Naiawng rakowi aw maru chapa, naiawngün maru-uüa kowi kingküala mih laiklow kowtek pe dit,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 11:5" />Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG lümla mih ang tut-e uang uowi khai, now maiawng dow pe tek ang khai, “CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Aw Israeluüa, tawng chow enni tek mih ang tuk. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni sakdawng kowi kowh tuak maten ang tuk chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 11:6" />Mami marow kowi kowh maru kawmma kowi enni saiah khai, now tiama ün maru uak atekma enni changah khai,’ pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 11:7" />“Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, ‘Mami marow dow puh iawng chekhai nowm. Nachenganchepaw marow kowi kowh enni saiah mih maru-uüa dow puh lak kowi kowh uowi mih chaknga iawng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi mami puh hownia ang khowngta enni kown. <verse eid="EZK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 11:8" />Enni lang kramah mih tasenra dow ang nauang pawla enni kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai, mami laiklow ang tek khowk. <verse eid="EZK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 11:9" />Marow hownia ang naprütta enni now prenlang maru-uüa rut kowi ang nacham ap enni kown, now ang nape enni ripra kown. <verse eid="EZK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 11:10" />Tasenra kowi saidawng hown enni nakowng kown, Israel pren paprenma kowi dow rihi mowr pat bowkbowk kowi ang narip enni kown. Nami khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami enni natuk bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 11:11" />Mami marow mih enni vüi puh iawng natakhula enni kown nadowi, now enni paw puh lak kowi kowh chaknga iawng thaulangma naown kown nadowi. Israel pren paprenma kowi dow rihi mowt pat bowkbowk kowi ang narip enni kown. <verse eid="EZK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 11:12" />Nami khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami enni natuk bowt kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh rirow hai ang kowh ari aiang enni chün dowi chekhai. Nami lak-e enni riaret kowi kowh akeng chenchapuüa rirow iawng dow enni tawi mang khai,’” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 11:13" />Naiawng ang tek lai reng tak khe Benaia chapa Pelatia dow kowng khai. Nami khin khe tabawkah krawm now kar se, “Uh, CHAKRAMANG Thurai, ta lat mih Israeluüa maten kowi en saita bowk kown chekhai bow?” padow atünma ang tek khai.<verse eid="EZK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cham takhang miuüa vüi sakowmra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 11:14" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 11:15" />“Aw maru chapa, en, en tainau-uüa hai akeng pren kowi kowh cham takhang mih Israeluüa lawnguan kowi Jerusalem kowi kowh ta uowi miuüa tek mih, ‘Cham takhang miuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowi nachup kown mih pren hownia lainowmma la khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowh pren CHAKRAMANG pe a-i mih chowbowt,’ pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 11:16" />“Naiawng rakowi ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek en mih lai maten dow cham takhang mih en maru-uüa kowi tek pe diah: ‘Akeng chenchapuüa tut-e cham saah enni mih hai pren towng kowi cham uet enni mih dow ang chekhai. Nachenganchepaw enni cham uowi rah towng kowi ia chupla ang kownkow ang matia natawi uowila enni reng kown. <verse eid="EZK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 11:17" />Akeng chenchapuüa pungmadawng hownia ang nakua nalawmah enni kown; enni cham uowi rah pren maten hownia ang nauang plan pawla enni iawk kown, now Israel pren mih dow enni kowi ang naplan pe enni iawk kown,’ pape diah. <verse eid="EZK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 11:18" />Amatni dow nakowi nakowplan hanow asürlawkma mih arup aren hai suiiai kaniaima mih arup maten asaima nahenta büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 11:19" />Amatni kowi sak sar hai lümla sar ang napeah kown. Amatni kowh chün lai dowi mih hua iawng akhawtma mih sak dow chün lai mih nga iawng anümchow ang nachang pe kown. <verse eid="EZK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 11:20" />Nahanow ang kowh rirow iawng namang büah bowt kown, now ang kowh ari aiang paw kaneuma nachün büah bowt kown. Amatni dow ang maru nachowng büah kown, now ang dow amatni kowh Thurai nachowng bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 11:21" />Nachenganchepaw asürlawkma mih arup aren hai suiiai kaniaima mih arup prakowi saktuak uowi reng tak miuüa kowi dow ang naripah kown, amatni kowh lup sung dow ang napeah kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem hownia CHAKRAMANG kraingra powt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 11:22" />CHAKRAMANG ki tek lai kung kowi dow cherupuüa mih rowng lap khai. Amatni ria kowi dow lawngkua khawk ün tawi uowi reng chekhai. Now Israeluüa kowh Thurai kraingra paw amatni luk kowi tawi uowi reng chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 11:23" />CHAKRAMANG kraingra dow marow hownia tatowng hanow marow satlawt pra kowh hungh luk kowi kowtanai khai.<verse eid="EZK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 11:24" />Nami kung kowi dow Thurai Lümla mih krowngla ang khai, now mukmang kowi dow Babulawn pren kowi kowh cham takhang miuüa tut-e kowplan pawla ang khai. Nami kung kowi dow ang khi-ah mih mukmang dow chur khai. <verse eid="EZK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 11:25" />Now mukmang kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG tüng ang mih maten cham takhang miuüa tut-e ang tek pe khai.<verse eid="EZK 11:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EZK 12" />
  <para style="s">Takhangla kown mih Amatra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 12:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. <verse eid="EZK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 12:2" />CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, kingküa ang reng mih Israel chenchap dawng kowi en tawi uowi khai. Israeluüa kowh dow namüla kown mih mik uowi chepaw khi büah dowi chekhai, now nasüntala kown mih param uowi chepaw ta büah dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow kingküa ang reng mih chenchap chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 12:3" />“Naiawng rakowi aw maru chapa, pren lakma kowi cham prütta kown khe kowh iawng en kowh uanh mih thupah ne diah, now ni-e khe amatni pur kowi khi en iawng cham tarü diah. En uowi rah hownia akeng kowi cham kowi diah. Nami khi hanow amatni dow kingküa mih chenchap chekhai lowmow pami natuk büah ün tarawng. <verse eid="EZK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 12:4" />En thupta hüah mih uanh dow ni-e amatni khi khe uang lawtla diah. Now iak pra khe dow alakma kowi cham takhang kown khe kowh iawng amatni pur kowi cham tarü diah. <verse eid="EZK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 12:5" />Amatni pur kowi dow kimbang mih ukah hanow nami kimbang kua hownia dow en kowh uanthup mih uang lawtla diah. <verse eid="EZK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 12:6" />En kowh uanthup dow amatni khi en iawng en pangkawt kowi tangla diah, now uar-e khe naiawngün dow marow uat kowi lawtla diah. Now en matia pren kowi kowh krawng khila dowi kownkow en kowh mik mih pumla diah. Naiawng ang pe chang en mih dow Israel chenchapuüa vüi amatra chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 12:7" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tek ang iawng ang chang khai bowt. Pren lakma kowi cham takhang kown khe kowh iawng ang kowh uanthup mih ni-e khe ang uang lawtla khai. Nahanow sat kup khe dow rut hown kimbang mih ang ukah khai. Now pangkawt kowi ang tangla uanthup hanow uar-e khe ang cham tarü khai. Naiawng ang chang mih maten dow maru mü ang mowklowk khe chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 12:8" />Now auai rau CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 12:9" />“Aw maru chapa, tawng chow en chang mih kingküa ang reng mih Israel chenchapuüa lünta en dowi bow? <verse eid="EZK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 12:10" />Amatni kowi dow maiawng tek pe diah, ‘CHAKRAMANG tek mami amatra dow Jerusalem kowi kowh mang Zedekia hai Israel pren kowi kowh maru-uüa maten vüi pe,’ pape diah. <verse eid="EZK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 12:11" />Now maiawng tek pe diah, ‘Ang dow enni vüi amatra chekhai. Ang changah mih iawng enni luk kowi nauang phaw kown. Enni mih pren lakma kowi nacham takhang nowm kown chekhai,’ pape diah.<verse eid="EZK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 12:12" />“Amatni kowh mang khowm padow uar-e khe aia kowh uanthup pangkawt kowi tangla hanow aia vüi ukah mih kimbang kua hownia nalawt kown. Aia dow pren kowi kowh krawng khila dowi kownkow napumla mik kown. <verse eid="EZK 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 12:13" />Tawkchedow aia vüi ang nachak pe leng kown, now aia dow ang kowh leng kowi natasowk kown. Aia kowi dow Kaldaiuüa pren Babulawn kowi ang napawla kown, now nakowi dow aia nakowng kown. Tawkchedow tawngpaw khila kown nadowi. <verse eid="EZK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 12:14" />Aia riaret kowi uowi mih maten, aia kowh lup chang mih hai aia kowh siphaiuüa maten kowi pren tali nui kowi ang nacham uetah kown. Amatni kowi dow parla saidawng se ang nakrawiah kown. <verse eid="EZK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 12:15" />Amatni kowi dow chen towng chap towng hai pren towng kowi ang nacham uetah kown. Nami khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 12:16" />Tawkchedow amatni cham uowi rah towng kowi amatni kowh chowm krang uowi krang suiiai kaniaima mih nataphuangla büah kownkow tasenra, khown hai makowng hawi hownia ang nape plaiah ne kown. Nahanow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 12:17" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek mih, <verse eid="EZK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 12:18" />“Aw maru chapa, en cha en kham khe kram hown chür se chür se chaah khamah diah. <verse eid="EZK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 12:19" />Pren kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi maiawng tek pe diah: Mami dow Israel pren kowi hai Jerusalem marow kowi kowh maru-uüa lawnguan CHAKRAMANG tek mih chekhai. CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Amatni dow tawmpa kram hown nacha chakkham kown, now amawlawma hown nakham tui büah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nakowi kowh uowi miuüa tachang nowng rakowi amatni kowh pren dow ransu-uüa mih tengiow tengklaima nata towla pe hüah kown. <verse eid="EZK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 12:20" />Maru kawm atekma mih marow maten dow natapiak kown, now pren mih paw akhaw aklaima naown kown. Nami khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah bowt kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 12:21" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 12:22" />“Aw maru chapa, Israel pren kowi maiawng mih lai kiang uowi khai, ‘Ni taih kowi chowtlowt, mukmang laiklow dow katpaw uang tachi dowi,’ pakhai. <verse eid="EZK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 12:23" />Naiawng rakowi maiawng hai amatni kowi kowtek pe diah, CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, ‘Enni kiangah mih laiklow dow ang nataingta enni bowt kown, now Israel pren kowi naiawng mih laiklow dow miapaw natek kown nadowi bowt,’ pape diah. Now nami takcha kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah, ‘Khin mih uang ting khai bowt, now mukmang maten paw kawmat dow nauang tachi bowt kown,’ pape diah. <verse eid="EZK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 12:24" />Israel maru-uüa pungmadawng kowi dow dai lai mukmang nauowi kown nadowi bowt, now pur prakowi kowh lawnguan kowi nape awmrawmah kownkow dai lai hawra mük paw uowi kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 12:25" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai. Ang che tek now nami iawng naphaw ngengche kown. Naiawng rakowi aw kingküa mih chenchapuüa, ang tekah mih iawng enni chownglawng kowi nauang tachi ngengche kown; kra dowi bowt tham. Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 12:26" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 12:27" />“Aw maru chapa, Israeluüa tek mih, ‘En khi-ah mih mukmang dow kawmat kowh uang phaw kown mih nadowi, auai khe akrama kung kowi kowh uang phaw kown mih laiklow chowtaih,’ pakhai. <verse eid="EZK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 12:28" />Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow kowtek pe diah, CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, ‘Ang kowh laiklow nauang tachi kown mih dow kra dowi bowt chekhai; Ang tek iawng dow nauang tachi kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai mami laiklow ang tek khowk,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="EZK 12:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EZK 13" />
  <para style="s">Risi iuauüa vüi CHAKRAMANG ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 13:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 13:2" />“Aw maru chapa, Israel pren kowi kawmat kowh krawi tek lai mih risi iuauüa kowi kingküa se en mih kowtek lai diah. Amatni sak kowi uowi iawng krawi tek lai mih risi iuauüa kowi maiawng kowtek pe dit, ‘CHAKRAMANG laiklow sünta büa diah. <verse eid="EZK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 13:3" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih maiawng: Risi bualauüa kowh piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow! Amatni dow khi mukmang dowi chepaw amatni sak kowi uowi iawng krawi tek lai büah khai,’ pape diah.<verse eid="EZK 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 13:4" />“Aw Israeluüa, enni kowh risiuüa dow marow tapiak khowk mih kowi kowh krawi kram chak mih brenkhui iawng chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 13:5" />Enni kowh risiuüa dow Israel chenchapuüa kowh tap takhue khowk mih kowi tow pe kangchawng mih dowi chekhai, now raw paw rawah büah dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG kowh ni kowi tasen khin khe Israeluüa dow nanowng talawng kown nadowi. <verse eid="EZK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 13:6" />Amatni dow mukmang lawnguan kowi küa dai khai, now mü hawra hanow küa dai khai. Amatni kowi ang tek pe dowi chepaw, ‘CHAKRAMANG tek,’ padow cham krawi tek büah khai. Nami kung kowi paw amatni dow amatni kowh lai nauang tachi kown mih sakowm büah khai. <verse eid="EZK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 13:7" />Amatni kowh mukmang hai lai phuang dow daila chowtaih. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh laiklow kowi ang laiklow pahai cham krawi tek büah khai. Tawkche amatni kowi ang tek pe dowi chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 13:8" />“Naiawng rakowi ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, ‘Enni tek dai lai hai khi mukmang dai rakowi ang nakingküa enni kown. <verse eid="EZK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 13:9" />Mukmang dai khi miuüa hai tek dai lai miuüa kowi dow ang napeah ripra kown. Amatni dow ang maru-uüa uowi rah kowi natawi uowi kown nadowi bowt; amatni kowh ming dow Israel chenchapuüa ming tang bowih kowi natawi uowi kown nadowi bowt, now Israel pren kowi paw nauang tawi ia plan kown nadowi bowt. Nami khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG Thurai pami enni natuk bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 13:10" />Risi iuauüa dow ang maru-uüa kowi tiama tawi pra pawla khai, thaulangra uowi dowi chepaw, “Thaulangra uowi,” padow ang maru-uüa kowi daiah khai. Amatni dow khawt dowi mih tap kowi krawi plik thundi hanow akhawtma nowng chang pahai ka tuak khai. <verse eid="EZK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 13:11" />Naiawng rakowi risi iuauüa kowi kowtek pe dit, amatni kowh tap dow natakhue kown taih. Uangchak kri ang nape uangah kown, ria mang ang nauang pe klaah kown, now ang nauang chin pe liku hanow nami tap dow natapiak kown. <verse eid="EZK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 13:12" />Nami tap takhue mih khin khe dow, “Enni plik pe thundi mih tap tawng chow mrawkra uowi?” padow nami risi iuauüa kowi maru nalüntaah kown.<verse eid="EZK 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 13:13" />“‘Naiawng rakowi ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai, ang tek khowk. Ang kunmaraura dow liku iawng ang nauang chin pe kown, mapaw ang sak-ih dowi mih dow ria mang iawng ang nauang pe klaah kown, now ang kunmarau hown uangchak kri iawng nami tap ang nakhueta pe kown. <verse eid="EZK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 13:14" />Risi iuauüa plik pe thundi mih tap dow ang nakhueta pe hanow achüng khowm khi dowi pat krawng hown aprem sang ang natow pe kown. Nami tap takhue mih khin khe dow amatni paw natawi tanüm hanow nakowng büah kown. Nami khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami enni natuk bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 13:15" />Nami tap hai nami tap kowi kowh plik thundi miuüa luk kowi ang kunmaraura maten dow ang nauang klai pe kown. Nami khin khe dow maiawng ang natek enni kown, “Nami tap dow uowi dowi bowt, now nami tap kowi kowh plik thundi miuüa paw uowi dowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 13:16" />Israel pren kowi kowh Jerusalem maru-uüa tut-e tek lai reng mih risi iuauüa uowi dowi bowt, thaulangra uowi dowi chepaw thaulangra mukmang khi miuüa uowi dowi bowt,” padow ang natek enni kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai, mami laiklow ang tek khowk,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="EZK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masiuüa risi iua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 13:17" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG plan tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, kawmat dow en chenchap masiuüa hawmh amatni sak kowi uowi iawng krawi tek lai miuüa kowi kingküa hown en mih kowtek lai diah. Amatni dow risi nadowi chepaw risi iawng krawi tek lai büah khai. Naiawng rakowi maiawng kowtek pe diah. <verse eid="EZK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 13:18" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, ‘Maiawngün masiuüa hawmh kowh piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow! Enni masiuüa hawmh dow lawngtang lah ngeuüa lah maru luk kowi nau iawng nowng changla alow kownkow rut kowi laphawi hai lu kowi lu mum müa enni thawp pe khai. Ang maru-uüa kowh asak dow enni saiah khai, now enni matia dow napiak dowi kown mih enni ka tuak bow? <verse eid="EZK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 13:19" />Püm pre sum rutphachow hai kawm pre sum pachow rakowi ang maru-uüa pur kowi enni nü ang klowk ang dowi; enni pe ang rukrai khai. Sünta dai lai kown nau mih ang maru-uüa tut-e enni küa pe dai hanow kowng tataing dowi mih kowi enni kowngta khai, now sing kown tataing dowi miuüa kowi dow enni pe singah khai.<verse eid="EZK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 13:20" />“‘Naiawng rakowi ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek khowk, uakling kowi kowh maru khümah iawng dow laphawi hown maru-uüa kowi enni krawi khümah khai. Nami laphawi dow lainowmma ang sui mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi naiawngün laphawi dow enni rut hownia ang nathükta enni kown. Uakling kowi iawng enni khümah mih maru-uüa kowi ang nalawtta enni kown. <verse eid="EZK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 13:21" />Enni kowh lu mum müa uanchow ün ang nasekta enni hanow enni rut hownia ang maru-uüa kowi ang nalawngah kown. Amatni dow enni rut kowi enni low iawng nauowi kown nadowi bowt. Nami khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami enni natuk bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 13:22" />Ang peah arau kown ang nau dowi miuüa kowi enni küa pe dai hanow enni piak pe sak khai, now maru ngakuüa kowi dow naplaila dowi kownkow enni tawi tangila hanow nachang lup ngak ngamlam kown mih enni peah kür khai. <verse eid="EZK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 13:23" />Naiawng rakowi mukmang dai enni khi mih hai dai lai tek dow ang nachurta enni bowt kown. Enni rut hownia ang maru-uüa kowi dow ang nalawngah bowt kown. Nami khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami enni natuk bowt kown,’” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EZK 14" />
  <para style="s">Chup arup rakowi Israel aluchowuüa kowh ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 14:1" />Nami kung kowi Israeluüa kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa pre sum ia dow ang tut-e uang khai. Amatni dow nauang lünta ang lai kownkow ang pur kowi uang chowm büah khai. <verse eid="EZK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 14:2" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG laiklow mih ang tut-e uang ting khai. <verse eid="EZK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 14:3" />CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, nami lawngtang aluchowuüa kawmat paw sakdawng hownia chup arup büah reng chekhai, now amatni kowi kowh angak prakowi pawla mih uanh paw amatni matia kim kowi towah büah reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni uang lünta chepaw ang naklangah kown nadowi. <verse eid="EZK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 14:4" />Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi en natek pe kown mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih maiawng: Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi mia iawng mih chünchü sakdawng hownia chup arup hanow angak prakowi pawla mih uanh aia matia kim kowi tow mih maru nauowi kown, now akung kowi dow risi tut-e uang mih nauowi kown. Naiawng mih maru kowi dow ang CHAKRAMANG, ang matia ngengche mih aia kowh arup aren rakowi tating tataing iawng ang naklangah kown. <verse eid="EZK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 14:5" />Israeluüa dow amatni kowh arup aren kowi chupra kowi ang kowi nuata ang mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ang tut-e nauang planla büah iawk kownkow naiawng dow ang naklangah kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 14:6" />“Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa kowi en natek pe kown mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih maiawng: Planta sak büa diah. Enni kowh arup aren hownia uang plan büa diah, now enni kowh suiiai kaniaima mih lup maten nuata büa diah. <verse eid="EZK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 14:7" />Israeluüa chepaw Israel pren kowi kowh uowi mih prenlang maru chepaw amia iawng mih chow ang hownia lang talang khai, sakdawng hownia chup arup hai angak prakowi aia kowi pawla mih uanh aia matia kim kowi towah khai, now nauang lünta ang kownkow akung kowi dow risi tut-e uang khai. Naiawng chekhai hanow ang CHAKRAMANG, ang matia ngengche mih aia kowi naklangah kown. <verse eid="EZK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 14:8" />Aia kowi dow maru vüi amatra ang nachangla kown. Aia kowi dow ang nakingküaah kown, now ang maru-uüa pungmadawng hownia aia kowi dow ang nalangta kown. Nami khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami enni natuk bowt kown.<verse eid="EZK 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 14:9" />“‘Now naiawng mih maru kowi risi che hawt klangah khai kowh chalow now nami risi kowi dow ang kuanah mih chekhai pami tukah reng diah. Akung kowi dow nami risi kowi paw ang nakingküaah kown, now ang maru Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia nami risi kowi paw ang napiakta kown. <verse eid="EZK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 14:10" />Naiawng mih <char style="w">risi iua</char> hai risi iua tut-e krawi paw prengia mih maru dow amatchi kowh angak rakowi pre ia trui naka ripra kown. <verse eid="EZK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 14:11" />Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih ang hownia nacham powt kown nadowi bowt, now tiama ngak prakowi paw nacham mang büah kown nadowi bowt. Amatni kowh angak maten hown amatni dow natasür talawk büah kown nadowi bowt. Amatni dow ang maru nachowng büah bowt kown, now ang dow amatni kowh Thurai naown bowt kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai, mami laiklow ang tek khowk,’” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem kowh kramra uowima mih ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 14:12" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 14:13" />“Aw maru chapa, maiawng dowkah diah sik: pren lowk mih dow kaah sakowm dowi hai lainowmma chang angak hanow kingküa ang khai. Naiawng rakowi nami pren kowi kingküa hown ang ripah mih chowbowt: Amatni kowh chakkham kramra tia dow ang pitta pe khowk, now nami pren kowi dow ang uang chin pe khown hanow maru hai tawncher kowi ang kowngta pe khai. <verse eid="EZK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 14:14" />Nami khin khe nami pren kowi Noa, Daniel hai Jawb büah sum ia tawi uowi khai chepaw amatni tachi tanawm mih rakowi amatni krowngchow taih nanowng talawng kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="EZK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 14:15" />“Now maiawng dowkah diah sik: Nami pren kowi kaurawng uaramchak hawmh kowi ang kowchin pe khai, now nami kaurawng uaramchak hawmh mih nami pren kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi krawi kowngta hanow pren dow akhaw aklaima towah khai. Naiawng rakowi nami pren dow lainowmma kramra uowi khai, now kaurawng uaramchak hawmh kowi kram kowh nami pren iawng miapaw kownowng mang kownowng kat dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 14:16" />Nami khin khe nami pren kowi Noa, Daniel hai Jawb büah tawi uowi chepaw amatni kowh chama chapa kowi khowm padow nanowng lawngla büah kown nadowi; amatni krowngchow taih naplai kown. Tawkche pren mih dow akhaw aklaima nauowi kown. Ang kowh sak lüklau se ang tek khowk.<verse eid="EZK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 14:17" />“Now maiawng dowkah diah sik: nami pren kowi kingküaah kownkow ang uang pawla tasenra hanow, ‘Pren kowi bowkbowk re-e tasenra pacham uowi lah,’ padow ang tek pe khai. Now nami pren kowi kowh maru hai tawncher dow ang saita pe bowk khai. <verse eid="EZK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 14:18" />Nami khin khe nami pren kowi Noa, Daniel hai Jawb büah tawi uowi chepaw amatni kowh chama chapa kowi khowm padow nanowng lawngla büah kown nadowi; amatni krowngchow taih naplai kown.<verse eid="EZK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 14:19" />“Now maiawng dowkah iawk diah sik: nami pren kowi dow ang uang chin pe makowng hawi khai, now nami pren kowi kowh maru hai tawncher nakowngta pe kownkow ang kowh kunmaraura dow nami pren luk kowi ang uang klai pe khai <verse eid="EZK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 14:20" />Nami khin khe nami pren kowi Noa, Daniel hai Jawb büah tawi uowi chepaw amatni kowh chama chapa kowi khowm padow nanowng lawngla büah kown nadowi; amatni tachi tanawm mih rakowi amatni krowngchow taih naplai kown. Ang kowh sak lüklau se ang tek khowk.<verse eid="EZK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 14:21" />“Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai kawmat ang tek khowk, Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi dow kramra uowima mih ripra tali klüng ang nauang pawla pe kown; nakowi kowh maru hai tawncher maten kowi nakowngta kownkow tasenra, khown, kaurawng uaramchak hai makowng hawi ang nauang pawla pe kown. Nami khin khe mün khowt chow nanga kown mih tuk tekah dowi mowr chekhai! <verse eid="EZK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 14:22" />Nachenganchepaw nakowi kowh maru dow nata sing uowi ne kown, now ta sing uowi miuüa kowi dow marow hownia nauang lawtla kown. Nami maru-uüa dow Babulawn pren kowi enni tut-e nauang ting kown, now nami maru-uüa kowh chowm krang uowi krang hai alup ala angakma mih dow enni nakhi kown. Nami khin khe dow Jerusalem maru-uüa luk kowi kowh ang uang pawla pe phih mih lawnguan kowi enni naka sakklamra bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 14:23" />Nami maru-uüa kowh chowm krang uowi krang hai alup ala enni khi hanow enni naka sakklamra bowt kown, now auan uowi dowi kowi tawngpaw ang chang dowi chekhai pami enni natuk bowt kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EZK 15" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem maru-uüa dow asun uang dowi mih grep ruih iawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 15:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 15:2" />“Aw maru chapa, kaurawng kowi kowh akeng mih singh lak-e grep ruih lang iung khai bow? <verse eid="EZK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 15:3" />Lakkeah mih sia nathawpla kownkow grep ruih kowi maru tawngah kengah kakat tak bow? Nachangla uanh bat müa kownkow grep ruih kowi maru tawngah kengah kakat tak bow? <verse eid="EZK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 15:4" />Grep ruih dow sawp iawng maih kowi suaah now tui mowr taih nauowi kown. Tawkche kam kung kowi dow maivia mih nakaah tawngkeng kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 15:5" />Grep ruih dow maih kowi tikah dowi rawn khowm padow kaah atawng akeng dowi chekhai, now maih kamah kung kowi ngam padow asung lang e ngamlam chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 15:6" />“CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih maiawng: Kaurawng kowi kowh singh pungmadawng kowi grep ruih dow sawp iawng maih kowi ang tikah khai. Nami iawng dow Jerusalem kowi kowh uowi miuüa kowi paw maih kowi ang nanawmah kown. <verse eid="EZK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 15:7" />Amatni kowi dow ang naripah kown. Amatni dow maih hownia uang nowng lawt khai chepaw maih kowi naplan kam iawk kown. Amatni kowi ang kingküaah mih khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami enni natuk bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 15:8" />Amatni dow ang kaah sakowm iawng uowi büah dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi pren mih dow akhaw aklaima ang nachangah kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai, mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EZK 16" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow dow chang iang mih masiuüa iawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 16:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 16:2" />“Aw maru chapa, Jerusalem kowi aia kowh suiiai kaniaima mih lup lawnguan kowi kowphuang pe dit,” pakhai. <verse eid="EZK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 16:3" />Now CHAKRAMANG dow maiawng pe tek ang khai, “Jerusalem, en kowh kim hai en kowh dia rah dow Kananuüa pren kowi chekhai; en pa dow Amawr chenchap chekhai, now en u dow Hit chenchap chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 16:4" />En uang dia mih ni khe hiah en dairui dowi, now tui hown paw miapaw sawk en sau en dowi chekhai. Nami klen kowi awisa paw plik en dowi, now uan hown paw dua en dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 16:5" />Naiawng nachang en kownkow miapaw saksing sana en mih uowi dowi chekhai. Naiawng nachang en lak dow dowm akuangma kowi cham kuakta en hüah chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en uang dia mih ni hownia maru sui en mih chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 16:6" />“Now en ria iawng ang uang mang mih khin khe en matia vi kowi en taiüa lutlut mih dow ang khi khai. Nami khin khe naiawng uowi se en nasing kownkow ang pe en ana khai. <verse eid="EZK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 16:7" />Krum kowi kowh singh pawi iawng dow ang mingkhet en hanow ang pe iuk en khai. En awr iuk awr sown hanow en awr malauüa khai; en kowh iawn paw uang iuk khai bowt, now en kowh sam paw uang dawng khai bowt. Tawkchedow tawnguat uowi dowi hai tengiow tengklaima en uowi reng tak chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 16:8" />Nami kung kowi en ria iawng ang uang plan mang iawk khe en prakowi ang haimüla khai. Nami khin khe dow nachang dawngthawng kown mih en tataing khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi ang matia kowh kowrmow dow ang khup en hanow ang phum en siri khai. Now nasakrau en kownkow ang takham khai, now achi natachawng kownkow tatow sangbowk laitawm hanow ang masi en uang chowng khai. <verse eid="EZK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 16:9" />Now tui hown ang lu en hanow en buk kowi kowh vi dow ang sawk sau en khai, now buk kowi ang phawk en sau khai. <verse eid="EZK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 16:10" />En buk kowi dow sawt pe bawng mih uan klangiungma mih ang khup en khai, now khawk kowi dow chak pik phanaikhawk klangiungma mih ang krua en khai. Adipükchow mih la hown kowh kawngah mih uanh hown ang mum en lu khai, now asung khakma mih uanh dow ang khup en khai. <verse eid="EZK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 16:11" />Ngawng awr hown ang tawng en khai: Rut kowi dow kuaiseh, ngawng kowi dow keng, <verse eid="EZK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 16:12" />param kowi dow ramseng, lu kowi dow kuh lukruk klangiungma mih hown ang tawng en khai. <verse eid="EZK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 16:13" />Kuh hai tai hown dow ang tawng en khai. En kowh khupdip tawngklai dow Adipükchow mih la hown kowh kawngah mih uanh hai la uan apachow mih sawt pe bawng mih uan chekhai. En kowh chakkham dow adichow mih kawmdi, kuai tui hai kanrawn sau chekhai. Lainowmma en uang klangiung khai. En dow mang masi iawng uang na khai bowt. <verse eid="EZK 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 16:14" />En klangiung lai kowh en kowh anang dow pren maten kowi cham tauet khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang pe en mih tatawng tauat müa hown dow en kowh klangiungra akümma chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 16:15" />“Tawkchedow en kowh klangiungra kowi en owmsak kowh nachangla chawkkrawma lup kownkow en tawngah khai. En ria iawng mang miuüa maten hown en hawt chang iang khai, now naiawngün maru-uüa dow en kowh klangiungra mih rupta en khai. <verse eid="EZK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 16:16" />Ang pe en mih tawnguat klangiung klangiungma mih dow arup aren chupra ün en tawngla khai, now nakowi dow en chang iang khai. Naiawngün lup en chang mih mapaw taka dowi chowdiah. <verse eid="EZK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 16:17" />Kuh hai tai hown kowh thawpah mih baing chang müa uanh ang pe en mih hown en matia vüi en thawpla kachakuüa rup khai, now naiawngün rup kowi en chupiiaah khai. <verse eid="EZK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 16:18" />Sawt pe bawng mih en kowh tawnguat dow naiawngün arup kowi en khup pe khai. Now naiawngün pur kowi dow ang kowh sau hown maikhük mih en kowphuchua khai. <verse eid="EZK 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 16:19" />En nachaah kownkow kawmdi adichow mih, kanrawn sau hai kuai tui ang pe en mih paw naiawngün arup aren pur kowi nam iungma mih uanap iawng dow en towah khai. Naiawng dow en chang ching chekhai, ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk.<verse eid="EZK 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 16:20" />“Ang vüi en pen ang mih chauüa maten kowi paw arup aren kowi en ap-ah khai. En chang iang mih en sak-ih dowi tak chekhai bow? <verse eid="EZK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 16:21" />Ang chauüa kowi en ngenah khai, now maih kowi en nawmah now arup arenuüa vüi en phuchuaah khai. <verse eid="EZK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 16:22" />Naiawng suiiai kaniaima mih lup en chang khe hai en chang iang khe en ngeuüa khe kowh tengiow tengklaima hown en matia vi kowi en taiüa lutlut mih lai en ka tuak dowi bow.<verse eid="EZK 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="EZK 16:23-24" />“En kowh piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow! Naiawng khowt mih lup ngak en chang kung kowi paw marow akuangma mih rah maten kowi en kutplan thawp arup lowk chi tak chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 16:23-24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 16:25" />Tiama krum towng paw en thawpah mih arup dow en towah khai. Naiawng en chang mih hown en kowh klangiungra mih en piakah khai. En ria iawng mang miuüa maten kowi dow en kowh buk en peah hanow en kowh iang chang lup dow en pe huah khai. <verse eid="EZK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 16:26" />Iang chang dawma mih Aiguptauüa hown paw en chang iang khai. Lainowmma en pe kunmarau ang kownkow en kowh iang chang dow en pe huah khai. <verse eid="EZK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 16:27" />Naiawng rakowi ang kingküa en hanow en kowh dawngthawnguan mih ang eta en khai. En kowh ransu Filistinuüa rut kowi, en kowh suiiai kaniaima mih akiang rakowi rukraila en miuüa rut kowi ang apta en khowk. <verse eid="EZK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 16:28" />Iang chang dow en duh dowi tak rakowi Asuriauüa hown paw en chang iang khai. Tawkchedow nami kung kowi paw en duh dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 16:29" />Nami kung kowi en kowh iang chang dow en pe huah hanow chang kun mih pren Babulawnuüa hown paw en plan chang iang khai. Nachenganchepaw en duh dowi reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 16:30" />“Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek khowk, en kowh sak dow arau uowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow tuk rukrai dowi, now sangching khawmma mih chawkkrawma iawng en chang lup khai. <verse eid="EZK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 16:31" />Tiama krum towng arup chupra en thawp mih khin khe en chang chawkkrawma lup khai. En dow nachang chawkkrawma lup kown nau lai bowt kowh en kowh kakbak khowm en paw dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 16:32" />En dow chang iang mih masiuüa iawng chekhai; en dow en matia hua kowi lak-e tukah dowi mih kachakuüa kowi en lang nau khai. <verse eid="EZK 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 16:33" />Chawkkrawmauüa maten dow taphua taiua mih sung paw reng chekhai. Nachenganchepaw en dow phua en iua en miuüa maten kowi en peah awmrawm sung reng chekhai. Lowra hownia en tut-e nauang hanow en hown pacham uang chang iang lah pakowh naiawngünuüa kowi en peah büm mih chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 16:34" />Naiawng rakowi en kowh chawkkrawma lup dow akeng mih chawkkrawmauüa lak-e lang taklowi chowt chekhai. En hown nachang iang kownkow miapaw chia en dowi chekhai; en matia en krawi chiaah rowt chekhai. En dow lainowmma lang taklowi khai; en dow paw asung kown mih takcha en peah awmrawm sung rowt chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem luk kowi CHAKRAMANG tara chetra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 16:35" />Aw chawkkrawma, CHAKRAMANG laiklow sünta diah. <verse eid="EZK 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 16:36" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “En kowh tawnguat dow en klüpta hanow tengiow tengklaima en manau-uüa hown en chang iang khai. En kowh chauüa kowi dow en saiah hanow suiiai kaniaima mih arup aren kowi en phuchuala khai. <verse eid="EZK 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 16:37" />Naiawng rakowi en piaw pala mih en kowh manau-uüa maten kowi dow ang nakua en kown. Alai kowh en sakrauah miuüa hai en suiah miuüa maten kowi ang nakua en kown. Nakingküa en kownkow pren tali nui hownia amatni kowi dow ang nakua en kown, now en kowh tengiow tengklaima mih nakhi en kownkow amatni pur kowi dow ang naklüpta en tawnguat kown. <verse eid="EZK 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 16:38" />Chang iang mih masiuüa hai paw maru asak miuüa kowi kowh ripah mih iawng ngengche ang narip en kown. Ang kowh kunmaraura lün pluplup mih hown kowng pat mih ripra dow ang nape en kown. <verse eid="EZK 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 16:39" />Now en manau-uüa rut kowi ang naapta en kown; amatni dow en kowh arup aren uowi rah maten napiakta en kown. Amatni dow naklüpta en tawnguat kown, now en kowh baing chang müa uanh klangiungma mih maten paw narupta en kown. Amatni dow tengiow tengklaima nata towla en hüah kown. <verse eid="EZK 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 16:40" />Amatni dow nakua en maru kawm kown, now nami maru-uüa dow huaklu hown nakuak en hanow nakowngta en kown. Nami klen kowi amatni kowh saidawng hown dow nadungta en naknak kown. <verse eid="EZK 16:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 16:41" />Amatni dow natowkta en kim üa kown, now akeng mih masiuüa pur kowi narip en kown. Naiawng hai en kowh iang chang dow ang nataingta en kown; en manau-uüa kowi en napeah awmrawm sung kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 16:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 16:42" />Nami kung kowi dow ang sak nata-ih bowt kown; en luk kowi kowh ang kowh kunmaraura lün pluplup mih dow naprowng bowt kown, ang nakunmarau kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="EZK 16:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 16:43" />“En ngeuüa khe kowh ang mingkhet en mih ni ün sak kowi en towah dowi chekhai. Nami takcha lup ngak maten hown en towk ang kunmarau khai. Akeng mih lup ngak maten klen kowi paw en chang iang khai. Naiawng rakowi ang paw en kowh lup sung ang nape en kown.<verse eid="EZK 16:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">A-u chah dow a-u iawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 16:44" />“En lawnguan kowi maiawng mih tantawh maru natek en kown, ‘A-u chah dow a-u iawng taih,’ napa büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 16:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 16:45" />En dow en u kowh chama ching chekhai; en u paw ahua hai achauüa kowi suiah reng. En dow en tuamowuüa kowh tuamow ching chekhai; en tuamowuüa paw ahuauüa hai achauüa kowi suiah reng. Enni kowh u dow Hit chenchap chekhai, now enni kowh pa dow Amawr chenchap chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 16:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 16:46" />En taimow dow aia kowh chamauüa hown tawngphak prakowi uowi mih Samari marow chekhai. En naumow dow aia kowh chamauüa hown mrawkphak prakowi uowi mih Sawdawm marow chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 16:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 16:47" />En dow amatni kowh chowm krang uowi krang hai suiiai kaniaima mih akiang iawng en tawi kiang khai, now khin kra dowi kowi amatni lak-e en kowh chowm krang uowi krang lang suiiai kaniai khai. <verse eid="EZK 16:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 16:48" />Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai ang kowh sak lüklau se ang tek khowk, en hai en chamauüa changah mih lup ngak iawng en tuamow Sawdawm hai achamauüa khowm padow katpaw changla dowi chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 16:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 16:49" />“En tuamow Sawdawm marow kowh angak dow aia hai aia kowh chamauüa chang bawri mih chekhai. Amatni kowh dow chakkham ahuma uowi khai, now athaulangma uowi büah khai. Naiawng rakowi chang bawri büah mih chekhai. Tawkchedow akhawr hai ngarawng ngaraima miuüa kowi khowng büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 16:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZK 16:50" />Amatni dow bawrima chekhai, now ang pur kowi paw suiiai kaniaima mih lup chang büah khai. Naiawng rakowi nami ang khi hanow amatni kowi dow ang ripah khai. <verse eid="EZK 16:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZK 16:51" />En changah mih angak maten kowi dawnglang khowm padow Samari marow chang dowi chekhai. En dow amatni lak-e lang suiiai mih lup en chang khai. En changah mih lup maten khi hanow en lak-e en tuamowuüa lang tachi tanawm rowt powm iawng chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 16:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZK 16:52" />Naiawng rakowi en tuamowuüa kowh rukraira lak-e en kowh rukraira nalang hu kown. En kowh angak dow en tuamowuüa kowh lak-e lang hu khai. Naiawng rakowi en tuamowuüa lang tachi tanawm mih powm iawng uang tatüng khai. En kowh lup dow lainowmma suiiai khai. Naiawng rakowi en nakham rukrai ngengche kown takla.<verse eid="EZK 16:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawdawm marow hai Samari marow naplan iung iawk kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZK 16:53" />“Pani dow Sawdawm hai aia chamauüa, Samari hai aia chamauüa kowi alai kowh iawng ang napeah iungra iawk kown, now en kowi paw ang nape en iungra iawk kown. <verse eid="EZK 16:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZK 16:54" />Nahanow en changta lup ngak mih maten rakowi en narukrai kown, now en rukrai mih dow en tuamowuüa nakala sakklamra kown. <verse eid="EZK 16:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZK 16:55" />Alai kowh uowi iawng dow en tuamowuüa hai achamauüa naplan uowi iawk kown; now en hai en chamauüa paw alai kowh uowi iawng naplan uowi iawk kown. <verse eid="EZK 16:55" /><verse number="56-57" style="v" sid="EZK 16:56-57" />En chang bawri reng tak mih ni khe, en kowh angak tatüng dowi tak khe dow en tuamow Sawdawm marow kowi en prawng renah khai. Nami powm iawng kawmat dow Edawm prenchak masiuüa hawmh hai amatni tasin taken mih Filistin masiuüa hawmh, en riaret kowi kowh uowi miuüa hai sui en miuüa maten prawngren en khai. <verse eid="EZK 16:56-57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZK 16:58" />En kowh lup ngak hai suiiai kaniaima mih lup sung dow en nakur ngengche kown.<verse eid="EZK 16:58" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chowngchowng saksakma mih sangbowk laitawm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZK 16:59" />“Ang kowh sangbowk laitawm dow en piakta hanow ang kowh laikham paw en nüah dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi en kowh lup chang krang iawng ang nachang en kown. <verse eid="EZK 16:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZK 16:60" />Nachenganchepaw en ngeuüa khe kowh en hown kowh ang towah mih sangbowk laitawm dow ang natuakah kown, now en hown chowngchowng saksakma mih sangbowk laitawm ang nathawp lowk kown. <verse eid="EZK 16:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZK 16:61" />En kowh taimow hai en kowh naumow dow ang kowh laikham kowi uowi dowi chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw amatchi kowi mih en kowh chama iawng ang nape en kown. Nami khin khe dow en kowh chowm krang uowi krang en naka tuak hanow en narukrai kown. <verse eid="EZK 16:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZK 16:62" />En hown kowh ang towah mih sangbowk laitawm dow asar hown ang nathawpah iawk kown. Nahanow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami en natuk kown. <verse eid="EZK 16:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZK 16:63" />En kowh angak maten ang lawtta en mih khin khe dow en kowh lup ngak maten en naka tuak kown, now en narukrai kown. Nakhowk khe dow en rukrai lai rakowi tawngpaw en uam tek kown nadowi bowt. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 16:63" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EZK 17" />
  <para style="s">Uamu pre buk hai rui patut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 17:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. <verse eid="EZK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 17:2" />Aia dow maiawng tek ang khai: Aw maru chapa, Israeluüa kowi laiuat hown kowtek pe dit. <verse eid="EZK 17:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="EZK 17:3-4" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, “Apawi chakma, alap pawi klangma, apreuprakma, aiukma mih uamu dow Lebanawn hungh kowi uang lowk. Nami uamu dow Lebanawn kowi kowh sidar singh lang lowng mih mia klowkla lowk hanow Babulawn pren kowi kowpawla khai, now nakowi kowh kun changra marow kowi kowtowah khai. <verse eid="EZK 17:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 17:5" />Nahanow nami uamu mih Israel pren hownia kowh aliu dow krawng iungma mih kowi chowkah khai. Nami liu dow klangiungma naia iuksownla kownkow tui ahuma mih aw pang kowi chowkah khai. <verse eid="EZK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 17:6" />Nami liu dow awr ru hanow ruih iawng krawng kowi awr tamung khai. Now aprün paw krawng abüpma kowi sawt khai. Naiawng hai nami ruih dow awr iuk khai, aram hailawm a-awm ahuma uang towk khai bowt. Now nami ruih dow nami uamu prakowi awr tarawk khai.<verse eid="EZK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 17:7" />“Nami uamu kowh paw apawi chakma hai alap iukma chekhai. Nachenganchepaw nakala tui küng kownkow nami ruih dow aprün hai a-awm mih nami hownia akeng mih uamu prakowi cham plan tarawk khai iawk. <verse eid="EZK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 17:8" />Tawkchedow nami ruih kowi mih a-awm pacham hu lah, pacham uih lah, arui klangiungma pacham phaw lah pakowh tui ahuma mih aw pang kowi chowkah khowk chowdiah.<verse eid="EZK 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 17:9" />“Naiawng rakowi kawmat CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Aw maru chapa, Israeluüa kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah: Nami ruih naia iuksown tak pabow? Nami ruih dow naia iuksown kown nadowi. Naiuksown lak dow nakeula kownkow ang nachawita kown, now auih ün paw ang nakuakta pe kown. Aia kowh a-awm sar maten dow nakeu bowk kown. Aia kowh aprün nachawita pe kownkow maru akawmma lakke dowi tham, akürma mih paw lakke dowi tham. <verse eid="EZK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 17:10" />Aia kowi dow klangiungma chowkah khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw nasing kown nadowi. Aia awr iuksownla mih rah kowi dow satlawt li nauang hanow aia dow nakeu bowk kown chekhai,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uamu pre buk mih hai ruih auan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 17:11" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 17:12" />“Aw maru chapa, kingküa hai sen mih chenchap kowi maiawng kowtek pe dit: Nami uamu hai ruih auan enni tuk tak bow? Babulawn mang dow Jerusalem kowi uangah hanow Jerusalem kowi kowh mang hai mang kimchakuüa kowi Babulawn pren kowi pawla khai. <verse eid="EZK 17:12" /><verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="EZK 17:13-14" />Nahanow Babulawn mang dow nami mang kimchak lowk ia mih hown tatow sangbowk laitawm khai, now aia low kowi nauowila kownkow nami mang kimchak lowk ia mih kowi dow pe khamah lai khai. Sangbowk laitawm che townah büah reng hanow nauowi büah reng kown mih chekhai. Tawkchedow akürma hang pacham phaw lah, Babulawn low kowi pacham uowi lah pakowh Juda pren kowi kowh lang kri miuüa kowi Babulawn pren mang khümla hanow pawla mih chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 17:13-14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 17:15" />Nachenganchepaw Juda pren mang dow nakala kawrnga hai nakala siphai kawm kownkow Aigupta pren kowi kowchin maru khai; aia dow Babulawn mang kowi kingküa hai senah khai. Aia kowh lup chang dow nachawn kown pabow? Naiawngün lup aia chang mih dow khalat kown pabow? Aia piakta laikham now naplai kown pabow?<verse eid="EZK 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 17:16" />“Ang CHAKRAMANG masing Thurai, ang kowh asak lüklau se ang tek khowk, mang chowm rah kowi kowh pe chowmah mih ia, aia kham pe lai mih mang kowi aia nüah klowkah dowi chekhai, now laikham paw aia piakta pe khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow Babulawn pren kowi nakowng kown. <verse eid="EZK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 17:17" />Tasen mih khin khe maru akawmma nakowngla kownkow Babulawnuüa nathawp huapam hai nathai kuam kown. Nami khin khe Faraw kowh akürma mih siphai kawm dow nakhowngah kown nadowi. <verse eid="EZK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 17:18" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow mang Zedekia dow piakta sangbowk laitawm khai; aia dow aia kowh laikham nüah klowkah dowi chekhai. Aia dow Babulawn low kowi nauowi kownkow tatow laikham khowk chepaw nami laikham piakta khai rakowi nakhalat kown nadowi.<verse eid="EZK 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 17:19" />“Ang CHAKRAMANG masing Thurai, ang kowh asak lüklau se ang tek khowk. Aia dow ang ming hown kowh takham mih piakta khai. Naiawng rakowi nami sung dow aia kowi ang napeah kown. <verse eid="EZK 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 17:20" />Mang Zedekia vüi ang nathang pe powk hanow aia dow ang kowh powk kowi nataia kown. Aia dow ang kaah sakowm iawng uowi dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowi mih Babulawn pren kowi dow ang nakowpawla kown, now nakowi mih aia kowi ang naripah kown. <verse eid="EZK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 17:21" />Aia kowh tasen lang kiak mih siphaiuüa maten dow tasenra kowi nakowng kown, now ta plai mih siphaiuüa dow nacham taset plawt kown. Nami khin khe dow ang CHAKRAMANG ngengche mami laiklow tekla khowk pami enni natuk bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pur prakowi Isu krista nauang kown mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 17:22" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, “Sidar singh chem hownia a-awm achalachow mih dow ang matia ngengche ang napawah hanow Israel kowi kowh lang lowng mih hungh luk kowi ang nachowkah kown. <verse eid="EZK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 17:23" />Israel pren kowi kowh alowngma mih hungh luk kowi nami awmh hownia dow aprek nauang uowi hanow nauih kown; nami dow sidar singh klangiungma nauang chowng kown. Nami mia kowi dow uakling uaber matiow nachang bai kown, now nami klim kowi dow uakling uaber hawmh natanai kown. <verse eid="EZK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 17:24" />Nahanow alowngma mih singh kowi kripta mih, anemchow mih singh kowi alowngma pe phawah mih, asingma mih singh kowi akeuma changah mih, akeuma mih singh kowi pe singah mih dow ang CHAKRAMANG chekhai pami dowm kowi kowh singh kau maten natuk bowt kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk, now ang tekta mih dow ang nachang ngengche kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 17:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EZK 18" />
  <para style="s">Chang ngak mih chowtaih nakowng kown</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 18:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 18:2" />“Israel pren kowi maiawng mih tantawh enni tek khai, ‘Cha sur mih dow u-pa taih diah. Tawkche iüng krüm mih dow achauüa kowh chekhai,’ pakhai. Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng enni lang tek rereng?<verse eid="EZK 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 18:3" />“Ang kowh asak lüklau se ang tek khowk, naiawng mih tantawh Israel pren kowi natek kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 18:4" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow sing uowi mih maru maten dow ang kowh chekhai, pa hai chapa pre ia trui ang kowh chekhai. Ang kowh rirow dow mami chekhai: Chang ngak mih chowtaih nakowng kown.<verse eid="EZK 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 18:5" />“Dowkah diah sik, maru iungma mih uowi lowk ia. Aia dow anowm hai anama mih lup chowtaih chang khai. <verse eid="EZK 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 18:6" />Nami maru dow hungh luk kowi kowh phuchuara kowi paw cham tawi cha nat ngar dowi chekhai. Now Israeluüa thawpah mih arup aren kowi paw tawi chup tawi iia dowi chekhai. Aia klowkchak kowh masi kowi paw krawi piak dowi. Nami klen kowi <char style="w">uisawng</char> uowi mih masiuüa hown paw krawi taphua taiua dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 18:7" />Aia dow mia kowi paw chang nowng chang powng dowi chekhai. Naiawng nachang lak dow maru uang pawng uanh chepaw aiawngma hawt plan peah reng chekhai. Aia dow ku dowi chekhai, ku lak dow hawm sakkrai miuüa kowi peah chakkham reng chekhai, now tawnguat uowi dowi miuüa kowi paw peah tawnguat reng chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 18:8" />Now aia dow cham pe lowi chepaw paw achüt dowi chekhai. Aia dow angak lup changra hownia lang tahen reng chekhai, now maru kowi paw anowmma hown chet pe tara reng chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 18:9" />Aia dow ang kowh rirow iawng mang reng, now kaah sakowmma hai ang kowh ari aiang paw chün reng chekhai. Aia dow maru aiungma chekhai nowm; aia dow nasing ngengche kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="EZK 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="EZK 18:10-11" />“Now dowkah diah sik, nami maru iungma mih kowh chapa ngakma mih uowi lowk ia. Nami maru dow sai maru sak ün, katpaw a-pa changah dowi mih lup ngak ün chang khai. Aia dow hungh luk kowi kowh phuchuara kowi ün cham tawi cha nat ngar khai. Aia dow aia klowkchak masi kowi ün krawi piak khai. <verse eid="EZK 18:10-11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 18:12" />Aia dow ngarawng ngarai miuüa hai akhawr a-awng hown uowi miuüa kowi chang nowng chang powng khai. Aia dow ku reng chekhai, maru uang pawngah mih uanh paw hawt plan pe dowi chekhai. Aia dow chup arup aren reng chekhai, now suiiai kaniaima mih lup paw chang reng chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 18:13" />Aia dow pe lowi chepaw paw achüt reng chekhai. Aia dow nasing kown pabow? Aia dow mapaw nasing kown nadowi chekhai. Naiawngün suiiai kaniaima mih lup maten aia chang rakowi aia dow nakowng ngengche kown. Aia kowng mih aprek dow aiamat ngengche nakur kown.<verse eid="EZK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 18:14" />“Now dowkah iawk diah sik, nami maru ngak kowh chapa uowi lowk ia. Nami dow a-pa chang angak mih maten khi khowk chepaw a-pa changah mih lup tawi chang dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 18:15" />Aia dow hungh luk kowi kowh phuchuara kowi ün cham tawi cha nat ngar dowi chekhai, Israeluüa thawpah mih arup aren kowi paw tawi chup tawi iia dowi chekhai. Aia dow aia klowkchak kowh masi kowi krawi piak dowi. <verse eid="EZK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 18:16" />Now mia kowi paw krawi chang nowng chang powng dowi chekhai. Aia dow aia kowh kakra uowi rakowi maru uang pawngah mih uanh pawta dowi chekhai. Aia dow ku dowi; ku lak dow hawm sakkrai miuüa kowi peah chakkham reng, now tawnguat uowi dowi miuüa kowi paw peah tawnguat reng chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 18:17" />Aia dow ngarawng ngarai miuüa kowi chang nowng chang powng dowi chekhai, now cham pe lowi chepaw paw achüt dowi chekhai. Aia dow ang kowh ari aiang townah reng, now ang kowh rirow chün reng chekhai. Aia dow a-pa kowh angak rakowi nakowng kown nadowi; aia dow nasing ngengche kown chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 18:18" />Tawkche a-pa dow aia kowh angak rakowi nakowng kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow kür hown krawi paw tangka khai, aia tainau-uüa kowh uanh paw krawi ku khai, now aia maru-uüa luk kowi paw krawi chang lup ngak khai.<verse eid="EZK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 18:19" />“Nachenganchepaw enni tek mih, ‘Tawngplawng kowchow apa kowh angak rakowi achapa tawi ka ripra dowi kown?’ pakhai. Achapa dow tawi ka ripra kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow achapa dow anowmma hai anama mih lup chang khai. Now ang kowh ari-arow paw towsak towtaima hown chün khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow nasing ngengche kown. <verse eid="EZK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 18:20" />Chang ngak mih chowtaih nakowng kown. Apa kowh aprek rakowi achapa naka ripra kown nadowi, achapa kowh aprek rakowi a-pa paw naka ripra kown nadowi chekhai. Maru iung dow aia kowh aiung sung naka kown, now maru ngak dow aia kowh angak sung naka kown.<verse eid="EZK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 18:21" />“Tawkchedow maru ngak che aia kowh angak towta kowh ang prakowi uang plan now ang kowh ari arow chün khai, now anowmma hai anama mih lup chang khai kowh chalow hanow aia dow nasing ngengche kown, nakowng kown nadowi. <verse eid="EZK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 18:22" />Aia changta angak mih maten dow sak kowi ang natow pe kown nadowi bowt. Aia changah mih lup iung rakowi chowtaih aia dow nasing kown. <verse eid="EZK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 18:23" />Maru ngak kowng khe ang awmrawm lai pabow? Maru ngak kowng mih lak-e angak hownia uang plan now sing mih ang lang awmrawm dowi pabow?<verse eid="EZK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 18:24" />“Tawkchedow maru iungma mih lowk ia aia kowh lup iung towta hanow chang angak khai, maru ngakuüa iawng suiiai kaniaima mih lup tawi chang khai hanow aia dow nasing kown nadowi. Aia kowh lup iung dow sak kowi ang natow pe kown nadowi bowt. Aia dow ang kaah sakowm iawng uowi dowi hai chang angak khai rakowi nakowng ngengche kown.<verse eid="EZK 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 18:25" />“Nachenganchepaw enni tek mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG kowh tiama thik dowi,’ pakhai. Aw Israeluüa, sünta büa diah. Ang kowh tiama athikma chekhai. Thik dowi mih dow enni kowh tiama chowbowt. <verse eid="EZK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 18:26" />Maru iung che aia kowh lup iung towta kowh chang lup ngak khai hanow kowng mih dow aia kowh angak rakowi aia kowng mih chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 18:27" />Tawkchedow maru ngak che aia kowh lup ngak towta kowh chang lup iung khai hanow aia kowh sak dow naplai kown. <verse eid="EZK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 18:28" />Aia ngak mih aia tuakah kowh nami hownia aia uang plan mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow nasing ngengche kown, nakowng kown nadowi. <verse eid="EZK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 18:29" />Nachenganchepaw enni tek mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG kowh tiama thik dowi,’ pakhai. Israeluüa low, ang kowh tiama dow athikma chekhai. Tiama thik dowi mih dow enni kowh chowbowt.<verse eid="EZK 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 18:30" />“Naiawng rakowi aw Israeluüa, enni kowh chowm krang uowi krang iawng bowkbowk kowi ang nachet enni tara kown. Angak hownia uang plan büa diah, enni kowh lup ngak maten hownia uang plan büa diah; nahanow angak rakowi enni napiak kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 18:31" />Enni kowh angak maten enni matia hownia kuakta büa diah, now enni kowh sak hai lümla dow asar hown thawpah büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow enni nakowng kown chow? <verse eid="EZK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 18:32" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru kowng mih mapaw ang awmrawm dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi enni kowh angak hownia uang plan now sing büa diah. Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 18:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EZK 19" />
  <para style="s">Israel pren kruitown miuüa vüi taprüa taiiara meng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 19:1" />CHAKRAMANG mih Israel pren kruitown miuüa vüi maiawng kowpe tek ang kar meng khai:<verse eid="EZK 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 19:2" />“En u dow krangsi hawmh dawng kowi krangsima iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:2">aia dow sak lang kraing mih krangsima iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:2">Aia dow krangsila powruüa dawng kowi tawi uowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:2">now nakowi aia dow aia chauüa kowi thumah mawmah khai.<verse eid="EZK 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 19:3" />Aia kowh chah lowk mih dow uang awr iuk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:3">now akürma mih krangsila iawng uang phaw khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:3">Aia dow chak mak ün tasang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:3">maru nga paw uown cha khai bowt.<verse eid="EZK 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 19:4" />Akeng prenchakuüa dow aia lawnguan kowi ta khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:4">now aia dow akeng prenchakuüa kuam kowi dowh khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:4">Aia kowi dow maru phawk pe napha khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:4">now Aigupta pren kowi dow maru pawla khai bowt.<verse eid="EZK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 19:5" />“‘Nami nauang plan kown mih kowi a-u chawngah chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:5">Nachenganchepaw sakowmra mih alenma chur khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:5">Naiawng rakowi alowk mih chah kowi kutplan thum khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:5">nami kowi paw akürma kutplan thawpah khai iawk.<verse eid="EZK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 19:6" />Nami dow akeng mih krangsi hawmh hown cham tawi taiua khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:6">now krangsila akürma mih dow uang chowng khai iawk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:6">Nami paw chak mak ün tasang khai iawk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:6">now nami paw uown cha maru nga khai iawk.<verse eid="EZK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 19:7" />Aia dow amatni kowh kangchawngra kim akhawtma mih krawi piakta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:7">amatni kowh marow maten paw piakta nak khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:7">Aia kowh hek klow dow paprenma ta bowk chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:7">aia hek klow kowi dow maru maten kram bowk chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 19:8" />Nami khin khe aia riaret re-e kowh chenchapuüa dow aia tut-e uang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:8">aia kowi nauang kingküaah kownkow akeng chenchapuüa dow uang mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:8">Akeng chenchapuüa dow aia vüi kowi thang pe powk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:8">now aia dow nami powk thangia kowi kowtaia khai.<verse eid="EZK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 19:9" />Aia kowi paw phawk pe napha now lawngha pawm kowi klungah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:9">now Babulawn pren mang tut-e maru kowpawla khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:9">Aia kowi dow maru klungta hüah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:9">Israel pren kowi kowh hungh kowi aia hek klow dow ta dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 19:10" />“‘En u dow tui ria kowi kowh chowkah mih grep ruih iawng chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:10">ka tui reng rakowi aia kowh dow amia hai auih achakma chowdiah.<verse eid="EZK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 19:11" />Aia kowh amia ün dow akhawtma chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:11">naiawngün dow nachangla mang raitua kown mih tataing chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:11">Nami singh dow alowng krang kuang kowi tawk mih iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:11">Naiawng rakowi amia hai aram chakma mih aiachow maru khi pe khai.<verse eid="EZK 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 19:12" />Tawkchedow CHAKRAMANG kunmaraura hown aia kowi dow chawita khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:12">aia kowi dow krawng kowi kuakta hüah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:12">Adenma mih satlawt li uang hutah hanow aia dow keu khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:12">aia kowh uih paw keu now prua bowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:12">Aia kowh amia akhawtma mih ün taklowk now keu khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:12">now nami amia keu kowi dow maih kamah khai.<verse eid="EZK 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 19:13" />Kawmat dow aia kowi süngrüp süngkangma kowi chowkah khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:13">tui uowi dowi mih krawng, akeuma mih pren kowi chowkah khai bowt.<verse eid="EZK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 19:14" />Aia kowh amia prek hownia dow maih krawi tauet khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:14">aia kowh auih ün dow kam khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:14">Aia kowh dow akhawtma mih amia uowi dowi bowt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:14">nachangla mang raitua kown tataing mih mia uowi dowi bowt chekhai,’ pape dit.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZK 19:14" />
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 19:14">“Mami dow kar meng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi taprüa tanguk khe kowh tawngah kengah kown mih meng chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 19:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EZK 20" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG laiklow Israeluüa chün dowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 20:1" />Nar kowi takhang mih ranit ning hown tanga la khe kowh lacher hamüt ni khe Israeluüa kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa pre sum ia dow ang tut-e uang hanow ang ria kowi uang chowm büah khai. Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG naukrang tuk kown nau rakowi uang büah mih chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 20:2" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. <verse eid="EZK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 20:3" />CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, Israeluüa kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi maiawng tek pe dit: CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, ‘Ang naukrang tuk kown nau rakowi enni uang mih bow? Ang kowh asak lüklau se ang tek khowk, ang naukrang ang natek enni kown nadowi,’ pape dit.<verse eid="EZK 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 20:4" />“Aw maru chapa, amatni kowi chet pe tara kown mih en kamrüt bow? En che kamrüt now amatni pipu-uüa kowh suiiai kaniaima mih chowm krang uowi krang chia pe diah. <verse eid="EZK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 20:5" />Amatni kowi maiawng tek pe dit: CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, ‘Israel kowi ang lang kloah mih ni hownia Jakawb chuprek chaprekuüa tut-e ang takhamta khai bowt. Ang chowtaih amatni kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai pami ang takhamta khai bowt. Now Aigupta pren kowi amatni tut-e ang kowtatüng pe khai. <verse eid="EZK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 20:6" />Nami khin khe Aigupta pren hownia amatni kowi ang nalawtla hanow amatni vüi ang khowm bowkta pe khowk mih pren kowi ang nakowpawla kown mih paw ang takhamla khai. Nami pren dow kuai tui, iawn tui hai tawng chap paw akhawr uowi dowi mih pren chekhai; nami pren dow akeng pren maten lak-e paw lang iung mih pren chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 20:7" />Amatni kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai dow ang chowtaih. Naiawng rakowi amatni tut-e kowh iung mih asürlawkma mih arup aren hai suiiai kaniaima mih arup aren maten namata büah bowk kownkow ang tek pe khowk chowdiah. Nami klen kowi Aigupta pren kowi kowh arup aren hown natawi tasür talawk büah dowi kown mih paw ang tek pe khowk chowdiah.<verse eid="EZK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 20:8" />“‘Tawkchedow kingküa hai sen ang büah khai, ang kowh laiklow chün kown nau büah dowi chekhai. Amatni tut-e kowh iung mih asürlawkma mih arup aren hai suiiai kaniaima mih arup aren mata büah dowi chekhai, now Aigupta pren kowi kowh arup aren ün paw nuata büah dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ang kowh kunmaraura hai mapaw ang sak-ih dowi mih maten hown Aigupta pren kowi amatni kowi napiakta kownkow ang kamrüt khowk chowdiah. <verse eid="EZK 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 20:9" />Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi ang piakah dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh ming iung natownah reng kown ang nau khai, now amatni uowiah mih prenchakuüa tut-e ang kowh ming natasür talawk kown mih ang nau dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru maten pur kowi Aigupta pren hownia amatni kowi nalawtla kown mih ang takhamta khai bowt chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 20:10" />“‘Naiawng rakowi Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla now süngrüp süngkangma kowi ang uang pawla khai. <verse eid="EZK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 20:11" />Amatni kowi dow ang kowh rirow ang peah khai, now ang kowh ari aiang ang tek pe khai. Nami rirow hai ari aiang chün khai mih dow nami hown nasing kown. <verse eid="EZK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 20:12" />Now ang hai amatni takra kowi amatra iawng hai Tanai Ni ang tow pe khai. Ang CHAKRAMANG ngengche, ang matia vüi chimsaima ang natowah kownkow amatni kowi ang lang kloah mih chekhai. Nami natukla büah reng kownkow nami Tanai Ni ang tow pe mih chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 20:13" />“‘Tawkchedow Israeluüa mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi kingküa ang büah khai. Amatni dow ang kowh rirow ün chün büah dowi chekhai, now ang kowh ari aiang chün hanow maru kala singra mih paw nuata büah khai. Amatni dow ang peah mih Tanai Ni ün paw chimsaima towah büah dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ang kowh kunmaraura hown amatni kowi süngrüp süngkangma kowi ang napiakta kown chowdiah. <verse eid="EZK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 20:14" />Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi ang piakah dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang uang lawtla khe kowh khi mih akeng chenchapuüa tut-e ang kowh ming tasür talawk kown mih ang nau dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ang kowh ming iung natownla reng kownkow amatni kowi ang piakah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 20:15" />Nami klen kowi ang peah mih pren — kuai tui, iawn tui hai tawng chap paw akhawr uowi dowi mih pren — akeng pren maten lak-e kowh lang iung mih pren kowi napawla dowi kownkow süngrüp süngkangma kowi amatni tut-e ang takhamta khai bowt. <verse eid="EZK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 20:16" />Amatni dow ang kowh ari aiang nuata büah khai, now ang kowh ari arow ün chün büah dowi chekhai. Nami klen kowi ang peah mih tanai ni ün paw achimsaima chünah büah dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh sak dow arup aren phuchuara prakowi lang sakkrai rowt chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 20:17" />Nachenganchepaw amatni luk kowi ang kowh saksing sanara dow uowi reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi amaisang ang piakah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 20:18" />“‘Amatni chauüa kowi dow amatni pipu-uüa iawng nachang dowi kownkow hai amatni pipu-uüa chowm krang uowi krang iawng nauowi büah dowi kownkow nakowi ang tek pe khai. Now amatni pipu-uüa kowh arup aren ün hown natasür talawk büah dowi kown mih paw ang tek pe khai. <verse eid="EZK 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 20:19" />Ang chowtaih amatni kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai. Naiawng rakowi ang kowh rirow hai ang kowh ari aiang ün nachün büah kownkow ang tek pe khai. <verse eid="EZK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 20:20" />Ang chowtaih amatni kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai pami natukla büah reng kownkow amatra iawng hai Tanai Ni ün ang peah khai, nami Tanai Ni ün dow achim asaima natowah büah reng kownkow ang tek pe khai.<verse eid="EZK 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 20:21" />“‘Tawkchedow naiawngün chauüa paw kingküa ang büah khai. Ang kowh rirow hai ang kowh ari aiang ün chün hanow maru kala singra reng mih prakowi amatni paw pe ching büah dowi chekhai. Amatni paw ang peah mih Tanai Ni ün achim asaima towah büah dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi süngrüp süngkangma kowi uowi büah reng tak khe ang kowh kunmaraura hai sak-ih dowi mih maten hown amatni kowi ang napiakta kown chowdiah. <verse eid="EZK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 20:22" />Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi ang piakah dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowi ang uang lawtla khe kowh khi mih akeng chenchapuüa tut-e ang kowh ming tasür talawk kown mih ang nau dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ang kowh ming iung natownla reng kownkow amatni luk kowi naiawng ang chang pe dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 20:23" />Nami takcha kowi akeng pren hai akeng chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi amatni kowi ang nacham uetah kownkow süngrüp süngkangma kowi uowi büah reng tak khe ang takhamta khai bowt. <verse eid="EZK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 20:24" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow ang kowh ari aiang chün büah dowi chekhai, now ang kowh rirow mih nuata büah khai. Now ang peah mih Tanai Ni ün paw achim asaima towah büah dowi chekhai. Nami klen kowi amatni pipu-uüa kowh arup aren ün kowi dow lang nau büah khai. <verse eid="EZK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 20:25" />Naiawng rakowi iung dowi mih rirow maten hai kala singra dowi mih ari aiang nachün büah kownkow ang lawtta khai. <verse eid="EZK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 20:26" />Ang nauah dowi mih uanap hown pacham tasür talawk lah pakowh ang müta hüah khai, now amatni kowh chapa ta maten kowi maih kowi nawmah hanow nachangla phuchua müa kown mih ang hangah dowi chekhai. Naiawng hai amatni kowi dow ang ripah khai, now ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami pacham tuk büah bowt lah pakowh chekhai,’ pape diah.<verse eid="EZK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 20:27" />“Naiawng rakowi aw maru chapa, Israeluüa kowi maiawng tek pe dit: CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, ‘Enni kowh pipu-uüa ang kaah sakowm dowi mih iawng chang lup hai pe ang rukrai büah khai. <verse eid="EZK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 20:28" />Ang khamah mih pren kowi ang pawla mih kung kowi paw amatni dow hungh alowngma mih, singh mia achakma hai asingma mih singh khi hanow chang tawncher phuchua büah khai. Naiawng mih phuchuara pawi dow lainowmma ang kunmaraura pe tapur ang khai. Nami klen kowi amatni dow nakowi anam iungma mih maikhük paw towk pe khai, now hüngah mih phuchuara pawi paw chang büah khai. <verse eid="EZK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 20:29" />Naiawng rakowi tawngplawng kowchow hungh lowngma kowi amatni cham kowi mih dow ang lüntaah khai,’ pape diah,” pakhai. Naiawngün arah maten ming dow kawmat pat paw Bama pahai uowi reng tak chekhai. (Bama pami dow “Arah kroma mih phuchuara” pami chekhai).<verse eid="EZK 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tara chetra hai lawngra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 20:30" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Israeluüa kowi maiawng tek pe dit: CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Enni paw enni pipu-uüa iawng dow enni matia kowi sürah lawkah reng kown chekhai bow? Enni paw enni pipu-uüa kowh asürlawkma mih arup aren hai suiiai kaniaima mih arup aren kowi tawi chupiia reng kown bow? <verse eid="EZK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 20:31" />Ani mowr pat arup aren hown enni tasür talawk khai, ani mowr pat arup aren pur kowi enni kowh chapa chamauüa kowi maih kowi nawmah hanow enni phuchuaah khai. Naiawng rakowi aw Israeluüa, ang kowh naukrang ang natek enni kown pabow? Ang kowh asak lüklau se ang tek khowk, ang kowh naukrang mapaw ang natek enni kown nadowi.<verse eid="EZK 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 20:32" />“‘Singh hai hua kowi chup mih lusa kowi kowh akeng chenchapuüa iawng dow tawi uowi kown enni nau mih enni tek khai. Tawkchedow enni sak kowi kowh uowi mih iawng mapaw naphaw kown nadowi. <verse eid="EZK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 20:33" />Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai, ang kowh asak lüklau se ang tek khowk. Kür hown enni luk kowi ang nachowm mang kown, now ang kowh akürma mih rut ang napar enni khükhü ang narip enni kown; naiawng hai ang kowh kunmaraura dow ang natüng enni kown. <verse eid="EZK 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 20:34" />Ang kowh rut akürma mih hai ang kowh kunmaraura hown akeng chenchapuüa pungmadawng hownia ang nauang pawla enni kown. Enni cham uowiah mih pren maten hownia arasang ang nauang kuala enni kown. <verse eid="EZK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 20:35" />Akeng chenchapuüa tavir lut mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi dow ang napawla enni kown, now nakowi dow lumowr tatawng te ang nachet enni tara kown. <verse eid="EZK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 20:36" />Aigupta pren kowi kowh süngrüp süngkangma kowi enni pipu-uüa kowi kowh ang chet pe tara mih iawng dow enni kowi paw ang nachet enni tara kown.<verse eid="EZK 20:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 20:37" />“‘Ang kowh ari aiang dow kür hown ang nape chün enni kown; ang kowh sangbowk laitawm hown dow ang natawm enni kown. <verse eid="EZK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 20:38" />Enni pungmadawng kowi kowh kingküa ang miuüa kowi dow ang namata kown. Amatni cham uowi mih pren hownia ang uang lawtla chepaw amatni dow Israel pren kowi natawi ka kup büah kown nadowi. Nami khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami enni natuk bowt kown.<verse eid="EZK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 20:39" />“‘Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek khowk. Aw Israeluüa, tarü büah, enni bowkbowk enni kowh arup arenuüa kowi kowchup kowiia büah bowt. Nachenganchepaw pani khe dow ang laiklow enni nachün ngengche kown. Nami khin khe dow enni kowh uanap hai arup aren hown ang kowh ming chimsaima mih dow enni napiakah kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 20:40" />Nami khin khe dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh ang kowh hungh chimsaima mih Zaiawn hungh luk kowi Israel chenchap maten nauang chupiia ang bowt kown. Nakowi dow ang napaw enni bowt kown, now chimsaima mih phuchuara hai uanap hown aiung aiungma mih awmrawm sung ang nakük enni bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 20:41" />Ang cham uetta enni mih pren maten hownia ang uang lawtla enni hanow arasang ang natow enni kown. Nami khin khe dow nam iungma enni naphaw bowt kown, now ang napaw enni bowt kown. Nami khin khe dow khi enni hanow enni rakowi ang achim asaima pami akeng chenchapuüa natuk bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 20:42" />Enni pipu-uüa tut-e kowh ang takhamah mih pren Israel pren kowi ang kowpawla enni mih khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami enni natuk bowt kown.<verse eid="EZK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 20:43" />“‘Nakowi dow alai kowh enni chowm krang uowi krang hai enni tasür talawkla mih lup ün enni naka tuak kown, now enni changta lup ngak mih maten rakowi enni matia kowi enni natasui bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 20:44" />Aw Israeluüa, enni kowh chowm krang uowi krang angakma mih hai enni kowh lup ngak sung ang pe enni dowi bowt tham. Tawkchedow ang kowh ming iung natownla reng kownkow ang nachang enni aiung bowt kown. Nami khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami enni natuk bowt kown,’ pape dit. Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai, mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mrawkphak pra kowh pren kowi CHAKRAMANG naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 20:45" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow mih ang tut-e uang plan ting khai. Aia tek ang iawk mih, <verse eid="EZK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 20:46" />“Aw maru chapa, en kowh lumowr mih mrawkphak prakowi dangah hanow napra kowi kowh pren kowi kingküa mih laiklow tek pe dit, now nakowi kowh kaurawng kowi kingküa mih laiklow hai pur prakowi tawng chow naown kown mih laiklow tek pe dit. <verse eid="EZK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 20:47" />Mrawkphak pra kowh kaurawng kowi nasünta ang laiklow kownkow tek pe diah. Aia kowi dow maiawng tek pe diah: CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, ‘En kowi maih hown ang natowk en kown chowbowt, now nami maih dow en kowh singh kau maten asing hai akowng bowkbowk nakamta en kown. Nami maih lün pluplup mih dow namit kown nadowi chekhai, now mrawkphak hownia tawngphak mowr pat maru maten nami maih hown dow nakam kown. <verse eid="EZK 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 20:48" />Nami maih dow ang CHAKRAMANG towkah mih chekhai pami maru maten nakhi bowk kown; nami maih dow namit kown nadowi,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 20:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 20:49" />Nami khin khe ang klangah mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, ang cham tek sangchia mih chowtaih padow ang lawnguan kowi maru tek ang khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 20:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EZK 21" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh saidawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 21:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 21:2" />“Aw maru chapa, kawmat dow Jerusalem prakowi dangah hanow ang kowh kim chimsaima mih kowi kingküa mih laiklow tek pe diah, now Israel pren kowi kingküa mih laiklow hai pur prakowi tawng chow nauang ting kown mih lai tek pe diah. <verse eid="EZK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 21:3" />Aia kowi dow maiawng tek pe diah: CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘En kowh ransu ang na khai. Saidawng dow akawp hownia ang nahowkah hanow en lak kowi kowh maru iung hai maru ngak bowkbowk kowi ang nakowngta kown. <verse eid="EZK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 21:4" />Ang kowh saidawng dow akawp hownia nahowkah hanow ang nasai enni kown, maru iung hai maru ngak bowkbowk kowi ang nakowngta enni kown; mrawkphak hownia tawngphak mowr enni nakowng kown. <verse eid="EZK 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 21:5" />Nami khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami maru maten natuk kown. Ang matia ngengche saidawng dow akawp hownia ang howkah khai; lup chur dowi mowr nami saidawng dow akawp kowi ang naphangah iawk kown nadowi bowt,’ pape diah.<verse eid="EZK 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 21:6" />“Naiawng rakowi aw maru chapa, aklow tarua phawnglawng kar diah. Sak ter iawmlawm hai sak prüa rau uang takhui ruru se amatni pur kowi aklow tarua phawnglawng kar pe diah. <verse eid="EZK 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 21:7" />‘Tawngplawng kowchow aklow tarua phawnglawng en tuk kar khai?’ Padow nalünta en büah kown. Nami khin khe, ‘Satang ngak uang ting kown chowbowt. Naiawng rakowi aklow tarua phawnglawng ang kar mih chaw. Nami khin khe takrow lai rakowi maru maten namaw kown, sakkraingra maten paw natama kown. Nami klen kowi rut hai khawk paw nachür klukluk kown. CHAKRAMANG tek nami dow uang tarü thüm khowk pe; nami dow naphaw ngengche kown pe,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 21:8" />Now CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 21:9" />“Aw maru chapa, pur prakowi nauang ting kown mih lawnguan Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi maiawng tek pe diah, ‘Saidawng dow sükta kaneu now sawkta kaneu lowk khowk. <verse eid="EZK 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 21:10" />Nami saidawng dow nangenla maru kownkow sükah kaneu mih chekhai, now pla nowi iawng dow natawk pliplip kownkow sawkah mih chekhai. Hang piaw büah tham bowt. Ang laiklow miapaw enni chün dowi rakowi ripra dow uang ting kown chowbowt,’ pape dit.<verse eid="EZK 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 21:11" />“Saidawng dow natawngah kownkow sükah now sawkah kaneu mih chekhai. Nami saidawng dow sai maru mih rut kowi naap pe kownkow sükah now sawkah kaneu mih chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 21:12" />Aw maru chapa, ang maru-uüa hai Israel pren kowi kowh aluchow maten vüi saidawng dow natawngah kown. Naiawng rakowi kar hai nguk hown uowi diah. Ang maru-uüa hown Israel pren kowi kowh aluchowuüa maten paw saidawng rut kowi nakowng kown chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ti downgprang diah. <verse eid="EZK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 21:13" />Ang maru-uüa kowi ang chaingah mih chekhai. Amatni che tarip kown nau dowi kowh chalow now naiawngün dow amatni luk kowi nauang ting ngengche kown chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 21:14" />“Naiawng rakowi aw maru chapa, pur prakowi nauang ting kown mih lawnguan krawi tek diah. Now nauang lüa ting kown mih lawnguan kowi kunmarau kowh phek rut diah. Saidawng dow aplan aplan maru-uüa luk kowi pauang cham kla lah. Nami saidawng dow nangenla maru kown mih chekhai. Nami dow maru akawmma kowi nangenla kown mih chekhai. Nami saidawng dow amatni kowi nauang umta lut kown. <verse eid="EZK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 21:15" />Nangenla amatni kownkow tapplawt towng saidawng dow ang krawi tow pe khai. Nami saidawng dow khi büah hanow kram lai rakowi auaklakma naphaw ne kownkow ang krawi tow pe mih chekhai. Nami saidawng dow pla nowi iawng tawk pliplip chekhai; nami dow nangenla maru kownkow sükah mih chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 21:16" />Aw achukma mih saidawng, hawmlawm prakowi krawi tu diah, now lakuai prakowi paw krawi tu diah. En nau iawng lowra prakowi krawi tu diah. <verse eid="EZK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 21:17" />Nami khin khe dow ang naphek rut kown, now ang kowh kunmaraura naprowng bowt kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG ngengche mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Babulawn mang kowh saidawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 21:18" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 21:19" />“Aw maru chapa, Babulawn mang kowh saidawng nauangla kown mih tiama pre buk kowi thawp pe matra diah. Nami tiama pre buk mih dow Babulawn pren paprenchow hownia kowh nauang lawt kown mih chekhai. Now marow prakowi nauangla kown mih tiaprek kowi dow towla pe amatra chüng diah. <verse eid="EZK 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 21:20" />Tiama lowk dow Amawnuüa kowh marow kri Raba pra kowh mangla mih naown kown, now alowk mih dow Judauüa kowh tap tapat lut mih marow kri Jerusalem pra kowh mangla mih naown kown. <verse eid="EZK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 21:21" />Nami tiaprek re-e uang ting hanow tawng pra chow mang kown mih tuk dowi rakowi Babulawn mang dow natathüp kown. Tawng pra chow mang kown mih natukla kownkow nami re-e dow naap leba sek kown, aia kowh thuraiuüa tut-e napaw prengia kown, now namü asadua plawng kown. <verse eid="EZK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 21:22" />Nami khin khe aia rut kowi kowh leba sek dow Jerusalem marow pra kowh mangla mih tiama natüng pe kown. Now nakowi dow nakhuela tap kown mih uanh natow pe kown, naklawla tap kown mih hai tap hownia nadowmla kown mih bawn paw nachun büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 21:23" />Jerusalem maru-uüa dow Babulawn mang nimkrüa kowi nauowi kownkow takham khowk chekhai. Naiawng rakowi naiawngün lawnguan naowm büah kown nadowi. Nachenganchepaw amatni kowh angak mih Babulawn mang natüng pe hanow nakhümla kown.<verse eid="EZK 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 21:24" />“Naiawng rakowi ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek khowk, atarlarma enni chang ngak hai enni kowh aprek dow enni tüngah khai. Enni kowh lup maten kowi enni kowh aprek dow tatüng khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi nakhümla enni hanow nar kowi natow enni kown.<verse eid="EZK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 21:25" />“Aw angakma hai asür alawkma mih Israel mang, en kowh ni chur khin uang ting khowk, en kowh piakra khin uang na khai bowt. <verse eid="EZK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 21:26" />Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek khowk, en kowh napawng iiata diah, now en kowh mang lukruk paw towta diah. Kawmat kowh uowi iawng nauowi kown nadowi bowt; maru iuk kowi asowmchow, asowmchow mih kowi maru iuk nachangah bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 21:27" />Jerusalem marow dow napiak kown, nami marow dow asaima ang napiakta kown. Nachenganchepaw mami marow kowi nachet pe tara kown kurdik uowi mih kowi mami marow dow ang napeah kown. Nami kurdik pawk mih maru uang ting dowi mowr mami marow dow napiak kown nadowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saidawng lowk hai Amawnuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 21:28" />“Aw maru chapa, Israeluüa kowi peah rukrai mih Amawnuüa luk kowi pur prakowi nauang ting kown mih lawnguan maiawng kowtek pe dit: CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Saidawng dow akawp hownia howkta khai bowt; nami saidawng dow nangenla maru kownkow sükah mih chekhai, now tu maru khe pla nowi iawng dow natawk pliplip kownkow sawkah mih chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 21:29" />Amawn pren kowi kowh maru ngakuüa low, enni kowh mukmang dow adai chowtaih, daila kowi enni cham owm khai. Naiawng rakowi saidawng dow enni ngawng kowi tangta enni hüah khowk; enni kowh chur khin dow uang ting kown chowbowt, enni kowh piakra khin dow uang towm khai bowt.<verse eid="EZK 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 21:30" />“‘Aw Amawnuüa, enni kowh saidawng mih akawp kowi phangta diah. Enni kowh phuaru rah, enni kowh pipu-uüa pren kowi ang nachet enni tara kown. <verse eid="EZK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 21:31" />Ang kowh kunmaraura dow enni luk kowi ang nauang sunah kown, now mapaw ang sak-ih dowi mih dow maih iawng nakam enni kown. Maru sai kiakma miuüa, maru lang ngah miuüa rut kowi ang nacham ap enni kown. <verse eid="EZK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 21:32" />Enni dow maih kowi kowh nawmah mih sawp iawng naown kown. Enni kowh vi dow enni matia pren kowi nahawk kown. Enni nachum bowk kown chekhai. Naiawng rakowi maru maten natamata enni kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG ngengche mami laiklow ang tek khowk,’ pape dit,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 21:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EZK 22" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow kowh angak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 22:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 22:2" />“Aw maru chapa, nachet tara kownkow kamrütia hown en uowi bow? Kamrütia hown che en uowi now sai maru reng mih Jerusalem marow kowi chet pe tara diah. Aia kowh suiiai kaniaima mih lup maten phuang pe dit. <verse eid="EZK 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 22:3" />Aia kowi dow maiawng kowtek pe diah: CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Mami chowbowt chang ngak mih marow. Mami chowbowt aiamat maru-uüa kowi sai now pamatia luk kowi uang pawla phih reng mih marow. Thawp arup aren now pamatia kowi sürah lawkah mih marow mami chowbowt. Naiawng rakowi aia kowh ripra khin mih uang tarü khowk. <verse eid="EZK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 22:4" />Sai maru hanow en chang aprek khai, now thawp arup aren hanow en tasür talawk khai. En matia kowh tara chetra ni dow en uang tawnla khai, en kowh chur khin dow uang ting khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi akeng chenchapuüa tut-e ang nachangla en prawng renra kown, now akeng prenchakuüa maten nachangla en rensi kau kown. <verse eid="EZK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 22:5" />Aw mapaw thaulangra uowi dowi mih marow, atawnchow kowi kowh uowi miuüa hai alakma kowi kowh uowi miuüa naprawng naren en kown.<verse eid="EZK 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 22:6" />“‘Sam mü madiah, Israel pren kruitown miuüa maten dow nasai maru kownkow amatni kowh kür tawngah büah khai. <verse eid="EZK 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 22:7" />Maru-uüa dow u-pa kowi nü dowi klowk dowi chekhai, prenlang maru-uüa kowi paw chang nowng chang powng khai. Nami klen kowi saratchow hown mamaimowuüa kowi paw kuanah khai. <verse eid="EZK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 22:8" />Ang kowh arah chimsaima mih kowi en nüah klowkah dowi, now ang kowh tanai ni ün paw chimsaima en towah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 22:9" />Enni pungmadawng kowi tawngbak mih maru dow maru iung kowi nasaita kownkow küa daila reng mih uowi ne chekhai. Marow kowi kowh maru-uüa dow hungh luk kowi kowh phuchuara kowi ün cham cha nat ngar reng chekhai, now lainowmma chang iawt chang iang khai. <verse eid="EZK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 22:10" />Maru-uüa dow u-uai hown paw chang iang khai, now uisawng uowi mih masiuüa kowi paw kür hown krawi phua krawi iuaah khai. <verse eid="EZK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 22:11" />En maru-uüa dow klowkchakuüa kowh masi hown paw chang iang khai, iaumowuüa hown paw chang iang khai, now tuamow tawng miuüa kowi paw kür hown phuaah iuaah khai. <verse eid="EZK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 22:12" />Pamatia maru-uüa kowi nasaila kownkow en maru-uüa dow cha büm reng chekhai. En maru-uüa dow cham pe lowi chepaw arawn amatma paw achüt reng chekhai. Amatni dow pamatia klowkchakuüa kowi kür hown paw pe tangka reng chekhai. Aw Jerusalem, en tamata ang khai bowt. Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="EZK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 22:13" />“‘En maru-uüa dow krawi kuan maru khai, now sai pamatia maru khai. Naiawng rakowi ang kowh rut kunta hüah mih dow enni luk kowi ang nauang pe klaah kown. <verse eid="EZK 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 22:14" />Nauang pe en ripra kownkow ang uang mih khin khe dow en kowh sakkraingra nauowi kown bow? En kowh rut kowi kür nauowi kown tak bow? Ang CHAKRAMANG ngengche mami laiklow ang tek khowk, now ang tekta mih dow ang nachang ngengche kown. <verse eid="EZK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 22:15" />En kowh maru-uüa kowi dow akeng chenchapuüa tut-e hai akeng pren kowi ang nacham uetah kown, now en lak kowi kowh asür alawi maten dow ang nahenta kown. <verse eid="EZK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 22:16" />Naiawng rakowi chenchapuüa pur kowi en narukrai kown. Nami khin khe dow ang CHAKRAMANG, ang chang en mih chekhai pami en natuk bowt kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem kowi chimsaiah kown takla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 22:17" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 22:18" />“Aw maru chapa, Israeluüa dow ang tut-e mapaw asung uang dowi chekhai. Amatni dow maih kowi eng tai khe kowh kaah asun dowk kowh kuakta mih lawngha, kri hai kheh taraw nak mih kih iawng chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 22:19" />Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow maiawng ang tek pe khai: ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek khowk, ‘Enni bowkbowk chowng lawngha kih khai bowt, naiawng kowh Jerusalem marow kowi ang nakua enni kown. <verse eid="EZK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 22:20" />Tai, kri, lawngha hai kheh kowi maih kowi nawmah now chawrah kownkow maru hut pe maih khai. Nami powm iawng dow marow kowi arasang ang nakua enni hanow mapaw ang sak-ih dowi mih hai ang kunmaraura maih iawng lün pluplup mih hown ang narip enni kown. <verse eid="EZK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 22:21" />Ang nakua enni hanow ang kowh kunmaraura maih iawng lün pluplup mih hown marow kowi dow ang nachawr enni kown. <verse eid="EZK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 22:22" />Taping maih kowi tai chawr mih iawng dow enni paw marow kowi nachawr kown. Nami khin khe dow ang CHAKRAMANG ngengche ang kowh kunmaraura enni luk kowi uang pe tingah mih chekhai pami enni natuk bowt kown,’ ang pape khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel pren kruitown miuüa kowh angak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 22:23" />Now CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang iawk mih, <verse eid="EZK 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 22:24" />“Aw maru chapa, Israel pren kowi maiawng tek pe diah: CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘En dow asür alawkma mih pren chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ang kunmarau mih ni khe en dow asür alawkma mih pren nachowng kown. Nami dow katpaw uang uang dowi mih pren nachowng kown,’ pape diah. <verse eid="EZK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 22:25" />En kowh risiuüa dow nachang lup ngak kownkow thawp prengia khai; amatni dow hek rawmrawm mih krangsi iawng dow krawi lim maru sak khai. Amatni dow krawi sai maru hanow dawngthawnguan hai asung khak khakma mih uanh krawi rup khai. Amatni dow saita pe huauüa hanow masiuüa akawmma kowi pe chowngah mamaimow khai. <verse eid="EZK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 22:26" />En kowh uamowuüa dow ang kowh ari aiang kowi kingküala mih lup chang büah khai, now ang kowh chimsaima mih uanh ün paw chimsaima towah büah dowi chekhai. Chimsaima mih chap hai chimsai dowi mih chap paw lang kraah dowi chekhai. Chimsai hai chimsai dowi mih lawnguan maru kowi paw tüngsang büah dowi chekhai. Ang kowh tanai ni ün nasun kown mih lawnguan kowi paw chang tuk dowi iow büah khai. Naiawngün rakowi amatni tut-e kowh ang kowh ming chimsaima mih dow piak khai bowt. <verse eid="EZK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 22:27" />En kowh aluchowuüa dow sui iawng krawi sai maru khai, now nakhünta pe dawngthawnguan kownkow krawi sai maru khai. <verse eid="EZK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 22:28" />Amatni kowh lup ngak nakhu nadaula pe kownkow amatni kowh risiuüa dow tek dai lai khai. CHAKRAMANG tek dowi chepaw, ‘CHAKRAMANG tek khowk,’ padow krawi tek büah khai. <verse eid="EZK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 22:29" />Iawngpa mih maru-uüa paw tachang nowng tachang powng khai, amatni lala tachang damra khai. Amatni dow ngarawng ngarai miuüa hai akhawr hown uowi miuüa kowi kuanah khai. Nami klen kowi prenlang maru-uüa luk kowi paw chet pe tara nowm lak dow kutplan changah nowng büah khai.<verse eid="EZK 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 22:30" />“Naiawng rakowi tachi tanawmra tap nowng raw kown mih maru, ang kowh kunmaraura hown ang napiakta pe pren kown khe kowh nahang ang kown mih maru, tap takhue mih hownia naiowng hanow ang pur kowi natek lai kown mih maru ang krawi cham lowk ia chowdiah. Tawkchedow mia kowi paw ang ka dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 22:31" />Naiawng rakowi ang kowh kunmaraura dow amatni luk kowi ang nape klaah kown, now amatni kowh chowm krang uowi krang sung dow ang napeah kown. Amatni kowh angak rakowi ang kowh kunmaraura maih iawng lün pluplup mih hown amatni kowi ang napiakta kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EZK 23" />
  <para style="s">Chang iang mih masiuüa pre ia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 23:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 23:2" />“Aw maru chapa, masiuüa uowi pre ia. Nami masiuüa pre ia mih dow amachak chah chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 23:3" />Amatchi dow ning diachow hownia Aigupta pren kowi chang chawkkrawma lup khai, now Aigupta prenchakuüa dow amatchi hown taphua taiua khai. Naiawng hai amatchi kowh malauüara chimsaima mih dow piak pe khai. <verse eid="EZK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 23:4" />Amatchi pre ia kowi lang ta mih ming dow Ohola chekhai, now lang sawi mih ming dow Oholiba chekhai. Ohola dow Samari kowi kowh uatah mih chekhai, now Oholiba dow Jerusalem kowi kowh uatah mih chekhai. Akung kowi amatchi dow uang chowng ang masi khai, now ka chu ka cha iüah khai.<verse eid="EZK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ohola kowh angak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="EZK 23:5-6" />“Ohola dow ang masi chowbowt chepaw chang iawt chang iang khai. Aia dow amanau Asuriauüa hown taphua taiua kown mih lainowmma irh khai. Aia irhah mih maru-uüa dow mintau pau rawng uan khupma mih siphaiuüa ün, siphai aluchowuüa ün, pren kruitown miuüa ün chekhai. Naiawngün maru-uüa maten dow kawrnga kowi kowh chowm miuüa hai klangiungma kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 23:5-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 23:7" />Aia dow Asuria pren kowi kowh maru iukuüa maten tut-e chawkkrawma iawng dow tape khai. Aia irhah mih maru-uüa kowh arup aren maten hown aia dow tawi tasür talawk khai. <verse eid="EZK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 23:8" />Aigupta pren kowi kowh aia uownah mih chawkkrawma lup dow aia towta dowi tak chekhai. Aigupta pren kowi ning diachow reng tak khe maru taiua mawkla ün hanow aia kowh malauüara chimsaima mih dow piakta pe khai, now nakowi kowh manau-uüa maten dow chawkkrawma iawng aia kowi tawngah kengah khai.<verse eid="EZK 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 23:9" />“Naiawng rakowi aia irhah mih Asuriauüa, aia kowh manau-uüa rut kowi dow ang apta khai. <verse eid="EZK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 23:10" />Aia kowi dow tengiow tengklaima Asuriauüa towah khai, now aia kowh chauüa kowi dow rupta pe hanow aia kowi dow saidawng hown saiah khai. Aia kowh ripra lawnguan dow kawmat pat akeng mih masiuüa hawmh changla talawp müa khai.<verse eid="EZK 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oholiba kowh angak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 23:11" />“Anaumow Oholiba dow naiawngün maten khi khai. Nachenganchepaw aia dow ataimow lak-e lang chang ngak khai; aia kowh leura hai aia kowh chawkkrawma lup dow ataimow lak-e lang hu khai. <verse eid="EZK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 23:12" />Aia paw Asuriauüa hown taphua taiua kown mih lainowmma irh khai. Aia irhah mih maru-uüa dow mintau pau rawng uan khupma mih siphaiuüa, siphai aluchowuüa, pren kruitown miuüa ün chekhai. Naiawngün maru-uüa maten dow kawrnga kowi kowh chowm mih hai klanguüa klangiungma kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 23:13" />Aia paw aiamat kowi sürah lawkah mih ang khi khai; amatchi tainau pre ia trui kowh uowi krang dow katsang chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="EZK 23:14-15" />“Nachenganchepaw chawkkrawma lup chang prakowi Oholiba dow ataimow lak-e lang rawn khai. Aia dow kimbang kowi kowh thawpah mih Babulawn pren kachakuüa pung khi khai. Nami pung kowi kowh maru-uüa dow kowrmow ring khupma panow kelang kowi kekawm ükma hai lu kowi napawng mai taruang phownlown chekhai. Naiawngün dow Babulawn pren kowi kowh siphai aluchowuüa iawng kangowh chekhai <verse eid="EZK 23:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 23:16" />Naiawngün kowi khi hown akrowksang Oholiba dow naiawngünuüa hown taphua taiua kown mih lainowmma irh khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow Babulawn pren kowi kowh naiawngün maru-uüa tut-e kowchin maru khai. <verse eid="EZK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 23:17" />Nami satang ka hanow Babulawn maru-uüa dow aia tut-e uang khai, now aia hown dow uang taiua mawkla khai. Now aia hown dow chang iang hanow aia kowi dow sürah lawkah khai. Nami maru-uüa hown tasür talawk kung kowi aia dow nami maru-uüa kowi suiah khai bowt. <verse eid="EZK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 23:18" />Aia kowh chawkkrawma lup chang dow atarlarma chekhai bowt, now aia kowh tengiow tengklaima mih dow maru maten kowi pe khi-ah khai. Nami khin khe dow ataimow kowi kowh ang suiah mih iawng aia kowi paw ang suiah khai. <verse eid="EZK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 23:19" />Aia malauüa tadowklowtchow khe kowh Aigupta pren kowi aia chang mih ün dow aia tuakah hanow aia kowh chawkkrawma lup chang aia pe huah ngamlam khai. <verse eid="EZK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 23:20" />Aigupta maru-uüa iawng mih kowi lainowmma aia prüa khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Aigupta maru-uüa kowh kow uanh dow kawrngaramchük hai kawrnga kowh haupawk müa uanh iawng chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 23:21" />“Aw Oholiba, en malauüa tadowklowtchow khe Aigupta maru-uüa pren en iawnah hanow en kowh malauüa chimsaira dow piakta en khai. Nachenganchepaw naiawngün maru-uüa hown kawmat paw chang iang iawk kown mih en nau reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oholiba kowi Thurai chet pe tara mih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 23:22" />“Naiawng rakowi ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai, ang tek khowk. En suiah kowh en kingküaah khowk mih en kowh manau-uüa maten kowi nakingküa en kownkow ang nakua en kown, now amatni dow nakingküa en kownkow en tavir lut ang nauang pawla en kown. <verse eid="EZK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 23:23" />Babulawnuüa hai Kaldaiuüa, Pekud, Shua, kua hai Asuriauüa maten kowi ang nauang pawla en kown. Amatni dow kawrnga kowi kowh chowm mih, siphai, siphai aluchow, pren kruitown mih, maru iuk hai klanguüa klangiungma kangowh chekhai. Amatni dow kawrnga kowi chowm se nauang kown. <verse eid="EZK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 23:24" />Amatni dow tasen müa rutchün khawkleng, kawrnga kari, uanh pawk müa kari hai maru akawmma nakingküa en kownkow nauang tarü kown. Amatni dow asowmchow mih hai aiukma mih kawngma dowk hai lawngha lukruk krukma kangowh nauang rum en kown. Narip en kownkow amatni rut kowi dow ang naap en kown, now amatni dow amatni kowh tara chet krang hown narip en kown. <verse eid="EZK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 23:25" />En luk kowi lainowmma ang kunmarau khai. Naiawng rakowi kunmarauma hown narip en kownkow amatni kowi dow ang natawngah kown. Amatni dow nahiahta en nakawng hai paramkui kown, now en maru-uüa kowi dow nakowngta en bowk kown. Amatni dow en kowh chapa chamauüa kowi nakhümah hanow napawla en kown, now ta lat miuüa kowi dow maih kowi asing nanawmah hanow nakowngta kown. <verse eid="EZK 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 23:26" />Amatni dow en kowh dawnguan naklüpta en kown, now en kowh klangiung klangiungma hai asung khakma mih tatawng müa uanh paw napawta en kown. <verse eid="EZK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 23:27" />Aigupta pren kowi kowh en uownah mih chawkkrawma lup chang hai iang chang dow naiawng hown ang nachurta en kown. Nahanow naiawngün maru-uüa prakowi en nadang kown nadowi bowt, now Aigupta pren kowi paw en naka tuak kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="EZK 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 23:28" />“En suiah mih maru-uüa, en suiah kowh en kingküaah khowk miuüa rut kowi ang naap en kown. <verse eid="EZK 23:28" /><verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="EZK 23:29-30" />Amatni dow nasui en kown, now en kowh kawm rak dow narupta en bowk kown. Amatni dow tengiow tengklaima hai akhaw aklaima nata towta en hüah kown. Nami khin khe dow en kowh chawkkrawma lup chang natatüng bowt kown. Akeng chenchapuüa hown en chang iang khai, akeng chenchapuüa kowh arup aren hown en tasür talawk khai. En kowh iang chang hai chawkkrawma lup chang rakowi naiawngün dow en luk kowi nauang ting kown. <verse eid="EZK 23:29-30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 23:31" />En taimow kowh uowi krang iawng en tawi uowi khai. Naiawng rakowi en taimow kowh ripra bia dow en kowi paw ang nape en kown.<verse eid="EZK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 23:32" />“Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek khowk:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:32">En taimow kowh ripra bia dow en nakham kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:32">nami bia dow aiuk hai abüpma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 23:32">Nami kowi dow ahuma takowi khai rakowi nami hownia kham hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:32">maru nasui en hai maru nachangla en rensi kau kown.<verse eid="EZK 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 23:33" />Kramra hai piakra bia hownia, en taimow Samari kowh bia hownia en kham hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:33">pua hai sak prüa rau atekma en nauowi kown.<verse eid="EZK 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 23:34" />Nami bia dow asaima pat en nakhamta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:34">bia paw en nabiata prowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 23:34">En ki kham hanow nami bia dow en nateuta prawt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:34">now nami bia di bia sek hown dow en kowh iawnün en nataah kown.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 23:34">“Nami dow naphaw ngengche kown, ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="EZK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 23:35" />“En tamata ang khai, now en kung prakowi en towta ang khai. Naiawng rakowi en kowh iang chang hai chawkkrawma lup chang sung dow en nakham kown takla. Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai, mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ohola hai Oholiba kowh ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 23:36" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, Ohola hai Oholiba kowi nachet pe tara kownkow kamrütia hown en uowi bow? Kamrütia hown che en uowi now amatchi kowh suiiai kaniaima mih lup lawnguan kowi tek pe diah. <verse eid="EZK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 23:37" />Amatchi dow chang iang hai sai maru sak khai. Amatchi dow arup aren hown chang iang khai, now ang vüi kowi kowh kaah mih chauüa kowi paw saiah khai. Amatchi dow ang vüi kowi kowh kaah mih chauüa kowi maih kowi nawmah now changla arup aren phuchua müa khai. <verse eid="EZK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 23:38" />Nami klen kowi ang kowh kim chimsaima mih paw sürlawkta nak khai, ang kowh Tanai Ni paw chimsaima towah iüah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 23:39" />Amatchi dow amatchi kowh chauüa kowi arup arenuüa vüi ngen pe khai, now nami ni kowi ang kowh kim chimsaima mih kowi paw uang kup hanow sürlawkah khai. Naiawng dow ang kowh kim chimsaima mih kowi changah iüah khai.<verse eid="EZK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 23:40" />“Nami klen kowi Ohola hai Oholiba iüah dow pren lakma hownia nauang pawla maru kownkow cham chin maru khai. Naiawngün maru-uüa uang ting hanow amatchi dow lu tui lu lam khai, now sü mikkhu pawi ün hanow baing chang müa hown tatawng iüah khai. <verse eid="EZK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 23:41" />Nami kung kowi dow mawk rah klangiungma mih kowi chowm iüah khai. Now naiawngün maru-uüa pur kowi tow pe pawitang khai, now nami pawitang luk kowi dow ang kowh maikhük towk müa hai sau tow pe iüah khai. <verse eid="EZK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 23:42" />Amatchi tut-e dow maru kawm klow nowk chawplawp chekhai. Naiawngün nowk chawplawp mih maru-uüa dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh arak kham lu-uüa chekhai. Naiawngün maru-uüa dow amatchi tainau rut kowi ü pe kuaiseh khai, now amatchi lu kowi dow mang lukruk klangiungma mih kruk pe khai. <verse eid="EZK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 23:43" />Nami khin khe chang iang kowh kow uakma mih masiuüa lawnguan kowi ang tek pe mih, ‘Kawmat dow amatchi kowi chawkkrawma kowi iawng dow naiawngün maru-uüa pacham tawngah lah, now aia paw naiawngün maru-uüa hown pacham chang iang lah,’ pakhai. <verse eid="EZK 23:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 23:44" />Now chawkkrawma hown kowh maru taiua mawk iawng dow leulama mih Ohola hai Oholiba hown maru taiua mawk khai bowt. <verse eid="EZK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 23:45" />Nachenganchepaw chang iang mih hai sai maru sak mih sung amatchi kowh kakbak ripra dow amatchi kowi maru iunguüa napeah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatchi dow chang iang hai sai maru sak khai.<verse eid="EZK 23:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 23:46" />“Naiawng rakowi ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai, mami laiklow ang tek khowk, amatchi kowi nakingküaah kownkow ang nauang pawla pe maru kawm kown. Amatchi kowi dow kramra uowima mih hai damrauüa rut kowi ang naap-ah kown. <verse eid="EZK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 23:47" />Naiawngün maru-uüa dow hua hown nakuakah hanow amatchi kowi dow nakowngta kown, now saidawng hown amatchi kowi dow nadungta naknak kown. Naiawngün maru-uüa dow amatchi kowh chauüa kowi nakowngta pe kown, now amatchi kowh kim dow natowkta pe kown.<verse eid="EZK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 23:48" />“Aw Ohola hai Oholiba, naiawngün khi hanow masiuüa maten pacham tarip lah, now enchi iawng hang pacham chang lup ngak lah. Naiawng hai pren kowi kowh lup ngak chang dow ang nachurta kown. <verse eid="EZK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 23:49" />Enchi kowh lup ngak chang sung dow enchi chowtaih nakham kown, now arup aren chup mih angak sung dow enchi nakur kown. Nami khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG Thurai pami enchi natuk bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 23:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EZK 24" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow piak kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 24:1" />Nar kowi anging uowi mih taku ning nga hamüt la hamüt ni khe CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. <verse eid="EZK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 24:2" />CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, ani mih Jerusalem marow kowi Babulawnuüa rumah thüm chekhai. Naiawng rakowi en mih ani kowh akhin ruiah diah. <verse eid="EZK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 24:3" />Mami kingküa hai sen dawma mih chenchap kowi mami laiuat dow tek pe diah. Amatni kowi dow maiawng kowtek pe diah: CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZK 24:3" />
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:3">“‘Puh kowi thut pe tui hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:3">puh dow maih luk kowi towngah diah.<verse eid="EZK 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="EZK 24:4-5" />Now ruapur hawmh hownia lang klangiung mih ruapur dow ngenah lowk hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:4-5">anga sek dow puh lak kowi towah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:4-5">athung nga hai apang nga aiung aiungma mih towah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:4-5">Aiung aiungma mih ahut hown puh dow pe tekah diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:4-5">puh daw kowi dow awr sua pe sawp diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:4-5">now nami dow maih hown angatma engah diah,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 24:4-5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 24:6" />Nami klen kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Nami sai maru sak mih marow kowh piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow! Aia dow aki lawt khowk mih, ia sawk ia sauah dowi bowt mih puh iawng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi chaknga sek dow ruiah dowi kowi asek uowi mih maten nami puh hownia khowngta diah. <verse eid="EZK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 24:7" />Nami marow kowi dow sai maru sak khai. Nami vi dow huaklu luk kowi khükah büah khai; dinchow hown nau taphum khai diah mih bawn kowi khükah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 24:8" />Nami vi dow napaw lu klai kownkow ang tut-e pacham awr kar lah pakowh hua luk kowi ang pe hawkah mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 24:9" />Now CHAKRAMANG Thurai plan tek iawk mih, “Nami sai maru sak mih marow kowh piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow! Ang matia paw natawi kua sawp hanow ahuma nakrowngah kown. <verse eid="EZK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 24:10" />Naiawng rakowi ahuma bawk sawp büa diah, now sua pe maih büa diah. Chaknga dow mawsala hown lawkah kaneu hanow klangiungma engah büa diah, now ahut ün dow tikah büa diah. <verse eid="EZK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 24:11" />Nami kung kowi puh khaw mih nadenla kownkow, aringma naphawla kownkow, tasür talawk mih nachawr bowk kownkow hai asür alawi maten nakamla kownkow mairing luk kowi chowmah diah. <verse eid="EZK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 24:12" />Tawkchedow tawngpaw mrawkra uowi dowi, now nami lak kowi kowh mawngchawng paw ia tui dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nami puh dow maih kowi hing nawmta diah. <verse eid="EZK 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 24:13" />Aw Jerusalem, en kowh lup ngak dow en cham tasür talawk mih chekhai. Ang sawk ang sau en chepaw en kowh sürlawi dow tama dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ang kowh kunmaraura maten en luk kowi ang uang sunta bowk dowi mowr dow en nachimsai kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 24:14" />Ang kowh lup chang khin uang ting khai bowt. Nami lup dow ang nachang ngengche bowt kown, mapaw ang nasana en kown nadowi bowt. Ang kowh saktuak ang naleta kown nadowi bowt chekhai. En kowh chowm krang uowi krang iawng hai en kowh lup chang krang iawng dow ang nachet en tara bowt kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai, mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ezekiel masi kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 24:15" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 24:16" />“Aw maru chapa, en masi kowi ang napawta en kown; en masi dow mingmang dowi khe nakowng kown. Nachenganchepaw hangkow nguk hangkow kar diah, mik tui paw hangkow hawk diah. <verse eid="EZK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 24:17" />Asachowchi en nahü sak surlur kown. Napawng paw hangkow iiaah diah, phanaikhawk paw hangkow klüp diah. Taprüa tanguk khin khe kowh chang reng iawng hangkow chang diah, maru uang sa en mih chakkham paw hangkow cha diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 24:18" />Now CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih laiklow dow rau-e khe maru kawmuüa kowi ang tek pe khai, now iak pra dow ang masi kowng khai. Now auai rau dow CHAKRAMANG pe ang mih ana iawng dow ang chang khai bowt. <verse eid="EZK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 24:19" />Nami khin khe naiawngün ang chang mih khi hanow maru lünta ang mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng en uowi? Naiawng en chang mih auan tawng chow?” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 24:20" />Naiawng rakowi ang tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e maiawng uang ting khai, <verse eid="EZK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 24:21" />‘Ang kowh kim — enni kowh kürra enni changla bawri reng mih, enni mik kowi kowh lang klangiung mih, nakowkowi kown enni lang süngür sakkraiah reng mih — ang kowh kim chimsaima mih dow ang napiakta kown, now enni ta lawtla mih ngeuüa maten dow tasenra kowi saidawng hown nakowng kown. <verse eid="EZK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 24:22" />Nami khin khe dow ang chang iawng enni paw natawi chang kown. Taprüa tanguk khin khe kowh chang reng iawng enni nachang kown nadowi bowt, now maru uang sa enni mih chakkham paw enni nacha kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 24:23" />Enni lu kowi kowh napawng enni nasuiah reng kown, phanaikhawk paw enni nakrua reng kown, now kar paw enni nakar kown nadowi bowt. Tawkche enni matia ngak rakowi enni kowh kow napiak kown, now kukpa enni nauowila uiting uangtak kown. <verse eid="EZK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 24:24" />Ezekiel dow enni tut-e amatra iawng naown kown; aia chang iawng rowprowp enni natawi chang kown. Naiawng phaw mih khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami enni natuk bowt kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 24:25" />CHAKRAMANG kutplan tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, amatni changla bawri reng mih amatni kowh Thurai chup kim, amatni kowh awmrawmra hai rowsira kim, amatni mik kowi kowh lang klangiung mih kim, amatni tut-e kowh asung lang uowi mih Thurai chup kim dow ang napiakta pe kown. Nami klen kowi amatni kowh chauüa kowi paw ang napawta pe kown. <verse eid="EZK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 24:26" />Nami ni khe dow Jerusalem kowi matawng ngai chow phaw mih Jerusalem hownia kowh ia powt mih maru lowk ia dow nauang phowng en satang kown. <verse eid="EZK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 24:27" />Nami khin khe dow en kowh nawr mih natauow bowt kown, now nami maru hown en nataklang bowt kown. En kowh dai nataklia kown nadowi bowt. Naiawng hai en mih dow amatni tut-e amatra naown kown. Nahanow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EZK 25" />
  <para style="s">Amawnuüa kowh aprek hai ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 25:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 25:2" />“Aw maru chapa, Amawn pren prakowi dangah now pur prakowi amatni luk kowi kowh phih nauang ting kown mih laiklow tek pe dit. <verse eid="EZK 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 25:3" />Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai, ang kowh mami laiklow nasünta kownkow tek pe diah, ‘Ang kowh kim tasür talawk mih hai Israel pren piak mih hai Juda maru-uüa kowi nachangla nar kownkow maru pawla mih khi hanow lainowmma enni awmrawm khai. <verse eid="EZK 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 25:4" />Naiawng rakowi enni uowi rah satlawt pra kowh maru-uüa rut kowi ang naap enni kown. Amatni dow enni pren kowi nauang thawp tangbung hanow enni lak kowi natawi uowi büah kown. Now amatni dow enni kowh uih-ak nacha kown, enni kowh iawn tui paw nakham kown. <verse eid="EZK 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 25:5" />Rabba marow kowi dow ut tawkra ang changah kown, now Amawn pren kowi dow ruapur hawmh naira ang nachangah kown. Nami khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami enni natuk bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 25:6" />Israel pren piak mih enni khi hanow prowk se prowk se phek rut now enni plai khai. Israel kowi dow enni sak-hiaah lai kowh enni kowh sak dow lainowmma piaw khai. <verse eid="EZK 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 25:7" />Naiawng rakowi ang matia kür hown ang narip enni kown, now cham rupah mih uanh iawng akeng chenchapuüa rut kowi ang naap enni kown. Akeng pren hai akeng chenchapuüa pungmadawng hownia ang napiak enni hanow ang namata enni kown. Nahanow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami enni natuk bowt kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Moabuüa kowh aprek hai ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 25:8" />Akung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Moabuüa hai Seiruüa tek mih, ‘Mü madiah, Juda maru-uüa paw akeng chenchapuüa maten hown tawngpaw lang taklowi dowi,’ pakhai. <verse eid="EZK 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 25:9" />Naiawng rakowi Moab pren kowi kowh rihi chawng mih marow ün dow ang napiakta pe kown; amatni kowh marow akhawtma mih Beth-Jesimawth, Baal-Meawn hai Kiriathaimün dow ang napiakta pe kown. <verse eid="EZK 25:9" /><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="EZK 25:10-11" />Chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi Amawnuüa lawnguan maru pacham tamata lah, now Moab paw pacham ka ripra lah pakowh Amawnuüa hailawm Moab kowi paw satlawt pra kowh prenchakuüa rut kowi ang naap-ah kown. Nami khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG Thurai pami natuk büah bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 25:10-11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Edawmuüa kowh aprek hai ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 25:12" />Akung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Edawmuüa mih Juda maru-uüa luk kowi paw lu klai khai. Naiawng amatni sat klai mih dow lainowmma chang ngak mih chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 25:13" />Naiawng rakowi ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai, ang tek khowk. Edawmuüa kowi mih ang napar pe rut hanow ang naripah kown, now nakowi kowh maru maten hai tawncher dow ang nakowngta bowk kown. Amatni kowh pren dow apiaknama ang natowah kown, now Teman hownia Dedan mowr tasen hown maru nakowng kown. <verse eid="EZK 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 25:14" />Edawmuüa luk kowi nasat klai kownkow ang maru Israeluüa kowi ang natawngah kown. Mapaw ang sak-ih dowi mih hai ang kowh kunmarau iawng hown Israeluüa dow Edawmuüa kowi nachangah kown. Nami khin khe dow ang CHAKRAMANG sat pe klai mih chekhai pami natuk büah bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filistinuüa kowh aprek hai ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 25:15" />Akung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Filistinuüa dow chowng ransu mih Juda maru-uüa luk kowi sat klai mih akrama khowk chekhai; amatni dow sak-hiaah lai kowh Juda maru-uüa luk kowi arawn amatma sat klai khai. <verse eid="EZK 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 25:16" />Naiawng rakowi ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk, Filistinuüa kowi ang matia kür hown ang naripah kown; Kerethiuüa kowi ang nakowngta kown, now sata pang kowi uowi mih akeng miuüa kowi ang piakta kown. <verse eid="EZK 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 25:17" />Amatni luk kowi lainowmma ang nasat klai kownkow ang kowh kunmaraura hown amatni kowi ang naripah kown. Now ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 25:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EZK 26" />
  <para style="s">Turauüa kowh aprek hai ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 26:1" />Cham takhangra kowi anging uowi mih lailowk ning nga la uown kowi kowh ni uown khe CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. <verse eid="EZK 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 26:2" />CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, Jerusalem piak mih lawnguan kowi Sur maru-uüa dow lainowmma awmrawm khai. Amatni dow, ‘Jerusalem tapiak mih iung lai bowt kowbow! Chenchapuüa kowh kun changra tapplawt dow takhue khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi kawmat dow anging kowh kun changra tiama akuangma tauow khai bowt. Marow dow tapiak khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi khaleng dow anging naiuksown bowt kown,’ pakhai. <verse eid="EZK 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 26:3" />Naiawng rakowi aw Turauüa, ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek khowk, ang nakingküa en kown. Nasen en kownkow chenchap akawmma ang nauang pawla en kown, now amatni dow sata kowi kowh tuilowng iawng nauang büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 26:4" />Now nami ang uang pawla mih maru-uüa dow en kowh tap nakhueta en kown, now en kowh kangchawngra kimkrowng paw napiakta en kown. En kowh dinchow pat ang nahenta en kown, now huaklu kiakukma mih iawng dow ang natowta en hüah kown. <verse eid="EZK 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 26:5" />En dow sata pang kowi kowh lawk dia rah en nachowng kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai mami laiklow ang tek khowk. En dow akeng chenchapuüa tut-e cham rupah mih dawngthawnguan iawng en naown kown. <verse eid="EZK 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 26:6" />En kowh kuachakuüa dow saidawng hown nakowng kown. Nami khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG Thurai pami naiawngün kowi kowh maru-uüa natuk bowt kown.<verse eid="EZK 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 26:7" />“Aw Sur, nauang sen en kownkow en uowi rah tawngphak hownia kawrnga, kawrnga kari, kawrnga kowi kowh chowm mih hai siphai hawmh akawmma hown mang maten kowi kowh lang kri mih mang Nebuknezar kowi ang nauang pawla en kown. <verse eid="EZK 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 26:8" />Amatni dow en pren lak kowi kowh kua achachow miuüa kowi narik piakta bowk kown. Now nauang senla en kownkow naklawla tap kown mih bawn alowngma nachun büah parah kown, now nachawnla tap kown mih paw arema nathawp büah parah kown. Amatni kowh kawngma dow alowngma chi nadowkah büah hanow natatungla büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 26:9" />Amatni dow tap piak müa uanh hown nakhue en tap kown, now marek hown en kowh kimkrowng ün napiakta en büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 26:10" />Amatni kowh kawrnga dow lainowmma nahu kown. Naiawngün kawrnga mang khe kowh dinchow khowm padow nathiata en mup kown. Tasen müa kawrnga, uanh pawk müa kari hai kawrnga kari nauang pawla hanow en kowh tapplawt akhuema mih hownia nauang kup büah kown. Nami khin khe kowh atün ateu dow en kowh tap khowm padow nachü lowlow kown chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 26:11" />Amatni kowh kawrnga khawk kung dow en kowh tiama maten kowi natasak kown. En maru-uüa kowi dow saidawng hown siphaiuüa nasaiah kown, now en kowh kimchüng akhawt akhawtma mih maten dow krawng kowi natakuak kown. <verse eid="EZK 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 26:12" />Amatni dow en kowh dawngthawnguan hai en kowh kun chang müa uan narupta en kown. Amatni dow nakhueta en tap kown, now en kowh kim klangiung klangiungma mih maten paw napiakta en bowk kown. Nami klen kowi en kowh singh dung kau klowk, huaklu hai dinchow khowm padow alawi uowi dowi pat asaima sata kowi nacham kuakta en büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 26:13" />En kowh meng klow dow ang narimta en bowt kown, en kowh taraw tün paw nata kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 26:14" />Huaklu kiakukma mih iawng dow ang natowta en hüah kown, now dam pawk miuüa kowh lawk dia rah en nachowng kown. En kowi dow nathawp en iawk kown nadowi bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="EZK 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sur piak mih krang ta kowh akeng chenchapuüa kar mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 26:15" />“Aw Sur, en piak mih klow, ka arau mih en maru-uüa kowh nguk klow hai en lak kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi nakowngta kown mih klow ta hanow sata ria kowi kowh uowi mih akeng prenchakuüa kram hai chür dowi tham ü? <verse eid="EZK 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 26:16" />Nami khin khe sata ria kowi kowh uowi mih akeng pren manguüa dow amatni kowh mang chowm rah hownia nadowm kown, now amatni kowh mang tawnguat hai sawt pe bawng mih uanh dow naklüpta büah kown. Lainowmma takrow takrai hai amatni dow bawn dawng kowi nachowm büah kown, atungma chür hown nauowi büah kown, now mü en hanow amawlawma naphaw büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 26:17" />Nami khin khe amatni dow maiawng natek en kar meng büah kown,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZK 26:17" />
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">“‘Aw anang lang iuk mih marow, matawng iawng chow en tuk tapiak khai!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 26:17">En maru-uüa dow sata kowi nau iawng ia mang ia kat chowdiah mowna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">En hai en maru-uüa dow sata kowi kowh lang kür mih chowdiah mana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 26:17">sata ria kowi kowh uowi mih akeng prenchakuüa maten kram en reng chowdiah mowna.<verse eid="EZK 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 26:18" />Kawmat dow en kowh piak krang khi hanow sata ria kowi kowh uowi mih akeng prenchakuüa kram hai chür khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 26:18">en kowh piak krang khi hanow en ria kowi kowh süngdum kowi uowi miuüa lainowmma takrow khai’ napa kown.<verse eid="EZK 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 26:19" />“Aw Sur, ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai, akhaw aklaima mih marow iawng ang nachang en kown. Nakowi dow miapaw nauowi kown nadowi bowt. Ang nauang pawla en ransu hanow en luk kowi tuilowng iawng dow nauang kla kown. <verse eid="EZK 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 26:20" />Nami khin khe dow alai kowh rik piak miuüa kowi miapaw tukah dowi bowt mih iawng ang namata en kown. Alai kowh rik kowng miuüa hown ang nacham pe uowi en kown. En dow sing uowi mih maru-uüa pren kowi en natawi ka uowi rah kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 26:21" />Kramra uowima hown ang nachurta en kown; en dow nauowi kown nadowi bowt. Maru nakrawi chet nakrawi cham en kown. Tawkchedow tawng nam ni khe paw nakrawi krum nakrawi ka en kown nadowi bowt. Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 26:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EZK 27" />
  <para style="s">Tura marow vüi kar meng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 27:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 27:2" />“Aw maru chapa, Tura marow vüi tek kar meng diah. <verse eid="EZK 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 27:3" />Sata kowi kowh mangla mih tiama, sata pang kowi kowh maru kawmuüa kun changra marow Sur kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah: CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:3">“‘Aw Sur, en lang klangiung padow en tatek khai.<verse eid="EZK 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 27:4" />Sata kowi kowh kun chang miuüa luk kowi en chang low khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:4">en dow klangiungma mih chawnlawng iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:4">En kowi dow klangiungma laksmauüa thawp en mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:4">en kowh klangiungra atekma mih dow amatni thawp en mih chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 27:5" />Hermawn hungh hownia uang pawla en karpowng singh büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:5">amatni dow nami singh hown thawpla en phen büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:5">Lebanawn hungh hownia dow sidar singh uang pawla en büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:5">nami hown dow lawng kowi kowh uaniang müa chüng thawpla en khai.<verse eid="EZK 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 27:6" />Amatni dow Basan pren hownia uang pawla en Sasua singh khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:6">nami singh hown dow thawpla en lawng hai müa büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:6">Saipras süngdum hownia dow painglang singh uang pawla en büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:6">nami hown dow thawpla en aphai hanow ngasai sa hown tawng en khai.<verse eid="EZK 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 27:7" />En kowh uaniang dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh uan klangiungma mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:7">nami uan dow la asinchow mih hown kawngah now sawt pe bawng mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:7">Nami khi hanow alakma hownia paw maru tuk mat en reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:7">Elisa pren hownia kowh arua hai mintau pau rawng uan dow en changla chaingchua khai.<verse eid="EZK 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 27:8" />En kowh lawng hai miuüa dow Sidawn hai Arvad marow maru-uüa chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:8">en kowh chawnlawng te miuüa dow akiakma mih maru-uüa kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 27:9" />En kowh lawng rawk miuüa dow Gebal pren kowi kowh lawngtanguüa chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:9">naiawngün maru-uüa dow arawk kiakma mih aluchowuüa kangowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:9">Lowra hownia kowh chawnlawng te miuüa dow en hown uang chang kun khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:9">naiawngün chawnlawng hai maru-uüa dow en kowh uanh pawk mih hai uanh sak mih chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 27:10" />“‘En kowh tasen müa siphai hawmh dow Persia, Lidia hai Libia pren hownia kowh chekhai. Amatni batta hüah mih kawngma hai lawngha lukruk dow en kowh klangiungra pe huah khai. <verse eid="EZK 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 27:11" />En kowh tap luk kowi kowh achawng miuüa dow Arvad hai Kilikia maru-uüa chekhai, now kimkrowng kowi kowh chawng en miuüa dow Gamad maru-uüa chekhai. Amatni kowh kawngma dow en kowh tap tapat lut mih kowi batah büah khai. En kowh klangiungra akümma chang en mih dow naiawngün maru-uüa chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 27:12" />“‘En kowh dawngthawnguan dow lainowmma hu khai. Naiawng rakowi Tarsis marow kowi kowh maru-uüa paw en hown uang tawi chang kun khai. En kowh uanh pawla büah mih takcha dow tai, lawngha, saingpru hai sisa pela en büah khai. <verse eid="EZK 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 27:13" />Javan, Tubal hai Mesek prenchak maru-uüa paw en hown tawi chang kun khai. Amatni dow pawla en uanh mih takcha kri puh, narma hai narla pela en büah khai. <verse eid="EZK 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 27:14" />Bet-Togarma marow kowi kowh maru-uüa paw pawla en kowh uanh mih takcha kawrnga, tasen müa kawrnga, kawrngaramchük pela en büah khai. <verse eid="EZK 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 27:15" />Dedan maru-uüa paw en hown tawi chang kun khai, nami klen kowi sata pang kowi kowh akeng prenchakuüa paw akawmma uang ran en kowh uanh khai, now en kowh uanh sung dow ngasai sa hai asung khakma mih singh pela en büah khai. <verse eid="EZK 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 27:16" />En marow hownia kowh lawt mih uanh dow lainowmma hu khai. Naiawng rakowi Siria prenchakuüa paw en hown tawi chang kun khai. En kowh uanh sung dow sawt pe bawng mih uan, aruama mih uan hai la asinchow mih uan pela en büah khai. Nami klen kowi asung khakma mih hua asingkrüuchow mih hai ing ruachow mih hua pela en büah khai. <verse eid="EZK 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 27:17" />Juda hai Israel prenchakuüa paw pawla en kowh uanh mih takcha Minnit hownia kowh püm, uidut uih, kuai tui, kanrawn sau hai chakhang uang mih singh pun pela en büah khai. <verse eid="EZK 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 27:18" />En marow hownia dow uanh iung hai dawngthawnguan ahuma lawt khai. Naiawng rakowi Damaska marowchakuüa paw Helbawn hownia kowh arak hai akawma mih chak pawi hown uang tawi chang kun büah khai. <verse eid="EZK 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 27:19" />Vedan hai Javan prenchak maru-uüa paw Uzal pren hownia kowh lawngha pheng ia, singh ding pik hai mawsala ün uang pawla hanow en kowh uanh takcha kowi pela en büah khai. <verse eid="EZK 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 27:20" />Dedan prenchak dow kawrnga kumlawng dau müa uan aiungma mih hown en tut-e uang tawi chang kun khai. <verse eid="EZK 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 27:21" />Arab pren hai Kedar pren aluchowuüa paw en kowh kun chang iua chekhai; amatni dow en kowh uanh takcha kowi ruapur chah, ruapur iuk hai rua uang krawi sa en büah khai. <verse eid="EZK 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 27:22" />Seba hai Rama marow hownia kowh kun chang miuüa paw pawla en kowh uanh mih takcha aiung aiungma mih mawsala, asung khakma mih hua hai kuh pela en büah khai. <verse eid="EZK 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 27:23" />Asuria pren kowi kowh Haran, Kanne, Eden, Seba, Asur hai Kilmad marow hownia kowh kun chang miuüa paw en hown uang tawi chang kun khai. <verse eid="EZK 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 27:24" />Amatni dow dawnguan klangiung klangiungma mih, aruama mih uan, sawt pe bawng mih uan, rawng klangiung klangiungma mih khawla hai leng aiungma mih ün uang pawla büah now en kowh chi kowi uang tawi sum büah khai. <verse eid="EZK 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 27:25" />En kowh chawnlawng aiukma mih uang tawnla en uanh reng chekhai, now sata dawnglang kowi dawngthawnguan atekma en uowi khai.<verse eid="EZK 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 27:26" />“‘En kowh lawng hai miuüa dow sata tui abüpma prakowi pawla en khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:26">sata dawnglang kowi dow satlawt li uang hut en hanow en tapiak nak khai.<verse eid="EZK 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 27:27" />En kowh uowi mih maten dow sata kowi nathim bowk kown:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:27">en kowh dawngthawnguan hai kun chang müa uanh maten natama bowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">En kowh chawnlawng te miuüa, arawk miuüa hai siphaiuüa maten paw nalim bowk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:27">amatni bowkbowk dow sata dawnglang kowi natamir kown.<verse eid="EZK 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 27:28" />En kowh chawnlawng te miuüa dow lainowmma napla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:28">nami klow hown sata ria kowi kowh süng ün dow nachü lowlow kown.<verse eid="EZK 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 27:29" />Lawng hai miuüa dow towla lawng hüah hanow napowt bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:29">akeng pren chawnlawng te miuüa dow sata pang hownia natang mü en kown.<verse eid="EZK 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 27:30" />Amatni dow napla hanow lainowmma nanguk nakar en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:30">lu kowi naphawk dinchow büah hanow plawi kowi nataiüa büah kown.<verse eid="EZK 27:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 27:31" />En rakowi amatni dow nakhaita sam kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:31">en rakowi amatni dow nakhup sala uan kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:31">Amatni dow lainowmma nakar nanguk büah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:31">naiawng hai amatni sak kowi rau mih dow natüng en kown.<verse eid="EZK 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 27:32" />Amatni dow atün atünma kar hown nauowila en uiting uangtak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:32">amatni dow maiawng hai natek en kar meng büah bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:32">“Tura iawng mih marow dow tawng kowi paw uowi dowi chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:32">Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow aia mih sata thing kowi rim khai bowt nowm,” pabüah kown.<verse eid="EZK 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 27:33" />“‘En kowh uanh dow pren ahuma kowi cham ting reng chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:33">en kowh kun chang müa uanh hown pren kawmma chak tawi duh reng chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:33">En kowh dow uanh hai dawngthawnguan lainowmma hu chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:33">en kowh uanh hown dow pren kawmma manguüa pat tawi kurengla chowdiah.<verse eid="EZK 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 27:34" />Kawmat dow sata tui abüpma mih kowi en tapiak khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:34">en kowh uanh hai en kowh maru maten en hown tawi thim khai bowt.<verse eid="EZK 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 27:35" />Sata ria kowi kowh akeng prenchakuüa khi en hanow amawlawma kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:35">naiawngün pren manguüa dow kram hai chür hown lumowr akangma kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 27:36" />Akeng prenchak kun chang miuüa dow khi en hanow chit en khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:36">Tawngplawng kowchow panow kramra uowima hown en piak khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:36">now en dow chowngchowng saksakma nauowi kown nadowi bowt,’ pape dit,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 27:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EZK 28" />
  <para style="s">Tura pren mang vüi CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 28:1" />Akung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 28:2" />“Aw maru chapa, Tura pren mang kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow maiawng kowtek pe diah,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">“‘En kowh saktuak dow abawrima chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:2">en matia kowi dow thurai iawng en tanü khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:2">now Tura marow dow en kowh mang chowm rah pahai en ka tuak khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">Tawkche en dow lusa maru chowtaih, thurai nadowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:2">nachepaw en dow en matia kowi thurai iawng en ka tuakah khai.<verse eid="EZK 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 28:3" />En dow Daniel lak-e en lang chanlai pahai en tatuak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:3">now <char style="w">laipet</char> maten paw en tuk pahai en matia mik kowi en tatuak chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 28:4" />En kowh dawngthawnguan dow chanlaira hai prengia hown en kramah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:4">now dawngthawnguan nungra kowi dow kuh hai tai en towah khai.<verse eid="EZK 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 28:5" />En kowh kri kraingma mih chanlaira hown en kowh dawngthawnguan en huah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:5">now en kowh dawngthawnguan rakowi en kowh saktuak dow uang bawri khai.<verse eid="EZK 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="EZK 28:6-7" />“‘En dow en matia kowi thurai iawng chanlaima en tanü khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:6-7">naiawng rakowi khaleng dow uang kingküa en kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:6-7">maru lang nga mih ransu-uüa kowi ang nauang pawla en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:6-7">Nakhowk khe amatni dow tukra hai prengia hown kowh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:6-7">en kramah mih klangiung klangiungma mih uanh maten napiakta en kown.<verse eid="EZK 28:6-7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 28:8" />En kowh ransu-uüa dow nasaita en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:8">now sata dow en kowh tadupra nachowng kown.<verse eid="EZK 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 28:9" />Amatni sai en mih khin khe ang thurai pahai en nachang bawri kown tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:9">Nami khin khe en dow amatni tut-e lusa maru iawng krowngchow naphaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:9">thurai iawng naphaw kown nadowi.<verse eid="EZK 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 28:10" />Prenlang maru-uüa dow nasai en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:10">now en dow chupiia ang dowi mih maru-uüa iawng nakowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:10">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tura pren mang vüi kar diah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 28:11" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai iawk. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 28:12" />“Aw maru chapa, Tura pren mang lawnguan kowi maiawng kowtek kar meng diah: CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:12">“‘En dow achinawmma chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:12">now chanlaira atekma hai klangiungra atekma chowdiah.<verse eid="EZK 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 28:13" />En dow Thurai kowh Eden krum kowi uowi mih chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:13">en kowi dow asung khakma mih hua chap maten hown tawng en chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:13">En kowi dow Sardius hua, Topaz hua, Karbun hua, Emeral hua, Safir hua hai Daimawn hua ün dan pe mih tawnguat hown tawng en chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:13">now Agate hua, Amethis hua, Beril hua, Oniks hua hai kuh ün dan pe mih tawnguat hown tawng en chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:13">Naiawngün dow thawp en mih ni khe kamrüt en khai.<verse eid="EZK 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 28:14" />En kowi dow maru mingkhetah mih akürma mih Cherup iawng ang nümnap en chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:14">Ang kowh chimsaima mih hungh luk kowi ang pe uowi en chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:14">now maih iawng tawk pluplup mih hua luk kowi en dow mang reng chowdiah.<verse eid="EZK 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 28:15" />En kowi ang thawp en mih ni hownia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:15">en kowh chowm krang uowi krang dow achinawmma chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:15">Tawkche achur kowi dow en uown chang lup ngak khai.<verse eid="EZK 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 28:16" />En dow chang kun hu lai bowt rakowi akeng chenchapuüa kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:16">en krawi chang nowng hanow en chang ngak khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:16">Naiawng rakowi ang kowh chimsaima mih hungh hownia kür hown ang prüt en khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:16">Aw maru mingkhet mih Cherup rup, hua iawng maih hownia ang prütta en khai.<verse eid="EZK 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 28:17" />En klangiung lai rakowi en kowh saktuak kowi dow bawrira atekma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:17">en kowh kraingra kowi en sakrau rakowi en piakta chanlaira khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:17">Naiawng rakowi ang dow bawn kowi ang iu kuakta en khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:17">now akeng manguüa dow khi en hanow changla en rensi kau khai.<verse eid="EZK 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 28:18" />En dow kuan maru mih kun chang mih iawng chang ngak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:18">naiawngün angak hown en kowh chupiiara kim dow en sürlawkah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:18">Naiawng rakowi en kowh marow ang towkta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:18">nahanow nami marow dow asaima kam khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:18">Maru maten mü khe ang towk en khai.<verse eid="EZK 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 28:19" />Tuk mat en mih maru-uüa dow khi en hanow lainowmma awda khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:19">en dow kramra uowima hown ka ripra khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:19">En kowh kür dow nauowi kown nadowi bowt,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sidawn marow vüi CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 28:20" />Akung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 28:21" />“Aw maru chapa, Sidawn marow prakowi haidangah hanow aia lawnguan kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah: <verse eid="EZK 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 28:22" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:22">“‘Aw Sidawn marow, ang dow en kowh ransu chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:22">ang rip en mih hownia ang kowh kraingra mih ang natüngah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:22">now ang CHAKRAMANG pami maru maten natuk kown.<verse eid="EZK 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 28:23" />En luk kowi dow ang nauang chin en makowng hawi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:23">nami makowng hawi hown dow marow kowi kowh tiama kowi ransu-uüa hown</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:23">tasen khe kowh kowng mih iawng maru uak nataling plawt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:23">Ransu-uüa dow sen en kownkow nauang rumta en lut kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:23">nahanow en maru-uüa dow nakowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:23">Nakhowk khe dow en maru-uüa mih ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk bowt kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa vüi kowi kowh Thurai kowh prasira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 28:24" />CHAKRAMANG plan tek ang iawk mih, “Israel chenchapuüa riaret kowi kowh pe ngarau mih chuh singh hai achukma mih chuh iawng mih kingküa dawma mih kimping namkhetuüa dow nauowi kown nadowi bowt. Nakhowk khe chiang ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah kown.<verse eid="EZK 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 28:25" />“Akeng chenchap tut-e ang cham setta plawt mih Israeluüa kowi dow ang nakua nalawmah kown. Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi ang kowh kraingra ang natüngah kown, now chenchap maten nami dow nakhi kown. Now Israeluüa dow ang nar Jakawb kowi kowh ang peah mih amatni matia kowh pren kowi nauowi büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 28:26" />Nami pren kowi dow amatni mih nathawp kim üa hai nachang grep krum büah kown, now nakowi mih athaulangma nauowi büah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowi suiah mih kimping namkhetuüa kowi dow ang naripah kown. Nahanow Israeluüa dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai pami natuk büah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 28:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EZK 29" />
  <para style="s">Aigupta pren vüi kowi kowh satang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 29:1" />Babulawn pren kowi anging takhang mih hamüt ning kowi kowh lacher hamüt la khe kowh laipre ni khe CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 29:2" />“Aw maru chapa, Aigupta pren mang Faraw prakowi haidang hanow aia hai aia maru maten vüi kowi maiawng phuang diah: <verse eid="EZK 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 29:3" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:3">“‘Aw Aigupta pren mang Faraw, ang mih en kowh ransu chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:3">en dow en matia aw kowi kowh uowi mih aiukma mih rua mang chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:3">En tek mih, “Nail aw dow ang kowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:3">now nami aw dow ang vüi kowi kowh ang thawpah mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 29:4" />Tawkche en kowh awm kowi dow kuai hown ang nauowk en hanow dam iawng ang nadowk en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:4">nahanow aw hownia süng kowi ang nauang küngla en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:4">Nami khin khe asowmchow mih dam hawmh dow en kowh alip kowi nauang tawi tadan kown.<verse eid="EZK 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 29:5" />Ang dow en kowi mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi ang nakuakta en hüah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:5">now en kowh aw kowi kowh uowi mih dam hawmh kowi paw süngrüp süngkangma kowi ang nakuakta enni hüah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:5">Nahanow en dow dowm kowi natakuak hüah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:5">en kowi dow amiapaw nadup en kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:5">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowi dow ang nachangla en chakkham kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:5">en kowi dow krawng kowi kowh kaurawng uaramchak hawmh hai kuang kowi kowh uakling uaber hawmh chakkham ang nachangla en kown.<verse eid="EZK 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 29:6" />“‘Nahanow Aigupta pren kowi uowi miuüa dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah bowt kown. Israeluüa dow naka khowng kownkow Aiguptauüa luk kowi cham owmsak khai. Tawkche Aigupta dow uaklung kawng iawng kür uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 29:7" />Amatni rut hown dowk en mih khin khe en dow taphuk khai, now amatni kowh pangkawt dow ka ngarau khai. En luk kowi amatni tane mih khin khe en taphuk khai, now amatni kowh kumlawng dow en merta pe khai. <verse eid="EZK 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 29:8" />Naiawng rakowi ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk: Ang nasen en kownkow en kowh ransu-uüa kowi ang nauang chin en kown, now en kowh maru-uüa hai tawncher kowi mih ang nakowngta en kown. <verse eid="EZK 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 29:9" />Aigupta pren dow apiaknama panow akhaw aklaima naphaw kown. Nami khin khe Aigupta prenchakuüa dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah bowt kown. En dow chang bawri se tek mih, “Nail aw dow ang kowh chekhai. Nami aw dow ang vüi kowi kowh ang thawpah mih chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="EZK 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 29:10" />Naiawng rakowi ang dow en hai en kowh aw kowh ransu chekhai. Ang dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh tawngphak prakowi kowh Migdawl marow hownia mrawkphak prakowi Sene marow mowr apiaknama panow akhaw aklaima ang nachangah kown. Sene marow dow Ethiawpiauüa kowh sünghi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 29:11" />Aigupta pren iawng dow 40 ning mowr mih maru hai asadua namang kown nadowi, now nakowi dow amiapaw nauowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="EZK 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 29:12" />Aigupta pren dow piak mih pren pungmadawng kowi kowh lang piak mih pren ang nachangah kown. Amatni kowh marow dow apiaknama nauowi kown, now 40 ning mowr akhaw aklaima nauowi kown. Aigupta prenchakuüa kowi dow akeng pren kowi ang nacham setta plawt kown.<verse eid="EZK 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 29:13" />“‘Nachenganchepaw ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk. 40 ning kung kowi dow akeng pren kowi ang cham setta plawt mih Aiguptauüa kowi ang nakua nalawmah kown. <verse eid="EZK 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 29:14" />Amatni kowi dow alai khe kowh iawng ang naiungah iawk kown, now Aigupta pren mrawkphak pra kowh amatni pipu-uüa kowh pren kowi ang napawla kown. Tawkche amatni kowh pren dow nakowi nakür kown nadowi. <verse eid="EZK 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 29:15" />Amatni dow chenchap maten lak-e kowh kür lang khaw mih chenchap nachowng kown, now akeng chenchapuüa luk kowi katpaw naia chang alow kown nadowi bowt. Now nami pren kowi dow akeng chenchap luk kowi katpaw ia kruitown dowi bowt mih iawng auaklakma ang nachangah kown. <verse eid="EZK 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 29:16" />Nahanow Israeluüa dow Aigupta prenchakuüa luk kowi katpaw naowmsak kown nadowi bowt. Aigupta pren prakowi tang mü hanow Aigupta pren luk kowi amatni owmsak mih dow angak pami naka tuak büah kown. Nakhowk khe amatni dow Ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah bowt kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 29:17" />Babulawn pren kowi anging cham takhang mih 27 ning kowi kowh lacher pani mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 29:18" />“Aw maru chapa, Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar dow Tura marow mih kowsen khai. Nakhowk khe aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi dow adikma mih uanh pe kurla khai. Naiawng rakowi aia siphaiuüa kowh sam dow tachawi khai, now pangkawt paw tanir khai. Tawkche aia hai aia kowh siphaiuüa kowsenah mih Tura marow dow kownowng powng büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 29:19" />Naiawng rakowi Aigupta pren mih Babulawn pren mang kowi ang napeah kown. Now Aigupta pren kowi kowh asung khakma mih uanh dow aia napawta hanow aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi mih sukkri kha iawng Nebuknezar napeah kown. <verse eid="EZK 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 29:20" />Nebuknezar kowi dow aia kowh kawm sung iawng Aigupta pren ang peah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia hai aia kowh siphai hawmh dow ang kowh lup chang mih chekhai. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="EZK 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 29:21" />“Aigupta pren kowi Nebuknezar nowngta mih kung kowi dow Israel chenchap kowi mih akürma ang nachangah kown, now Ezekiel, en kowh laiklow kowi mih Israeluüa naringkaw bowt kown. Nakhowk khe amatni dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 29:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EZK 30" />
  <para style="s">Aigupta pren vüi kar meng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 30:1" />CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang plan ting khai iawk. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 30:2" />“Aw maru chapa, Aigupta prenchakuüa kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah: CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:2">“‘Nami kramra uowima mih ni vüi kowi taprüa tanguk büa diah.<verse eid="EZK 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 30:3" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow kramra uowima mih ni dow uang tawn khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:3">CHAKRAMANG kowh ni dow uang tawn khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:3">Nami ni dow uangnim kangowh naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:3">Nami dow chenchapuüa piakra ni naown kown.<verse eid="EZK 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 30:4" />Ransu siphaiuüa dow uang sen Aigupta prenchakuüa kownkow saidawng dowkma nauang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:4">now Ethiawpia chenchapuüa luk kowi dow kawm kratra nauang ting kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:4">Nakhowk khe Aigupta prenchakuüa dow tasenra kowi nakowng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:4">nahanow amatni kowh dawngthawnguan maten dow ransu-uüa napawla pe bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:4">now nakowi kowh arah maten dow napiak bowk kown.<verse eid="EZK 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 30:5" />“‘Nami tasenra kowi dow Ethiawpia, Lidia, Libia, Put, Arab chenchap maten hai aia kowh auiua hawmh maten mih amatni hown natawi kowng kown.<verse eid="EZK 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 30:6" />“‘Aiguptauüa kowi tawi khowngah miuüa dow napiak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:6">now Aiguptauüa changla bawri mih kür paw nakhowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:6">Tawngphak prakowi kowh Midawl marow hownia Sene marow mowr kowi kowh uowi miuüa dow nakowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:6">naiawngün maru kawmuüa dow ransu-uüa kowh saidawng kowi nakowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:6">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="EZK 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 30:7" />Aigupta pren dow piak mih pren pungmadawng kowi kowh lang piak mih pren naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:7">now amatni kowh marow dow akeng mih piak mih marow pungmadawng kowi natawi uowi kown.<verse eid="EZK 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 30:8" />Aigupta pren dow maih hown ang natowkta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:8">now aia kowi uang tawi khowngah miuüa kowi paw ang napiakah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:8">Nakhowk khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah bowt kown.<verse eid="EZK 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 30:9" />“‘Nami khin khe Ethiawpia chenchapuüa kowi natüng pe kram kownkow ang kowh satang phowng miuüa dow chawnlawng hown nakowtarü kown. Ethiawpiauüa dow amatni thaulangma pahai naka tuak büah kown. Tawkche Aiguptauüa kowi ang ripah mih khin khe dow amatni mih nakram kown. Sünta nami dow nauang ting ngengche kown.<verse eid="EZK 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 30:10" />“‘Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:10">Aigupta pren kowi kowh dawngthawnguan dow Nebuknezar kowi ang nape pawah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:10">now nami pren mih aia kowi ang nape piakah kown.<verse eid="EZK 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 30:11" />Nebuknezar hai sanara lang uowi dowi nowm nowm mih siphai hawmh dow uang piak Aigupta pren kownkow nauang kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:11">amatni dow Aigupta pren kowi uang senah hanow pren kowi maru uak hown atekma nachangah kown.<verse eid="EZK 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 30:12" />Nail aw tui dow ang nakangta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:12">now maru ngakuüa rut kowi nami pren mih ang nasumta pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:12">Aigupta pren hai nakowi kowh uowi mih kowi dow prenlang maru-uüa kowi ang nape piakah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:12">ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="EZK 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 30:13" />“‘Aigupta pren kowi kowh arup aren dow ang napiakta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:13">now Memfis marow kowi kowh arup paw ang napiakta kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:13">Nakowi dow kruitown mih nata lat kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:13">now paprenma kowi kowh uowi miuüa tut-e kramra kangowh ang nachang pe kown.<verse eid="EZK 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 30:14" />Aigupta pren mrawkphak pra kowh süng dow apiaknama mih krawng iawng ang natowta hüah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:14">Aigupta pren tawngphak pra kowh Zoan marow kowi dow ang natowkah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:14">now Aigupta pren tawngphak pra kowh Tebes marow kri kowi dow ang napiakah kown.<verse eid="EZK 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 30:15" />Aigupta pren kowi kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim uowi mih Pelusium marow dow akhawtma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:15">nami marow luk kowi dow ang kowh kunmaraura mih ang nauang iu khük pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:15">now Tebes marow kowi kowh asung khakma mih uanh maten dow ang napiakta pe kown.<verse eid="EZK 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 30:16" />Aigupta pren kowi dow ang natowkah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:16">now Pelusium marowchakuüa dow nakawm nakrat kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:16">Tebes marow luk kowi dow phih nauang ting kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:16">now Memfis marow dow takrow takrai hown atungma nauowi kown.<verse eid="EZK 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 30:17" />Heliawpawlis marow hai Bebastis marow kowi kowh klanguüa hawmh dow tasenra kowi nakowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:17">now akeng mih maru-uüa dow Babulawn kowi nacham takhang kown.<verse eid="EZK 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 30:18" />Aiguptauüa changla bawri mih kürra ang napiakta pe kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:18">nami khin khe Tapanhes marow vüi dow aiiuma mih ni naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:18">Nami aiiu dow Tapanhes marow kowi nauang takhu kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:18">now aia maru-uüa dow Babulawn pren kowi nacham takhang kown.<verse eid="EZK 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 30:19" />Naiawng hai Aigupta pren kowi dow ang naripah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:19">now amatni dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah bowt kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aigupta pren mang kowh kür iaw mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 30:20" />Anging cham takhang mih lailowk ning kowi kowh lacher ranit ni khe CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 30:21" />“Aw maru chapa, Aigupta pren mang Faraw kowh rut dow ang klowkta pe khowk. Aia kowh rut dow naiung kownkow amiapaw bawm pe uan dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow nadowkla saidawng kown mih kür ka dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 30:22" />Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk. Ang dow Aigupta pren mang Faraw kowh ransu chekhai. Aia kowh aklowkma mih bawng hai aiungma mih bawng dow pre buk trui ang naklowkta pe kown. Aia kowh rut hownia dow saidawng mih ang nakuakta pe kown. <verse eid="EZK 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 30:23" />Aiguptauüa kowi dow akeng chenchap hai prenchakuüa pungmadawng kowi ang nasetta plawt kown. <verse eid="EZK 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 30:24" />Babulawn pren mang kowh bawng mih akürma ang nachang pe kown, now aia rut kowi dow ang naap pe saidawng kown. Tawkche Faraw kowh rut dow ang naklowkta pe kown. Nahanow Babulawn pren mang pur kowi Faraw dow natasai katlat hanow nakowng kown. <verse eid="EZK 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 30:25" />Babulawn pren mang rut kowi dow ang napeah kür kown. Tawkche Faraw kowh rut dow kür akhawma ang nachang pe kown. Babulawn pren mang kowi dow ang kowh saidawng ang napeah kown. Nami saidawng dow Aiguptauüa kowi nakingküala kown mih vüi aia natawngah kown. Nakhowk khe lusa maru kawmuüa dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 30:26" />Aiguptauüa kowi dow akeng chenchapuüa hai prenchakuüa pungmadawng kowi ang nacham setta plawt kown. Nakhowk khe amatni dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 30:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EZK 31" />
  <para style="s">Asuria hown Aigupta kowi tuah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 31:1" />Anging cham takhang mih lailowk ning kowi kowh sum la khe kowh pani khe CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 31:2" />“Aw maru chapa, Aigupta pren mang hai aia kowh maru maten kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZK 31:2" />
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:2">“‘En iawng kri kraingma hai akürma mih amia chow uowi?<verse eid="EZK 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 31:3" />Asuria pren lawnguan kowi tuakah madiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:3">aia dow Lebanawn hungh kowi kowh sidar singh iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:3">Aia kowh klangiungma mih singh mia dow kaurawng kowi aklim takuak reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:3">aia dow alowngma rakowi aia kowh achem mih kuang kowi tawk ngialia towbowt.<verse eid="EZK 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 31:4" />Aia kowi dow tui sikah kleplep reng rakowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:4">aia awr kro ngamlam khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:4">Awchawng tui dow aia riaret iawng uang hawr reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:4">now aia kowh singh prün hown dow kaurawng kowi kowh singh maten tawi ka tui reng chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 31:5" />Naiawng hai aia dow kaurawng kowi kowh singh maten lak-e lang lowng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:5">aia kowh amia dow aiuk aiukma hai aklangma phaw khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:5">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow ka tui reng chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 31:6" />Mukuang kowi kowh uakling hawmh dow aia singh mia kowi chang bai reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:6">now kaurawng kowi kowh asadua hawmh paw aia singh mia dak kowi pen chah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:6">Nami klen kowi aia singh klim kowi dow aiuk aiukma mih chenchap uowi chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 31:7" />Aia dow akhawtma hai klangiungma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:7">aia kowh mia prek dow aklangma krawi tarawk khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:7">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowh aprün dow krawng dawng tui ka reng chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 31:8" />Thurai krum kowi kowh tawng mih sidar singh paw Lebanawn kowi kowh sidar hown tatuah kown mih uowi dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:8">tawng mih karpowng singh paw aia hown tatu dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:8">now tawng mih sidar singh paw aia hown tatu dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">Thurai kowh krum kowi dow naiawng klangiungma mih singh uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 31:9" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowi dow singh mia hown klangiungma ang tawngah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:9">aia dow Thurai kowh Eden krum kowi kowh singh maten irah mih singh chekhai,’ pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 31:10" />“Kawmat ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk: Aigupta dow lowng lai bowt kowh achem mih kuang kowi tawk ngialia towbowt, now aia lowng lai rakowi aia dow chang bawri khai. <verse eid="EZK 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 31:11" />Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow ang nuata hanow akürma mih chenchap rut kowi ang naap-ah kown, nahanow nami chenchap dow amatni kowh angak iawng hai napiakah kown. <verse eid="EZK 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 31:12" />Prenlang maru-uüa pungmadawng kowi kowh kramra lang uowi miuüa dow aia kowi dungah hanow kuakta hüah khai. Amatni dow aia kowh singh mia maten mih klowkta hanow hungh towng hai lawngrawi towng kowi krawi kuakah khai. Pren kowi kowh chenchapuüa dow aia kowh aklim uowi dowi bowt rakowi aia kowi powtta pe bowk khai. <verse eid="EZK 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 31:13" />Mukuang kowi kowh uakling hawmh dow nami singh takuak hüah mih luk kowi uang chawp khai, now nami singh mia luk kowi kaurawng uaramchak hawmh dow mangah chawplawp khai. <verse eid="EZK 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 31:14" />Naiawng rakowi kawmat hownia dow aw pang kowi kowh akeng singh mih nachang bawri kown nadowi bowt. Amatni kowh achem dow kuang kowi natatawk kown nadowi bowt, now amatni ka tui reng rakowi akeng mih singh lak-e lang lowng pahai nachang bawri kown nadowi bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow maru iawng nakowng kown, now ang khowm bowkta mih krawng dawng abüpma mih kowngra prakowi namang kown.<verse eid="EZK 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 31:15" />“Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk: Makownguüa uowi rah prakowi Asuria mang mih khin khe dow tuikuam hai awchawng kowi mih ang nape uowiah uowila uiting uangtak kown. Tuikuam kowi kowh tui hai awchawng kowi kowh hawr klunglung mih tui dow ang nakangta pe kown. Lebanawn hungh dow aiiuma ang nachangah kown, now nakowi kowh singh kau maten dow akang khawngma naphaw kown. <verse eid="EZK 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 31:16" />Nami singh kowi mih makownguüa uowi rah kowi ang cham chinah khai. Nami khin khe nami singh tim tün tata hanow akeng chenchapuüa mih kram kowh chür khai. Nakhowk khe Eden krum kowi kowh singh maten, Lebanawn hungh kowi kowh lang kloah mih singh hai ka tui reng mih singh maten dow ka sakklamra khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni hown Asuria paw makownguüa uowi rah kowi tawi uowi khai bowt. <verse eid="EZK 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 31:17" />Amatni dow aia nimkrüa kowi chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi tawi uowi chowdiah. Tawkche aia hown amatni paw saidawng hown kowh kowng miuüa uowi rah kowi natawi uowi kown.<verse eid="EZK 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 31:18" />“Aw Faraw, kri kraingra hai klangiungra prakowi Eden krum kowi kowh singh kau en hown taprem mih tawng mih chow uowi? Nachenganchepaw en kowi mih Eden krum kowi kowh singh kau hown krawng dawng abüpma kowi ang nachin en kown. Tasenra kowi kowh kowng mih hiah khampha uanpik dowi mih maru-uüa hown en nataiua uowi kown.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 31:18">“Faraw hai aia maru-uüa luk mih naiawng nauang phaw kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 31:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EZK 32" />
  <para style="s">Mang Faraw vüi kowi kar mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 32:1" />Babulawn pren kowi anging cham uowi nar mih laipre ning nga laipre la khe kowh pani khe CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 32:2" />“Aw maru chapa, Aigupta pren mang Faraw vüi kowi kar diah, now kar se aia kowi maiawng tek pe diah,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZK 32:2" />
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:2">“‘En dow chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi krangsila iawng en tatuak khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:2">Nachenganchepaw en dow aw kowi kowh tam iawng asung uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:2">En dow en matia pren kowi aw kowi kowh tam iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:2">lek mai katlat se khawk hown tui pua chowtaih en uang.<verse eid="EZK 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 32:3" />Ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:3">ang kowh lawk hown napat en kownkow maru akawmma ang nauang chin en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:3">now naiawngün maru-uüa mih tui hownia lawk küng iawng naküng en kown.<verse eid="EZK 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 32:4" />Nami kung kowi dow dowm kowi ang nakuakta en hüah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:4">en kowh uak dow kuang kowi kowh uakling maten hai lusa kowi kowh tawncher maten kowi du pat ang nape chaah kown.<verse eid="EZK 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 32:5" />En kowh uak dow ang nadungta naknak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:5">now hungh hai lawngrawi towng kowi ang nakrawi uetah kown.<verse eid="EZK 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 32:6" />En kowh vi hown pren mih hungma mawngma mowr ang nasikah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:6">nahanow en vi hown dow aw tui mih aringma naphaw kown.<verse eid="EZK 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 32:7" />Ang napiak en kown mih khin khe ang natungta en mukuang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:7">now krek kowi ün ang nape nowiah kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:7">Sat kowi dow uangnim hown ang natungta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:7">now lama kowi paw ang nape nowiah kown nadowi.<verse eid="EZK 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 32:8" />Naiawng hai mukuang kowi kowh anowi maten aiiuma ang nachangta en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:8">en pren luk kowi dow aiiu ang nauang pawla en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:8">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="EZK 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 32:9" />“‘En napiak kown mih satang dow akeng prenchakuüa pungmadawng kowi ang nakrawi phowngah kown. Nakhowk khe amatni kowh dow saktuak mih napusa kown. <verse eid="EZK 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 32:10" />Ang napiak en kown mih khi hanow akeng chenchapuüa dow kram hown pikchu narü kown. Amatni pur kowi ang par pe saidawng mih khin khe amatni kowh manguüa dow kram hown nachür kown. En piak mih ni khe amatni kowh sak dow kram hown nachür kown.<verse eid="EZK 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 32:11" />“‘Ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk, Babulawn pren mang kowh saidawng dow en luk kowi ang nauang pe kla kown. <verse eid="EZK 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 32:12" />En maru-uüa kowi dow chenchap maten pungmadawng kowi kowh kramra lang uowi mih maru-uüa kowh saidawng hown ang nasaiah kown.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZK 32:12" />
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:12">“‘Naiawngün maru-uüa dow Aigupta pren mang kowh bawrira napiakta pe nak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:12">now aia kowh maru-uüa kowi paw nasaita pe bowk kown.<verse eid="EZK 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 32:13" />Aw pang kowi kowh uowi mih amatni kowh tawncher ün ang napiakta pe bowk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:13">nahanow nami aw tui dow maru kowh khawk hown napua kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:13">now tawncher khawk hown paw napua kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="EZK 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 32:14" />Nami kung kowi dow aia kowh aw tui mih achimma ang nachangah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:14">now aia kowh aw tui mih sau hawr iawng naurachow chi ang nape hawrah kown.<verse eid="EZK 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 32:15" />Aigupta pren kowi ang piakah mih khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:15">nakowi kowh uowi mih maten kowi ang piakah mih khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah kown.<verse eid="EZK 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 32:16" />“‘Mami kar meng dow Aigupta vüi amatni natekah kown, now akeng chenchap masiuüa hawmh paw nami meng natek kown. Naiawng hai amatni dow Aigupta pren mang hai aia maru-uüa vüi kowi nami meng natek büah kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="EZK 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makownguüa uowi rah kowi Aigupta dowh mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 32:17" />Babulawn pren kowi anging cham uowi nar mih laipre ning nga lacher laitanga ni khe CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 32:18" />“Aw maru chapa, Aigupta maru-uüa vüi kowi kar büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Aiguptauüa hai akürma mih akeng chenchapuüa kowi dow lusa maru kowngra kowi ang nasata bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 32:19" />Aiguptauüa kowi tek pe kown mih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:19">“‘Akeng chenchapuüa lak-e enni lang klangiung khai bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:19">Makownguüa uowi rah kowi enni paw kowtawi uowi diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:19">nakowi hiah khampha uanpik dowi miuüa pungmadawng kowi kowtawi mawk büa diah,’ napape kown.<verse eid="EZK 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 32:20" />“Tasenra kowi kowh kowng miuüa pungmadawng kowi Aiguptauüa dow natawi uowi kown. Amatni kowi dow saidawng hown nasaiah kown. Amatni kowi dow nacham küngla hanow nasaiah kown. <verse eid="EZK 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 32:21" />Makownguüa uowi rah kowi tasen kürma miuüa dow Aigupta mang kowi hai aia auiuauüa lawnguan kowi natek kown mih, ‘Hiala khampha uanpik dowi kowh tasenra kowi kowng miuüa dow makownguüa uowi rah kowi mawk khai bowt,’ napa kown.<verse eid="EZK 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 32:22" />“Nami kowngra kowi dow Asuria mih aia kowh siphaiuüa hown tawi uowi khai bowt. Aia riaret kowi dow aia kowh siphaiuüa kowh tadupra kangowh towbowt. Naiawngün maru-uüa dow tasenra kowi kowh kowng miuüa chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 32:23" />Amatni kowh tadupra dow abüpma mih kuam lak kowi chekhai, now aia kowh tadupra riaret kowi dow aia kowh siphaiuüa kowh tadupra kangowh chekhai. Amatni dow lowra kowi kawi krawk maru reng mih chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow saidawng hown kowng bowk khowk chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 32:24" />“Nami kowngra kowi dow Elam pren hai aia maru-uüa paw tawi uowi khai bowt. Aia tadupra riaret kowi dow aia siphaiuüa kowh tadupra kangowh towbowt. Amatni bowkbowk dow tasenra kowi kowh kowng mih chekhai. Amatni dow sing uowi miuüa pren kowi kawi krawk maru reng chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow amatni mih hiala khampha uanpik dowi kowi krawng dak kowi mang khai bowt. Makownguüa uowi rah kowi kowh mang miuüa hown amatni dow tawi ka rukrai khai bowt. <verse eid="EZK 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 32:25" />Elam dow tasenra kowi kowh kowng miuüa hown tawi be phang khai bowt. Aia kowh tadupra riaret kowi dow aia maru-uüa kowh tadupra kangowh towbowt. Naiawngün hiala khampha uanpik dowi miuüa dow tasenra kowi kowh kowng mih chekhai. Amatni sing uowi miuüa pren kowi kawi krawk maru mih chowdiah. Tawkche amatni dow makownguüa uowi rah kowi mang miuüa hown tawi ka rukrai khai bowt. Kowng miuüa pungmadawng kowi amatni kowi paw iüah khai bowt.<verse eid="EZK 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 32:26" />“Nakowi dow Mesek hai Tubal prenchakuüa tawi uowi khai bowt. Amatchi riaret kowi dow amatchi siphaiuüa kowh tadupra kangowh towbowt. Amatni dow sing uowi miuüa pren kowi kawi krawk maru reng chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow naiawngün hiah khampha uanpik mih maru-uüa mih tasenra kowi kowng khai bowt. <verse eid="EZK 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 32:27" />Amatni dow alai kowh tasen kiakma miuüa iawng ringkawra uowima hown naka tadup kown nadowi. Tasen kiakma miuüa dow amatni kowh saidawng amatni kowh iüaluk kowi chekhai. Amatni kowh aprek dow amatni hut luk kowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni paw sing uowi miuüa pren kowi kawi krawk maru reng chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 32:28" />“Aw Aigupta, en kowi paw ang napiakta en kown. Nahanow hiala khampha uanpik dowi kowh kowng miuüa pungmadawng kowi en natawi mawk kown. Naiawngün maru-uüa kowi dow tasenra kowi kowh kowngta miuüa chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 32:29" />“Nami kowngra kowi dow Edum pren paw aia kowh manguüa hai aia kowh kruitown miuüa hown tawi uowi khai bowt. Amatni dow kürma chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi dow tasenra kowi kowh kowng miuüa hown mawkah khai bowt. Nahanow amatni dow hiala khampha uanpik dowi kowh kowng miuüa hown tawi mawk khai bowt. <verse eid="EZK 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 32:30" />Nami kowngra kowi dow Tawngphak pra kowh pren kowi kowh kruitown miuüa hai Sidawnuüa mih tawi uowi khai bowt. Amatni dow amatni kowh kür hown maru kowi krawi tüng kram reng chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw amatni dow tawmpa rukrai tasenra kowi kowh kowng miuüa hown makownguüa uowi rah kowi tawi mang khai. Amatni dow makownguüa uowi rah kowi kowh mang miuüa hown tawi ka rukrai khai.<verse eid="EZK 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 32:31" />“Aigupta pren mang Faraw hai aia kowh siphaiuüa maten mih amatni kowi nakhi kown, now ransu-uüa kowh saidawng hown kowng mih thumchak nakowi uowi ahuma mih tuk hanow naka sakklamra büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 32:32" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow sing uowi miuüa pren kowi dow Faraw hown ang krawi krawkah reng chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw aia hai aia kowh maru-uüa kowi dow hiala khampha uanpik dowi kowh tasenra kowi kowng miuüa hown ang nape mawkah kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EZK 33" />
  <para style="s">Phih lawnguan kowi nakrawi phowng kown mih maru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 33:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 33:2" />“Aw maru chapa, en chenchapuüa kowi tek pe diah. CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Lowra pren kowi nauang sen kownkow ransu siphaiuüa kowi ang uang pawla chepaw naia kown. Nakhowk khe prenchakuüa mih amatni pungmadawng hownia klo maru lowk ia hanow phih lawnguan kowi nakrawi phowng kown mih maru towah khai. <verse eid="EZK 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 33:3" />Now nami maru che pren kowi siphaiuüa uang sen kownkow uang tarü mih khi hanow prenchakuüa nauowi kaneu kownkow tum baw khai. <verse eid="EZK 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 33:4" />Now nami baw tün ta khowk chepaw amia iawng mih chow uowi kaneu dowi kowh ransu siphaiuüa rut kowi kowng khai hanow aia kowng mih aprek dow aia matia luk kowi nauowi kown. <verse eid="EZK 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 33:5" />Naiawng aia kowng mih aprek aia ka mih dow tum baw mih klow ta khowk chepaw kaneuma aia uowi dowi rakowi chekhai. Aia che uowi kaneu e dow aia kowh sak naia plai kown chowdiah. <verse eid="EZK 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 33:6" />Tawkche nami kangchawng mih maru mih ransu siphaiuüa uang sen mih khi khowk chepaw tum baw dowi. Naiawng rakowi ransu siphaiuüa mih maru lowk ia kowi uang saita khai. Naiawng che phaw khai hanow nami maru dow aia kowh ngak rakowi kowng mih chekhai pami tuakah diah. Tawkche nami maru kowng mih lu klai dow nami kangchawng mih maru hownia ang napawah kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 33:7" />“Aw maru chapa, en kowi dow Israel chenchap vüi kowi kowh kangchawng mih maru ang tow en mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ang natek en kown mih dow kaneuma sünta diah, now amatni kowi dow nauowi kaneuma kown mih tek pe diah. <verse eid="EZK 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 33:8" />‘Aw maru ngak, en nakowng ngengche kown,’ pahai maru ngak kowi ang tek pe mih khin nauowi kown. Nakhowk khe che nami maru ngak kowi lup ngak chang en hangah dowi hanow aia dow aia kowh ngak rakowi nakowng kown. Tawkche nami maru kowng mih lu klai dow en luk kowi ang napaw en kown. <verse eid="EZK 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 33:9" />En che nami maru ngak kowi aia kowh lup ngak chang natowta kown mih tek pe khai, now aia che nami lup ngak hownia uang plan dowi hanow aia dow aia kowh angak rakowi nakowng kown. Tawkche en kowh sak dow naplai kown.<verse eid="EZK 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kangchawng mih maru kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 33:10" />“Aw maru chapa, Israel chenchap tut-e ang laiklow kowtek pe diah. Nakhowk khe amatni dow maiawng natek chepaw naia kown, ‘Anging chang ngak khai, now rirow ün anging chün dowi chekhai. Anging kowh angak anging vüi di mih nowm khowk. Naiawng rakowi anging dow tui khai bowt. Tawng iawng chow anging nasing kown?’ napa kown. <verse eid="EZK 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 33:11" />Amatni kowi en tek pe diah. Ang CHAKRAMANG ang ming lüklau se ang tek khowk, maru ngakuüa kowng mih kowi ang awmrawm dowi chekhai. Ang nau mih dow angak hownia uang plan now ia sing mih chowtaih. Aw Israel chenchapuüa, ang tut-e uang plan büa diah, enni kowh angak tiama hownia uang plan büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow enni nakowng kown?<verse eid="EZK 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 33:12" />“Naiawng rakowi aw maru chapa, en chenchapuüa kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah, ‘Aiungma mih maru che CHAKRAMANG laiklow chün dowi hanow aia changah mih lup iung aia kowi nowngia takhula kown nadowi, now maru ngak mih aia kowh angak hownia uang plan hanow aia changah mih lup ngak rakowi naka ripra kown nadowi,’ pape diah. <verse eid="EZK 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 33:13" />Chang lup iung mih maru kowi, ‘En nasing ngengche kown,’ pahai ang tek pe chepaw naia kown. Tawkche aia che aia kowh lup iung chang kowi neplawng nesak kowh chang angak khai hanow nami maru kowi dow auown khe kowh aia changah mih lup iung ang natuak pe kown nadowi. Aia kowh angak rakowi aia dow nakowng kown. <verse eid="EZK 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 33:14" />Angak mih maru kowi che, ‘En nakowng ngengche kown,’ pahai ang tek pe chepaw naia kown. Tawkchedow nami maru che angak hownia uang plan khai, now anowmma mih hai anama mih lup chang khai. <verse eid="EZK 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 33:15" />Aia tut-e kowh maru uang pawngah mih uanh hai cham kuah mih uanh ün maru kowi planta pe khai, masing rirow chün khai, now lup ngak ün chang dowi bowt hanow aia dow nakowng kown nadowi. Aia dow nasing ngengche kown. <verse eid="EZK 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 33:16" />Aia rik changah mih angak maten dow sak kowi ang natow pe kown nadowi. Anowm mih lup hai ana mih lup aia chang khai rakowi aia dow nasing ngengche kown.<verse eid="EZK 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 33:17" />“Nachenganchepaw en maru-uüa dow, ‘CHAKRAMANG kowh tiama thik dowi,’ pahai tek reng tak chekhai. Tawkche tiama thik dowi mih dow amatni kowh chowbowt. <verse eid="EZK 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 33:18" />Achinawmma mih maru che aia kowh tachi tanawmra hownia plan kowh chang lup ngak khai hanow aia dow nakowng kown. <verse eid="EZK 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 33:19" />Angak mih maru che aia kowh angak hownia uang plan kowh anowmma mih lup hai anama mih lup chang khai hanow aia dow nasing kown. <verse eid="EZK 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 33:20" />Nachenganchepaw aw Israeluüa, enni tek mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG kowh tiama thik dowi,’ pakhai. Tawkche enni kowi mih enni kowh chowm krang uowi krang iawng ang nachet enni tara kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="EZK 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow piak mih satang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 33:21" />Anging cham uowi nar mih laipre ning nga hamüt la tanga ni khe maru lowk ia dow Jerusalem marow hownia ang tut-e uang powt khai. Now tek ang mih, “Ransu-uüa dow Jerusalem marow uang powngta khai bowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="EZK 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 33:22" />Nami maru uang ting dowi rawn iak prakowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kür dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Nami maru ang tut-e uang ting khe dow CHAKRAMANG mih hota ang nawr khai bowt. Nahanow ang dow nowngia lai khai bowt.<verse eid="EZK 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 33:23" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 33:24" />“Aw maru chapa, Israel pren kowi kowh apiaknama mih marow kowi uowi miuüa tek mih, ‘Abraham lowk iachow taih chepaw Thurai dow aia kowi pe powngah pren khai. Tawkche a-i dow akawmma chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nami pren dow a-i napowng kownkow aia pe a-i ngengche mih chekhai,’ pakhai. <verse eid="EZK 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 33:25" />Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi kowtek pe diah, ang CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Enni dow avi hailawm cha chaknga khai, arup aren kowi ün enni chupiia khai, now enni sai maru khai. Naiawng enni chang chepaw enni naka powng pren kown bow? <verse eid="EZK 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 33:26" />Enni dow enni kowh saidawng luk kowi enni neplawng nesak khai, suiiai kaniaima mih lup ngak enni chang khai, now kimping namkhet masiuüa hown enni chang iang khai. Naiawng enni chang chepaw enni naka powng pren kown bow?’ pape diah.<verse eid="EZK 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 33:27" />“En mih amatni kowi tek pe diah. Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai ang ming lüklau se ang tek khowk, nami piakra marow kowi kowh uowi miuüa dow tasenra kowi nakowng kown. Dowm kowi kowh uowi miuüa kowi dow kaurawng uaramchak hawmh hown ang nasaiah kown, now akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim kowi hai puk kowi cham tapet miuüa kowi dow makowng hawi hown ang nape kowngah kown. <verse eid="EZK 33:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 33:28" />Israeluüa kowh pren dow ang napiakah hanow akhaw aklaima ang nachangah kown. Amatni changla bawri mih kür dow ang napiakta pe kown. Amatni kowh hungh kangowh mih süng dow akhaw aklaima naphaw kown, now nakowi dow amiapaw namang nakat kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 33:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 33:29" />Amatni kowh suiiai kaniaima mih lup ngak rakowi amatni kowh pren dow ang napiakta nak hanow piaknama ang natowta hüah kown. Nakhowk khe amatni dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah kown.<verse eid="EZK 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 33:30" />“Aw maru chapa, en maru-uüa dow tap ria kowi hai kimplawt kowi takua talawm hanow en lawnguan kowi talawp lawmlawm khai, now lowkkowlowk tatek büah mih, ‘Chu, CHAKRAMANG hownia kowh uang ting mih laiklow a-i kowsünta diah sik,’ pakhai. <verse eid="EZK 33:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 33:31" />Ang maru-uüa dow en tut-e uang reng, now en laiklow nasünta kownkow en pur kowi uang chowm büah reng chekhai. Tawkche amatni dow taah mih iawng chang dowi chekhai. Nawr hown dow sakraura laiklow tek büah reng chowdiah. Tawkche amatni kowh sak kowi dow lawphara kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 33:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 33:32" />En dow naiawngün maru-uüa tut-e tünteu hown kowh tek changlawng plawngnau meng mih maru krowngchow taih. Amatni dow en laiklow ta khowk chowdiah. Tawkche nami iawng chang büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 33:33" />“Amatni kowi kowh en tek pe mih iawng dow nauang phaw ngengche kown. Nakhowk khe amatni dow amatni pungmadawng kowi risi uowi lowk ia mih natuk büah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EZK 34" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh thing miuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 34:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 34:2" />“Aw maru chapa, Israeluüa kowh kruitown miuüa kowi risi iawng hai mami laiklow kowtek pe diah. CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, ‘Enni Israel kruitown miuüa — Israel kowh ruapur thing miuüa — dow enni matia mu chowtaih enni tathum. Ruapur iawng mih Israeluüa kowi enni peah chakkham dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi enni dow lainowmma nanga kown. <verse eid="EZK 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 34:3" />Enni dow ruapur iawn tui enni kham khai, apawi dow enni thawpla tawnguat hanow enni khupah khai, now lang iung mih ruapur kowi dow enni ngenah hanow enni chaah khai. Tawkche ruapur hawmh kowi dow enni khetah kaneu dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 34:4" />Kür uowi dowi mih ruapur kowi dow enni peah kür dowi, arau uowi mih ruapur kowi dow enni iungah dowi, now kakma mih ruapur kowi dow enni bawm pe ma dowi chekhai. Nami klen kowi cham kla phih mih ruapur kowi dow enni krawi klanah dowi, now tama mih ruapur kowi paw enni krawi chamah dowi chekhai. Naiawng enni krawi chang lak dow angak hown amatni kowi enni kruitownah khai. <verse eid="EZK 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 34:5" />Ruapur hawmh iawng mih Israeluüa dow ruapur thing mih uowi dowi rakowi cham taset plawt khai, now amatni dow kaurawng uaramchak hawmh kowh chakkham cham chowng khai bowt. <verse eid="EZK 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 34:6" />Ang kowh ruapur hawmh dow hungma mawngma süng kowi cham mangla pang khai. Amatni dow palusama kowi cham krawi tauet khai. Amatni kowi dow amiapaw krawi chamah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 34:7" />“‘Naiawng rakowi ruapur thing miuüa low, ang laiklow sünta büa diah. <verse eid="EZK 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 34:8" />Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai ang ming lüklau se ang tek khowk, ruapur thing miuüa dow ang kowh ruapur hawmh kowi nuata hüah khai. Naiawng rakowi ang kowh ruapur hawmh kowi kaurawng uaramchak hawmh uang makah khai. Ang kowh ruapur thing miuüa dow ruapur hawmh iawng mih ang kowh maru-uüa kowi krawi cham dowi chekhai. Amatni dow amatni matia vüi chowtaih tatuak khai. <verse eid="EZK 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 34:9" />Naiawng rakowi ruapur thing miuüa low, ang laiklow sünta büa diah. <verse eid="EZK 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 34:10" />Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek khowk, ruapur thing miuüa kowi ang nakingküaah kown, now ang kowh ruapur hawmh angakma uowi mih rakowi amatni kowi ang natang pe aprek kown. Amatni rut hownia ang kowh ruapur hawmh kowi ang nauang pawla kown. Ruapur thing miuüa hownia amatni kowi dow ang nalawngah kown. Nahanow ruapur thing miuüa dow amatni kowi naka chaah kown nadowi bowt, now amatni kowi dow ang nape chowngah ruapur thing mih kown nadowi bowt. Amatni kowh athing miuüa hownia amatni kowi dow ang natakhula kown; amatni kowi dow amatni kowh athing miuüa kowh chakkham ang nachangah kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="EZK 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aiungma mih ruapur thing mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 34:11" />“‘Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek khowk, ang kowh ruapur hawmh kowi dow ang nakrawi cham kown, now amatni kowi dow ang nakruitownah kown. <verse eid="EZK 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 34:12" />Ruapur thing miuüa dow cham krawi taset plawt mih ruapur hawmh kowi krawi chamah reng chekhai. Nami iawng ang paw ang kowh ruapur hawmh kowi ang nakrawi chamah kown. Aiiu iawng mih ngarera dawng kowi amatni cham uowi rah hownia amatni kowi ang nauang lawngla kown. <verse eid="EZK 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 34:13" />Amatni kowi dow akeng chenchap hai akeng pren hownia ang nauang pawla hanow amatni matia pren kowi ang nakua nalawmah kown. Now amatni kowi dow hungma mawngma kangowh mih süng luk kowi, tui uowi mih aw pang kowi hai paprenma kowi ang nathingah kown. <verse eid="EZK 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 34:14" />Amatni kowi dow thing rah iung mih kowi ang nathingah kown, now amatni kowh tawkra dow Israeluüa kowh alowngma mih hungh kowi naown kown. Aiungma mih thing rah kowi amatni dow nauowi kown, now amatni dow Israeluüa hungh luk kowi kowh tawkra iungma mih süng kowi nataw büa kown. <verse eid="EZK 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 34:15" />Ang kowh ruapur hawmh kowi dow ang matia nathingah kown, now tanaira kowi ang nauang pawla kown. <verse eid="EZK 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 34:16" />Tama miuüa kowi dow ang nakrawi chamah kown, now kla phih miuüa kowi paw ang nauang plan pawla iawk kown. Kakma miuüa kowi dow ang nabawm pe ma kown, now kür uowi dowi miuüa kowi paw ang napeah kür kown. Tawkche kow iungma hai akürma miuüa kowi dow ang napiakah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow anowmma mih tara hown ang kowh ruapur hawmh kowi ang naming nakhetah kown.<verse eid="EZK 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 34:17" />“‘Aw ang kowh ruapur hawmh, sünta büa diah. Aiungma mih hai angakma mih ruapur hawmh kowi ang nachet pe tara kown, now ruapur hawmh kowi dow rua hawmh hownia ang nalang kraah kown. <verse eid="EZK 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 34:18" />Aiungma mih thing rah kowi enni ka cha pram mih enni sak-ih dowi tak bow? Tawngplawng kowchow enni chala dowi mih pram ün khawk hown enni plan thuala khai? Achimma mih tui enni kham mih enni sak-ih dowi tak bow? Tawngplawng kowchow khawk hown enni thuaah now enni krawi puala tui nak khai? <verse eid="EZK 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 34:19" />Tawngplawng kowchow khawk hown enni thuaah mih pram hai tui ang kowh ruapur hawmh nacha nakham kown?<verse eid="EZK 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 34:20" />“‘Naiawng rakowi ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih akauma hai arawngchow mih ruapur pungmadawng kowi ang nachet tara kown. <verse eid="EZK 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 34:21" />Arawngchow mih ruapur hawmh kowi dow powt dowi mowr buk hai pangkawt hown enni akauma mih ruapur hawmh nawtah chowtlowt khai, now nang hown enni krawi tingah khai. <verse eid="EZK 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 34:22" />Naiawng rakowi ang kowh ruapur hawmh kowi dow ang nalawngah kown, now amatni dow nowng changra kowi nauowi kown nadowi bowt. Aiungma mih hai angakma mih ruapur pungmadawng kowi dow ang nachet tara kown. <verse eid="EZK 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 34:23" />Amatni luk kowi dow ang kowh nar David kowi athing mih ang natowah lowk ia kown. Aia dow amatni kowh athing mih nachowng kown, now aia dow amatni kowi nakruitownah kown. <verse eid="EZK 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 34:24" />Ang dow CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai nachowng kown, now ang kowh nar David dow amatni kowh aluchow nachowng kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="EZK 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh taking tasangra sangbowk laitawm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 34:25" />“‘Amatni hown dow ang natow taking tasangra sangbowk laitawm lowk kown. Pren hownia dow rang pranma mih tawncher iawng mih maru ngakuüa kowi ang naprütta pe kown. Nahanow amatni dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi thaulangma naia uowi büah kown, now kram dowi kowi kaurawng kowi naia müi büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 34:26" />Amatni kowi dow ang napeah prasi kown, now ang kowh hungh Jerusalem riaret kowi kowh amatni kowh kim ün kowi ang napeah prasi kown. Akhin khe ang nauang peah uang kown. Nami uang dow amatni luk kowi kowh ang kowh prasira naown kown. <verse eid="EZK 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 34:27" />Dowm kowi kowh sing dow nauih kown, now krawng paw nape luprak kown. Amatni dow amatni chowlowkkow krawng bawn kowi thaulangma nauowi kown. Amatni tut-e kowh laithawn tim iawng mih kratra dow ang napiakta pe kown, now amatni kowi kowh towah nar miuüa hownia dow amatni kowi ang nauang klanla kown. Naiawng amatni kowi ang changah mih khin khe amatni dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 34:28" />Amatni kowi dow akeng chenchapuüa nanowngah kown nadowi bowt, now kaurawng uaramchak hawmh paw amatni kowi nachaah kown nadowi bowt. Amatni dow thaulangma nauowi bowt kown, now amatni kowi dow amiapaw nakrawkah kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 34:29" />Amatni kowi dow asi uowima mih krawng ang napeah kown. Nahanow pren kowi dow amatni mih akhawr hown nakawm kown nadowi bowt, now akeng chenchapuüa tut-e rukrai paw naka kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 34:30" />Amatni dow ang CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai amatni hown tawi uowi reng mih natuk kown, now amatni mih ang kowh maru pami natuk büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 34:31" />Aw ang kowh ruapur hawmh, enni dow ang thingah mih ruapur hawmh chekhai. Enni dow ang kowh maru chekhai, now ang dow enni kowh Thurai chekhai. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EZK 35" />
  <para style="s">Edawmuüa kowi nakingküaah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 35:1" />Akung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 35:2" />“Aw maru chapa, Edawm pren kowi kowh Seir hungh prakowi dangah hanow aia kowi ang kingküaah mih laiklow maiawng tek pe diah: <verse eid="EZK 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 35:3" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, ‘Aw Seir hungh, ang nakingküa en kown; ang kowh rut ang naparah hanow akhaw aklaima ang natow en kown. <verse eid="EZK 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 35:4" />En kowh marow ün dow ang napiakta en kown. Nahanow en mih akhaw aklaima naphaw kown. Nakhowk khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami en natuk bowt kown.<verse eid="EZK 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 35:5" />“‘Israel kowh ransu en chowng mih akrama khowk. Ang ripah kowh amatni kowh akhowng mih uowi dowi khe amatni kowi dow saidawng rut kowi en ap-ah khai. <verse eid="EZK 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 35:6" />Naiawng rakowi ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai, ang matia ming hown takham se ang tek khowk. En dow maru sak sai dawma rakowi nasai en kown miuüa rut kowi ang naap en kown. Kawmat dow en kowi nasai en kown mih khin chowbowt. <verse eid="EZK 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 35:7" />Seir hungh kowi mih akhaw aklaima hai apiaknama ang nachangah kown, now nakowi kowh kowmang kowkat miuüa maten kowi ang nakowngta kown. <verse eid="EZK 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 35:8" />En kowh hungma mawngma süng dow kowng miuüa kowh uak hown nataphum kown. Tasenra kowi kowh kowng mih en kowh maru-uüa uak dow chut kowi ün, lawngrawi kowi ün hai awchawng awlang kowi ün natakuakla pan kown. <verse eid="EZK 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 35:9" />En kowi dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi akhaw aklaima ang natow en kown. Nakowi dow miapaw naplan uowi kown nadowi bowt. Nakhowk khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami en natuk bowt kown.<verse eid="EZK 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 35:10" />“‘Tawngplawng kowchow panow en tek mih, “Israel hai Juda pren dow anging kowh towbowt. Nami pren dow anging napowngta kown towbowt. Nakowi CHAKRAMANG uowi chepaw tawngpaw anging tuak dowi,” pakhai. <verse eid="EZK 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 35:11" />Naiawng rakowi ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai, ang matia ming hown takham se ang tek khowk. Amatni kowi en suiah kowh kunmaraura hai irsira en tüng pe iawng en kowi paw ang natüng en kown. Ang chet en tara mih khin khe amatni pungmadawng kowi ang natatüng kown. <verse eid="EZK 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 35:12" />Nami khin khe dow Israel kowh hungma mawngma kowi en peah rukrai mih laiklow maten ang CHAKRAMANG ta chekhai pami en natuk kown. “Israel pren dow apiaknama uowi khai. Nami pren dow naiawnta kownkow pe anging mih chowbowt,” padow en tek khai. <verse eid="EZK 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 35:13" />En dow bawrima hown kingküala ang mih laiklow ahuma en tek khai. Naiawngün en kowh laiklow dow ang ta bowk chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 35:14" />“‘CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih maiawng: Akhaw aklaima ang chang en khe dow palusama maru napiaw kown. <verse eid="EZK 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 35:15" />Israel chenchap powngah mih pren akhaw aklaima uowi mih en khi hanow en piaw khai. Nami powm iawng en kowi paw akhaw aklaima ang nachang en kown. Aw Seir hungh, en hai Edawm kowi kowh arah maten akhaw aklaima naphaw kown. Nakhowk khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami en natuk bowt kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai<verse eid="EZK 35:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EZK 36" />
  <para style="s">Alai kowh iawng Israel naplan phaw kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 36:1" />Akung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, mami laiklow Israel kowh hungma mawngma kowi kowtek pe diah, now CHAKRAMANG kowh mami laiklow pe süntaah diah. <verse eid="EZK 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 36:2" />Israel lawnguan kowi amatni kowh ransu-uüa dow awmrawmma hown tek mih, ‘Khaleng dow alowngma mih arah prim a-i ka powngta khai bowt!’ pakhai. <verse eid="EZK 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 36:3" />Naiawng rakowi ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek khowk, akeng chenchapuüa napowngta enni kownkow hai maru prawngren müa enni nachowng kownkow enni riaret kowi kowh maru-uüa piak enni hai iawn enni mih chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 36:4" />Naiawng rakowi aw Israel kowh hungma mawngma, ang laiklow sünta büa diah. Aw aiukma mih hungh hai asowmchow mih hungh, rak hai lawngrawi maten ang laiklow sünta büa diah. Apiaknama hai akhaw aklaima mih arah maten ang laiklow sünta büa diah; enni kowh marow hownia dow ariaret kowi kowh chenchapuüa pawla enni uanh bowk khowk, now enni kowh marow dow ransu-uüa changla rensi kau khai bowt. <verse eid="EZK 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 36:5" />Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek enni khowk, ang kunmaraura maih iawng lün pluplup towbowt kowh akeng chenchapuüa hai Edawmuüa maten kowi ang nakingküaah kown mih laiklow ang tek khowk. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow nasui enni kownkow hai napawta enni uanh bowk kownkow ang kowh pren mih powngta büah khai.<verse eid="EZK 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 36:6" />“Naiawng rakowi en mih pur prakowi tawng iawng chow Israel pren naphaw kown mih lawnguan krawi tek diah. Aia kowh aiukma mih hai asowmchow mih hungh, rak hai lawngrawi kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah: CHAKRAMANG thurai tek mih, ‘Ang kunmarau lai bowt kowh ang tek lai khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow akeng chenchap tut-e enni ka rukrai khai. <verse eid="EZK 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 36:7" />Naiawng rakowi ang takham khowk, enni riaret kowi kowh chenchapuüa paw naka rukrai kown.<verse eid="EZK 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 36:8" />“‘Nachenganchepaw aw Israel kowh hungma mawngma, enni mih enni kowh singh mia kowi krawi pe prekah hanow ang kowh maru Israeluüa kowi ahuma nape uiah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni mih alenma nauang plan bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 36:9" />Ang natawi tangila enni hai enni prakowi ang nape ching bowt kown. Nahanow enni luk kowi mih nachang üa nachang laih hanow nasawt liu bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 36:10" />Enni luk kowi mih Israel pachenma kowi maru iun ahuma ang nape prungah kown. Enni kowh marow kowi maru nauowi bowt kown, now apiaknama mih arah maten narawah kown. <verse eid="EZK 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 36:11" />Enni luk kowi maru hai tawncher ahuma ang nape prungah kown, now amatni dow naprung hanow aiun akawmma naphaw kown. Enni luk kowi mih alai kowh iawng maru kowi ang nape uowiah kown, now alai kowh lak-e lup lang chawn iawng ang nachang enni kown. Nakhowk khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami enni natuk bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 36:12" />Enni luk kowi ang kowh maru Israeluüa kowi ang nape mangah kown. Amatni dow napowngta enni kown, now enni dow amatni kowh nachowng kown. Enni mih Israeluüa kowh chauüa kowi sakkrai hown nape kowngah kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="EZK 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 36:13" />“‘Aw Israel pren, en matia maru kowi en iawnah pahai maru tek en khai, now kowmatia chenchap kowi kowngta pe chauüa bowk pahai maru tek en khai. <verse eid="EZK 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 36:14" />Nachenganchepaw ang tek khowk, en matia maru kowi en nakrawi piak kown nadowi bowt, now en matia chenchap kowi en nakowngta pe chauüa kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 36:15" />Chenchapuüa prawngren en mih ang nape ta en kown nadowi bowt, now chenchapuüa pe en mih rukrai paw ang nape kham en kown nadowi bowt. En rakowi en chenchapuüa natatheu kown nadowi bowt. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 36:16" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 36:17" />“Aw maru chapa, Israeluüa mih amatni pren kowi uowi khe amatni kowh chowm krang uowi krang hai amatni kowh alup ala hown pren mih sürlawkah khai. Amatni kowh chowm krang uowi krang dow ang mik kowi mih masiuüa uisawng uowi khe kowh asürlawkma mih iawng chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 36:18" />Naiawng rakowi amatni luk kowi mih ang kowh kunmaraura ang hüng pe khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow pren kowi mih sai maru khai, now amatni kowh arup aren hown pren mih sürlawkah büah khai. <verse eid="EZK 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 36:19" />Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi mih akeng pren hai akeng chenchapuüa tut-e ang krawi uetah khai. Amatni kowi dow amatni kowh chowm krang uowi krang hai alup ala iawng ang ripah khai. <verse eid="EZK 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 36:20" />Akeng pren kowi amatni cham taset plawt khe amatni dow ang kowh ming chimsaima mih sürlawk ang khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni lawnguan kowi maru tek mih, ‘Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh maru chowdiah. Tawkche amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh pren hownia apowt takla khai,’ pakhai. <verse eid="EZK 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 36:21" />Ang kowh ming chimsaima mih natownla kownkow ang pela ching reng chowdiah. Tawkche Israeluüa mih amatni cham taset plawt mih prenchakuüa tut-e ang kowh ming mih cham sürlawkah khai. <verse eid="EZK 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 36:22" />Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe diah. CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Aw Israeluüa, enni rakowi ang nauang plan pawla enni kown mih nadowi. Tawkche ang kowh ming chimsaima mih rakowi ang nauang plan pawla enni kown mih chowtaih. Enni dow enni cham taset plawt mih prenchakuüa tut-e ang kowh ming chimsaima mih enni sürlawkah khai. <verse eid="EZK 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 36:23" />Chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi ang kowh kraingma mih ming chimsaima mih dow enni sürlawkah khai. Naiawng rakowi ang kowh kri kraingma mih chimsaima mih dow chenchapuüa pur kowi ang natüngah kown. Amatni pur kowi nami ming chimsaira enni hownia ang tüng mih khin khe dow chenchapuüa mih ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk bowt kown.<verse eid="EZK 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 36:24" />“‘Chenchapuüa pungmadawng hownia ang nauang lawtla enni kown. Pren maten hownia ang nakua nalawm enni hanow enni matia pren kowi ang nauang plan pawla enni kown. <verse eid="EZK 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 36:25" />Enni luk kowi achimma mih tui ang nathet enni kown. Naiawng rakowi enni mih nachimsai bowt kown. Enni kowh asür alawi maten ang nasauta enni hanow arup aren kowi enni nachup kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 36:26" />Enni lak kowi mih sak hai saktuak sar ang natow enni kown. Enni kowh akhawtma mih saktuak ang nahenta enni hanow adechow mih saktuak ang natow enni kown. <verse eid="EZK 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 36:27" />Enni lak kowi ang kowh lümla ang natow enni kown; nahanow ang kowh ari aiang maten enni nachün kown, now ang kowh ari aiang nachün kownkow enni nape ching bowt kown.<verse eid="EZK 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 36:28" />“‘Enni pipu-uüa kowi ang peah mih pren kowi enni nauowi kown. Nakowi dow enni mih ang kowh maru nachowng kown, now ang dow enni kowh Thurai nachowng kown. <verse eid="EZK 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 36:29" />Enni natasür talawk kown mih maten hownia ang nasawk nasau enni kown. Luprak ahuma ang nape enni kown, now enni pren kowi ang nauang chin enni khown kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 36:30" />Khown kuak rakowi chenchapuüa tut-e enni naka rukrai dowi kownkow singh kowi kowh uih-ak hai luprak kowi ang nape huah kown. <verse eid="EZK 36:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 36:31" />Nakhowk khe mih enni kowh chowm krang uowi krang ngak hai lup ngak lawnguan kowi enni naka tuak kown. Now enni matia kowh angak hai suiiai kaniaima mih lup rakowi enni matia kowi enni natasui kown. <verse eid="EZK 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 36:32" />Tukah büah reng diah. Mami lup ang nachang kown mih dow enni rakowi nadowi chekhai. Aw Israel chenchap, enni kowh chowm krang uowi krang rakowi rukrai büa diah, now sak kowi arauma uowi büa diah.<verse eid="EZK 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 36:33" />“‘Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek khowk, angak maten ang nasauta enni kown mih ni khe enni kowh marow kowi maru-uüa kowi ang nape uowiah kown. Now apiakma mih arah ün dow ang naplan thawpah iawk kown. <verse eid="EZK 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 36:34" />Maru cham mang cham kat khe kowh apiaknama khila mih pren kowi dow maru nachang üa chang laih iawk kown. <verse eid="EZK 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 36:35" />Nami kung kowi dow amatni natek kown mih, “Alai khe dow mami pren mih apiaknama chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow Eden bakan iawng towbowt. Aia kowh marow dow apiaknama, akhaw aklaima hai adi asekma takuak hüah chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow tap taum lut towbowt, now maru uowi rah phaw khai bowt,” napa kown. <verse eid="EZK 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 36:36" />Nakhowk khe dow enni riaret kowi kowh ta sing uowi mih chenchapuüa mih ang CHAKRAMANG chowtaih apiakma mih arah krawi plan thawp mih hai krawi plan chowk singh mih pami natuk kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk; ang tekta iawng ang nachang ngengche kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 36:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 36:37" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Israeluüa uang lü uang leng mih nasünta kownkow ang kamrüt khowk. Amatni kowi ruapur hawmh iawng maru iun akawmma ang nachangah iawk kown mih ang kamrüt khowk. <verse eid="EZK 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 36:38" />Pawi khe Jerusalem marow kowi phuchua müa ruapur atekma chekhai. Nami powm iawng tapiak khowk mih Jerusalem marow kowi maru iun natek mup iawk kown. Nakhowk khe dow amatni mih ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 36:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EZK 37" />
  <para style="s">Arawrapma mih hut hownia maru sing awr phaw mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 37:1" />Akat khe CHAKRAMANG kowh kür mih ang luk kowi uang uowi khai, now aia mih aia kowh lümla hown pawla ang hanow lawngrawi dawnglang kowi kowtow ang khai. Nami arah kowi dow hut tapung hüah khai. <verse eid="EZK 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 37:2" />Now aia mih nami lawngrawi kowi krawi lenla ang khai. Nakhowk khe nami lawngrawi kowi mih hut ahuma ang khi khai; naiawngün hut dow akang khawngma kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 37:3" />Nakhowk khe aia lünta ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, naiawngün hut awr ia sing kown bow?” pakhai. Now ang klangah mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, nami dow en chowtaih tuk,” pape khai. <verse eid="EZK 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 37:4" />Nakhowk khe aia mih naiawngün hut tut-e maiawng pe tek ang lai khai, “Akangma mih hut maten ow, enni mih CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow sünta diah. <verse eid="EZK 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 37:5" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Ang nachua enni kawli kown, now enni mih nasing iawk kown. <verse eid="EZK 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 37:6" />Enni luk kowi nga ang nape uowiah kown, now naiawngün kowi mih pik hown ang nabawmta enni lut kown. Nami kung kowi dow ang nachua enni kawli kown, now enni mih nasing kown. Nakhowk khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami enni natuk bowt kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 37:7" />Now CHAKRAMANG pe tek ang iawng rowprowp ang krawi tek khai. Naiawng ang krawi tek mih khin khe takhingla khawk mih atün ang ta khai, now naiawngün hut mih chowlowkkow hut hown tachawk bowk khai. <verse eid="EZK 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 37:8" />Naiawngün hut luk kowi dow nga krawi tachai khai, now naiawngün nga luk kowi dow pik krawi tachai bowk khai. Nachenganchepaw naiawngün tut-e kawli uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 37:9" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, li tut-e mami laiklow krawi tek diah: CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Li ow, maiawngün uak naia singla kownkow uangah hanow uang krawi chua pe kawli diah,’ pape diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="EZK 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 37:10" />Naiawng rakowi aia tek ang iawng ang krawi tek khai, now naiawngün uak kowi kawli krawi kup khai. Amatni dow awr sing hanow khawk hown awr iowng khai. Amatni dow siphai hawmh akawmma mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 37:11" />Nami kung kowi dow aia tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, Israeluüa dow maiawngün hut iawng chekhai. Amatni dow tek mih, ‘Anging lawngtang kowh hut ün keu khai bowt; anging kowh sakowmra paw uowi dowi bowt. Anging chenchap dow chur mih chowbowt,’ pakhai. <verse eid="EZK 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 37:12" />Naiawng rakowi amatni tut-e mami laiklow kowtek pe diah, ‘Aw maru-uüa, enni kowh tadupra kuam ang nathaiah hanow nami hownia ang nalau enni kown, now akung kowi Israel pren kowi ang nauang plan pawla enni kown. <verse eid="EZK 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 37:13" />Tadupra kuam hownia ang lawtla enni mih khin khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami enni natuk bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 37:14" />Ang kowh lümla mih enni lak kowi ang natow enni kown, now enni mih nasing kown. Enni matia pren kowi ang nape uowi enni kown. Nakhowk khe dow ang CHAKRAMANG mih tekta iawng chang reng pami enni natuk bowt kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel hai Juda plan tabawng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 37:15" />Akung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 37:16" />“Aw maru chapa, cham paw müa lowk hanow nami müa kowi, ‘Juda vüi hai Juda hown kowh tatawm mih chenchapuüa vüi,’ pahai ruiah diah. Nami kung kowi cham plan paw müa lowk hanow nami müa kowi, ‘Efraim vüi hai Israel tawngphak pra kowh chenchapuüa vüi,’ pahai ruiah diah. <verse eid="EZK 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 37:17" />Akung kowi nami müa pre buk mih en rut kowi müa lowkchow iawng nachowng kownkow chawkah hanow dowkah diah. <verse eid="EZK 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 37:18" />Now en chenchapuüa nalünta en kown mih, ‘Nami auan tawng chow,’ napa kown. <verse eid="EZK 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 37:19" />Nakhowk khe en natek pe kown mih maiawng: CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, ‘Efraim hai tawngphak pra kowh krungchakuüa kowi ang napawah hanow Juda hown ang nabawngah kown. Müa pre buk mih hownia müa lowkchow ang nachangah kown,’ pape diah.<verse eid="EZK 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="EZK 37:20-21" />“Now en rui pe laiklow mih müa pre buk mih amatni pur kowi dowkah hanow maiawng en natek pe kown: CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, ‘Akeng chenchap hownia Israeluüa kowi ang nauang lawtla kown. Amatni kowi dow pren tali nui hownia ang nakrawi kuaah hanow amatni kowh pren kowi ang nauang pawla kown. <verse eid="EZK 37:20-21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 37:22" />Israel kowi kowh hungma mawngma luk kowi amatni hown pren lowkchow ang nachangah kown. Amatni bowkbowk luk kowi mang lowk iachow taih nauowi kown, now amatni mih katpaw pre bak nauowi kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 37:23" />Amatni kowh asürlawkma mih arup aren hai angak hown amatni mih katpaw natasür talawk kown nadowi bowt. Angak maten hai piakra tiama pra mang mih hownia amatni kowi ang nahenah kown, now ang nachimsaiah kown. Nami kung kowi dow amatni mih ang kowh maru nachowng bowt kown, now ang dow amatni kowh Thurai nachowng bowt kown.<verse eid="EZK 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 37:24" />“‘Ang kowh nar David mih amatni kowh mang nachowng kown, now amatni bowkbowk kowh athing mih lowk iachow nauowi kown. Amatni dow ang kowh ari aiang iawng nauowi kown, now ang kowh rirow maten kaneuma nachünah büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 37:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 37:25" />Ang kowh nar Jakawb kowi ang peah mih pren kowi, amatni kowh pipu-uüa uowila mih pren kowi amatni nauowi kown. Amatni, amatni kowh chauüa hai amatni kowh chu cheuüa nakowi mih chowngchowng saksakma nauowi kown, now ang kowh nar David mih chowngchowng saksakma amatni kowh mang nachowng kown. <verse eid="EZK 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 37:26" />Amatni vüi taking tasangra sangbowk laitawm ang natow pe lowk kown; nami dow chowngchowng saksakma mih sangbowk laitawm nachowng kown. Amatni kowi dow amatni kowh pren ang napeah kown, now amatni kowi ang nape prungah kown. Ang kowh kim mih chowngchowng saksakma vüi amatni pungmadawng kowi ang natowah kown. <verse eid="EZK 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 37:27" />Ang kowh uowi rah mih amatni pungmadawng kowi nachowng kown; ang dow amatni kowh Thurai nachowng kown, now amatni dow ang kowh maru nachowng kown. <verse eid="EZK 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 37:28" />Ang kowh kim chowngchowng saksakma vüi amatni pungmadawng kowi chowng khe dow ang CHAKRAMANG mih Israeluüa kowi ang matia vüi ang lang kraah mih pami chenchap maten natuk bowt kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 37:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EZK 38" />
  <para style="s">Gawg vüi kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 38:1" />Akung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. Aia tek ang mih, <verse eid="EZK 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 38:2" />“Aw maru chapa, Magawg pren kowi kowh Mesek hai Tubal chenchap kowh kruitown mih Gawg prakowi dangah now pur prakowi nauang ting kown mih lawnguan maiawng kowtek pe diah: <verse eid="EZK 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 38:3" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Aw Mesek hai Tubal pren kowi kowh kruitown mih Gawg, ang dow en kowh ransu chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 38:4" />Kung prakowi ang naui en hanow kuai kowi kowh dam tauowk iawng en kowh kammow kowi auowk müa hown ang nauowk en kown. Now en kowh siphai hawmh maten hown, kawrnga hawmh, klangiungma mih tawnguat khupma mih kawrnga luk kowi kowh chowm mih siphai hawmh, aiukma mih hai asowmchow mih kawngma hai saidawng hailawm thumchak aiukma Israel pren kowi ang nauang lawtla en kown. <verse eid="EZK 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 38:5" />Enni hown Persia, Ethiawpia hai Libia pren siphaiuüa kowi paw ang nauang pawla kown. Amatni dow kawngma dowkma hai lukruk krukma kangowh naown kown. <verse eid="EZK 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 38:6" />Nami klen kowi Gomer pren siphaiuüa hai tawngphak pra kowh prenchur rihi kowi uowi mih Bet-Togarma pren siphaiuüa kowi paw en hown ang nauang pawla kown. Naiawng en hown chenchap ahuma nauang tawi kown.<verse eid="EZK 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 38:7" />“‘En mih kamrütma hown uowi diah. En hai en riaret kowi kowh uang tawi takua mih enni bowkbowk kamrüt büa diah, now en mih amatni kowh siphai aluchow chowng diah. <verse eid="EZK 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 38:8" />Ning ahuma rawn kung kowi nasen Israel kownkow ang nahaw en kown. Nakhowk khe Israel dow tasenra hownia tanai kowh thaulangma nauowi kown. Nami pren kowi kowh maru-uüa dow chenchap ahuma mih pungmadawng hownia uang plan hanow Israel pren kowi kowh hungma mawngma kowi uang takua talawm miuüa chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 38:9" />En hai en kowh siphaiuüa maten hai en hown kowh akeng chenchapuüa mih nami pren nakowsen kownkow liku iawng nakowtarü kown. Nami pren kowi mih uangnim iawng enni nakowtaluk khup kown.<verse eid="EZK 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 38:10" />“‘Nami ni khe dow en sak kowi mih tuakra ahuma nauang ting kown, now sangkrangra ngak en nathawp kown. <verse eid="EZK 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 38:11" />Nakhowk khe mih tap uowi dowi mih kua hai marow nakrawi sen kown mih en nakamrüt kown. Tap, tapplawt hai tapplawt klia uowi dowi kowi tuak krat pusa uowi dowi hai thaulangma uowi mih maru-uüa kowi en nakrawi sen kown. <verse eid="EZK 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 38:12" />Apiaknama mih kowi rawta kaneu mih pren hai akeng chenchap hownia kowh uang plan mih chenchapuüa kowi en nasenah kown, now amatni kowh dawngthawnguan mih en nakrawi paw kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow kurengma chekhai, now amatni kowh pren dow palusama kowi kowh lang pankri mih chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 38:13" />“‘Nakhowk khe Seba, Dedan hai Tarsis pren kowi kowh kun chang miuüa natek en kown mih, “En uang rup uanh kownkow en uang mih bow? Now kuh, tai, tawncher, dawngthawnguan hai akeng uanh nauang rup kownkow en kua maru kawm mih bow?” napa kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 38:14" />“Naiawng rakowi aw maru chapa, Gawg kowi mami laiklow kowtek pe diah. Aia kowi en natek pe kown mih maiawng: CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Ang kowh maru-uüa thaulangma uowi mih en nakhi kown. Nakhowk khe amatni kowi nasenah kownkow en nakamrüt kown. <verse eid="EZK 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 38:15" />Tawngphak pra kowh pren sünghi kowi en kowh uowi rah hownia en hai en hown kowh akeng chenchapuüa mih kawrnga luk kowi chowm hanow thumchak aiukma hai akürma enni nauang kown. <verse eid="EZK 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 38:16" />Ang kowh maru-uüa uowi rah pren kowi uangnim iawng nataluk khup kownkow en hai en kowh maru-uüa mih nauang kown. Aw Gawg, ning kawmma rawn kung kowi dow ang kowh pren kowi nauang senah kownkow ang nauang pawla en kown. En luk kowi tawng chow phaw mih hownia ang kowh chimsaira mih ang natüngah kown. Nakhowk khe dow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami chenchap maten natuk bowt kown.<verse eid="EZK 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gawg kowi Thurai ripah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 38:17" />“‘Ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk, achük alai kowh ang kowh nar Israeluüa kowi risiuüa hown ang kowtek pe mih dow en lawnguan kowi chekhai. Nami khin khe Israeluüa kowi en nakingküaah kown mih lawnguan dow amatni kowi risiuüa ning towng ning towng kowtek pe khai. <verse eid="EZK 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 38:18" />Nachenganchepaw Gawg uang sen Israel pren mih ni khe dow aia luk kowi lainowmma ang nakunmarau kown. <verse eid="EZK 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 38:19" />Ang kowh kunmarau lün pluplup mih hown ang tek khowk. Nami khin khe mih Israel pren kowi lainowmma lihowng nauang kown. <verse eid="EZK 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 38:20" />Nakhowk khe mih sata kowi kowh dam, kuang kowi kowh uakling uaber, kaurawng kowi kowh asadua, krawng luk kowi kowh kam hai sowr mih chap maten hai lusa maru maten ang pur kowi nachür kown. Aiuk aiukma mih hungh nataplan lut kown, alowng alowngma mih hungh natadi iawm kown, now tap maten krawng kowi natim kown. <verse eid="EZK 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 38:21" />Israel pren kowi kowh hungma mawngma maten luk kowi Gawg kowi nasenah kownkow ang nauang pawla pe saidawng kown. Nakhowk khe dow aia kowh maru-uüa mih amatni lala saidawng hown natasen büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 38:22" />Gawg kowi mih makowng hawi hai tasen hown ang naripah kown. Now uangchak mang, ria hai napawksi maih mih aia hai aia kowh siphaiuüa luk kowi hai aia hown kowh tabawng mih chenchap maten luk kowi ang nauang hüng pe kown. <verse eid="EZK 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 38:23" />Naiawng hown chenchap ahuma pur kowi ang matia kowi ang natüngah kown. Ang dow chimsaima hai kri kraingma mih ang natüngah kown. Nakhowk khe dow amatni mih ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk bowt kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 38:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EZK 39" />
  <para style="s">Gawg sum mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 39:1" />“Aw maru chapa, Gawg kowi pur prakowi tawng chow naphaw kown mih laiklow maiawng kowtek pe diah: CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, ‘Aw Mesek hai Tubal chenchap kowh kruitown mih Gawg, ang dow en kowh ransu chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 39:2" />Kung prakowi ang naui en hanow ang naküngla en kown. En kowi mih tawngphak pra kowh rihi chur hownia ang nauang pawla en hanow Israel kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi ang nasa en kown. <verse eid="EZK 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 39:3" />Nami kung kowi dow en lakuai rut kowi kowh leba hai hawmlawm rut kowi kowh leba sek mih ang phekta en hanow nakuakta en kown, now akhowng mih uowi dowi kowi ang natowta hüah kown. <verse eid="EZK 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 39:4" />Now en hai en kowh siphaiuüa hown en hown kowh tawi tabawng mih akeng chenchapuüa hailawm Israel kowh hungma mawngma kowi enni natakuakla pan kown. En kowi mih <char style="w">langta</char> hai kaurawng uaramchak hawmh chakkham ang nachangla en kown. <verse eid="EZK 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 39:5" />Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek khowk, en kowh uak mih dowm kowi kowh akuangma mih rah kowi natakuak hüah kown. <verse eid="EZK 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 39:6" />Magawg luk kowi hai alakma mih pren kowi thaulangma uowi miuüa luk kowi ang nauang chin pe maih kown, nahanow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah bowt kown.<verse eid="EZK 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 39:7" />“‘Ang kowh maru Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi ang kowh ming chimsaima mih ang natüngah kown; ang kowh ming mih ang nape tasür talawkah kown nadowi bowt. Nahanow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh chimsaima mih Thurai pami chenchapuüa natuk bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 39:8" />Nami tara chetra ni dow nauang ting kown; nami dow nauang phaw ngengche kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek khowk, nami ni dow ang tekta iawng uang phaw kown.<verse eid="EZK 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 39:9" />“‘Nakhowk khe dow Israel pren kowi kowh uowi miuüa mih nachangla sawp kownkow tasen müa rutchün khawkleng nakrawi kuah kown. Amatni dow aiukma mih hai asowmchow mih kawngma, leba hai leba sek, kawtda hai reh mih ranit ning mowr sawp takcha kowi natik büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 39:10" />Dowm hownia hai kaurawng hownia amatni mih sawp pawk natakla kown nadowi bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow sawp takcha kowi tasen müa rutchün khawkleng natik büah kown chekhai. Amatni dow uang rup uanh miuüa kowi napawta pe uanh lai kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="EZK 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gawg kowi dupah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 39:11" />“‘Nami ni khe dow Gawg kowi mih Israel pren kowi ang napeah tadupra kown. Nami tadupra dow Sata Kowng satlawt pra kowh Khari Kowi Miuüa Lawngrawi kowi naown kown. Nakowi dow uak hu lai rakowi cham mang cham kat miuüa kowh tiama natapit kown. Naiawng rakowi nami lawngrawi kowi mih Gawg Kowh Thumchak Lawngrawi pahai maru natek pe bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 39:12" />Israeluüa mih ranit la mowr amatni kowh uak nakrawi dup hanow nachimsai pren kown. <verse eid="EZK 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 39:13" />Amatni kowi nakrawi dup kown mih dow Israel pren kowi kowh maru maten chekhai. Naiawng hown ang kowh kraingra ang tüng mih ni khe amatni kowh ming iung nang iung dow nakrawi tauet kown. <verse eid="EZK 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 39:14" />Nami ranit la chur khe dow nachimsaita pren kownkow napaw pe maru kown. Amatni dow paprenma kowi nakrawi len hanow krawng kowi takuak hüah mih hut maten nakrawi cham kown, now naiawngün hut maten nadupah büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 39:15" />Pren lak kowi cham krawi len büah mih khin khe amatni che khi maru hut lowk hanow Gawg Kowh Thumchak Lawngrawi kowi kuam thai miuüa dupta dowi mowr maru nakhila kownkow natow pe amat müa lowk kown. <verse eid="EZK 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 39:16" />Nami lawngrawi kowi kowh marow lowk mih ming dow Hamona (Thumchak) pahai nachap pe kown. Naiawng hown amatni mih pren dow nachimsaiah kown,’ pape diah.<verse eid="EZK 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 39:17" />“Aw maru chapa, ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek khowk, uakling uaber chap maten hai kaurawng uaramchak chap maten kowi hawah now en natek pe kown mih, ‘Uang takua talawm büa diah. Israel kowi kowh hungma mawngma luk kowi phuchua pawi kri kraingma ang kamrütta enni mih kowi pren tali nui hownia uang takua büa diah. Nakowi mih vi hai nga enni nacha kown. <verse eid="EZK 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 39:18" />Akürma mih maru-uüa kowh nga enni naka cha kown, now lusa kowi kowh kruitown miuüa kowh vi enni naka kham kown. Naiawngün maru-uüa dow Basan pren kowi kowh aiuk akauma mih ruapurla, ruapur chah, ruala hai chiala iawng kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 39:19" />Ang nakamrüt enni kown mih phuchua pawi kowi dow duh dowi mowr enni naka cha sau kown, now pua dowi mowr enni naka kham vi kown. <verse eid="EZK 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 39:20" />Ang kowh pawitang kowi mih du pat kawrnga nga, kawrnga kari te mih nga, akürma mih maru nga hai siphaiuüa nga enni naka cha kown,’ pape diah.<verse eid="EZK 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 39:21" />“Chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi ang kowh kraingra mih ang natüngah kown, now ang kowh akürma mih bawng hown Gawg kowh siphaiuüa kowi ang naripah kown mih chenchapuüa maten nakhi kown. <verse eid="EZK 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 39:22" />Nami ni hownia dow Israeluüa mih ang chowtaih amatni kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai pami natuk bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 39:23" />Now chenchapuüa dow amatni kowh angak rakowi chowtaih Israeluüa cham takhang mih pami natuk bowt kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow ang kaah sakowm dowi iawng uowi khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow ang cham dangta pe khai, now amatni kowi mih ransu-uüa rut kowi ang ap-ah khai. Nahanow amatni dow tasenra kowi cham kowng bowk khai. <verse eid="EZK 39:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 39:24" />Amatni kowh asür alawi hai angak uowi iawng amatni kowi ang changah khai, now amatni kowi mih ang cham dangta pe khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 39:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowi Thurai krawi kuaah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 39:25" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai plan tek mih, “Kawmat dow cham takhangra hownia Jakawb kowi ang nauang plan pawla bowt kown, now Israel kowi kowh maru-uüa maten luk kowi ang nasaksing sanaah bowt kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh ming chimsaima mih dow <char style="w">khowrbown dawma</char> hown ang towkala mih chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 39:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 39:26" />Amatni dow pren kowi thaulangma nauowi büah kown, now miapaw natüng pe kramra kown nadowi bowt. Nakhowk khe dow alai kowh ang luk kowi kaah sakowm dowi iawng uowi büah mih hai rukraira uowima mih lup changta büah mih nataphuang büah bowt kown. <verse eid="EZK 39:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 39:27" />Chenchapuüa pungmadawng hownia amatni kowi ang uang plan pawla khe hai ransu-uüa pren hownia amatni kowi ang uang kuala khe dow chenchap akawmma pur kowi amatni hownia ang kowh chimsaira ang natüngah kown. <verse eid="EZK 39:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 39:28" />Nakhowk khe dow amatni mih ang chowtaih amatni kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai pami natuk büah bowt kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow chenchap alang alangma miuüa tut-e ang amatni kowi ang cham pe takhangah chepaw amatni kowi dow amatni pren kowi ang nauang plan pawla iawk kown. Amatni kowi dow mia kowi paw ang nakuakta hüah kown nadowi. <verse eid="EZK 39:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 39:29" />Amatni kowi mih ang nacham dangta kown nadowi bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Israeluüa luk kowi mih ang kowh lümla ang nahüng pe kown chekhai. Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 39:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EZK 40" />
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim sar mukmang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 40:1" />Anging cham takhang mih 25 ning mih ning uown kowi kowh lacher hamüt ni mih ni khe dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kür mih ang luk kowi uang ting khai. Nami kür uang ting mih dow Jerusalem marow piak mih laitali ning kung kowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 40:2" />Thurai pe khi ang mih mukmang kowi aia dow Israel pren kowi kowpawla ang hanow alowngma mih hungh luk kowi kowtow ang khai. Nami hungh mrawkphak prakowi dow marow iawng tawng chünchü ang khi lowk chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 40:3" />Nakowi aia pawla ang khe nakowi mih ang khi maru lowk ia khai. Nami maru kowh lumowr dow kri iawng tawk pluplup khai. Aia dow la hown kowh leng hai uanh khai müa kuaisek dowkma tapplawt kowi iowng phülü khai. <verse eid="EZK 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 40:4" />Nami maru tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, en mü diah, now sünta diah. Ang natüng en kown mih hai ang natek en kown mih maten kowi pe ching diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow makowi uang pawla en mih dow naiawngün natüng en kownkow chekhai. Now en khi-ah mih maten Israeluüa kowi en nakowtek pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim uat kowi kowh satlawt pra kowh tapplawt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 40:5" />Ang rik khi mih dow tap tavir lut mih Thurai chup kim chekhai. Now ang khi-ah mih maru mih taruk muk mih akhai müa dowkla now krawi khai tap khai. Nami tap dow aphia taruk muk hai akro taruk muk chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 40:6" />Nami kung kowi dow aia mih satlawt pra kowh tapplawt kowi kowkowi khai. Aia dow dawngbowk hown aluk kowi kowpünah hanow tapplawt kupra mowr kowi kowh arah krawi khaiah khai. Nami tapplawt pur kowi kowh arah klang dow taruk muk chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:6" /><verse number="7-10" style="v" sid="EZK 40:7-10" />Now tapplawt kowi dow hawmlawm pra hai lakuai prakowi kangchawngra rum uowi sum buk chi chekhai. Naiawngün kangchawngra rum kowh areng klang hai adowng phia dow taruk muk chi chekhai. Now naiawngün rum takra kowi kowh aping tat dow tanga muk chi chekhai. Tapplawt chur pra kowh lawtra mowr kowi kowh arah klang dow taruk muk chekhai. Nami lawtra plawt dow Thurai chup kim hown tatang dowk chekhai. Nami kung kowi dow nami maru mih tapplawt chur kowi kowh kimpuk downg phia khaiah khai. Nami kimpuk downg phia dow towklak plawt lak-e papra papra kowi lang chüt taruk muk chi chekhai. Nami kimpuk uar dow raiat muk chekhai. Nami hownia lawtla mih plawt ria kowi dow mapra lowk paipra lowk achüng uowi lowk chi chekhai. Nami achüng iuk dow lowk kowi pre muk chi chekhai. Tapplawt chur kowi kowh nami kimpuk plawt dang mih dow Thurai chup kim prakowi chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 40:7-10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 40:11" />Nami kung kowi dow aia mih krawi khai tapplawt khai. Tapplawt klang dow laisum muk chekhai, now tapplawt uar dow hamüt muk chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 40:12" />Kangchawngra rum maten pur kowi dow akro hai atat amuk chi mih tap uowi bowk chekhai, now naiawngün rum uar dow adowng phia hai areng klang taruk muk chi chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 40:13" />Nami kung kowi dow aia mih tapplawt luk phia krawi khaiah khai. Aia dow hawmlawm pra kowh kangchawngra rum uat pra kowh ping hownia lakuai pra kowh kangchawngra rum uat pra kowh ping mowr khaiah khai. Nami dow mapra ping hownia paipra ping mowr kowi 25 muk chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 40:14" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mami uan kowi kowh auan Hebrai lai hown arui uowi mih chim dowi.</char></note>Nami kung kowi dow tapplawt kowi kowh achüng uowi pre buk mih aia khaiah khai. Nami dow lowk kowi aklang 60 muk chi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 40:15" />Prang hownia kowh tapplawt hownia alak kowi kowh tapplawt mowr dow aklang 50 muk chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 40:16" />Prang hownia kowh towklak ping kowi hai achüng pre buk mih re-e kowh aping kowi dow tow pe lawkrachow mih tawngpawk uowi chekhai, now tapplawt chur kowi kowh towklak kowi paw lawkrachow uowi mih tawngpawk uowi chekhai. Naiawng hai tapplawt kowi kowh ping kowi dow tawngpawk uowi bowk chekhai. Nami klen kowi tapplawt chüng pre buk mih kowi dow chekmarawng singh rup ün thawp pe khai.<verse eid="EZK 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim uat kowi kowh viadawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 40:17" />Nami kung kowi dow nami maru mih Thurai chup kim uat kowi kowh viadawng kowi pawla ang khai. Nami viadawng tavir lut mih tap hown tasak mih abüng uowi dowi mih towklak uowi 30 klüng chekhai. Naiawngün towklak pur kowi dow pir pe hua mih tiama uowi lowk chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 40:18" />Nami pir pe hua mih arah dow tapplawt towng hawmlawm pra hai lakuai prakowi uowi bowk chekhai. Nami pir pe hua mih arah phia dow tapplawt klang hown katsang chekhai. Nami dow Thurai chup kim lak kowi kowh viadawng lak-e lang nem chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 40:19" />Nami kung kowi aia dow prang kowi kowh viadawng tapplawt achur pra kowh atowr hownia alak kowi kowh viadawng tapplawt auown pra kowh atowr mowr khaiah khai. Nami viadawng dow satlawt hai tawngphak prakowi alak 100 muk chi chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tawngphak pra kowh tapplawt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 40:20" />Nami kung kowi nami maru dow Thurai chup kim uat kowi kowh viadawng tawngphak pra kowh tapplawt mih aklang hai auar khaiah khai. <verse eid="EZK 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 40:21" />Nami tapplawt lak kowi kowh pre pra trui rum sum buk chi mih anowk, nakowi kowh achüng hai tapplawt chur kowi kowh towklak nowk dow aia rik khaiah mih satlawt pra kowh tapplawt nowk hown katsang chekhai. Naiawngün rum dow bowkbowk kowi aklang 50 muk hai auar 25 muk chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 40:22" />Nami kowi kowh tawngpawk, tapplawt chur kowi kowh towklak hai achüng kowi kowh chekmarawng rup ün dow satlawt pra kowh tapplawt kowi kowh iawng chekhai. Nami tapplawt kowi kowh pün müa dawng dow abowk uowi ranit bowk chekhai, now tapplawt chur kowi dow towklak uowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 40:23" />Alak pra kowh viadawng kowi satlawt pra kowh dang mih tapplawt iawng nami kowh paw tawngphak pra kowh dang mih tapplawt uowi lowk chekhai. Aia dow prang kowi kowh viadawng tapplawt achur pra kowh atowr hownia alak kowi kowh viadawng tapplawt auown pra kowh atowr mowr khaiah khai. Nami dow alak 100 muk chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mrawkphak pra kowh tapplawt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 40:24" />Nami kung kowi nami maru mih mrawkphak pra kowh tapplawt kowi pawla ang khai. Nakowi dow uat pra kowh viadawng mrawkphak prakowi ang khi tapplawt lowk khai. Aia dow nami tapplawt kowi kowh achüng hai viadawng mih krawi khaiah khai. Naiawngün paw akeng mih tapplawt kowi kowh iawng anowk katsang chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 40:25" />Akeng mih tapplawt kowi iawng mami tapplawt kowi paw tawngpawk uowi chekhai. Nami tapplawt dow areng klang 50 muk hai auar 25 muk chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 40:26" />Nami kowi kowh pün müa dawng kowi paw abowk uowi ranit bowk chekhai, now tapplawt chur kowi dow rum uowi lowk chekhai. Nami rum kowi kowh achüng uowi pre buk mih kowi paw chekmarawng rup uowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 40:27" />Alak kowi kowh viadawng kowi paw mrawkphak pra kowh dang mih tapplawt uowi lowk chekhai. Aia dow prang kowi kowh viadawng tapplawt achur pra kowh atowr hownia alak kowi kowh viadawng tapplawt auown pra kowh atowr mowr khaiah khai. Nami dow alak 100 muk chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 40:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alak kowi kowh viadawng mrawkphak tapplawt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 40:28" />Nami kung kowi dow nami maru mih mrawkphak pra kowh tapplawt hownia alak kowi kowh viadawng kowi uang pawla ang khai. Now aia dow nami mrawkphak pra kowh tapplawt mih krawi khaiah khai. Nami paw prang prakowi kowh tapplawt iawng anowk katsang chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 40:29" />Tapplawt kowi kowh kangchawngra rum, achüng pre buk mih hai tapplawt chur kowi kowh kimpuk mih akeng mih tapplawt kowi kowh nowk hown katsang chekhai. Akeng mih tapplawt kowi kowh iawng nami tapplawt kowi paw tawngpawk uowi chekhai. Nami tapplawt paw areng klang 50 muk hai auar 25 muk chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 40:30" />Alak kowi kowh viadawng kowi achüng luk kowi dow aluk uowi bowk chekhai. Naiawngün aluk phia dow areng klang 25 muk, now adowng phia tanga muk chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 40:31" />Alak kowi kowh viadawng mrawkphak pra kowh tapplawt kupra kimpuk mowr dow prang kowi viadawng prakowi chekhai. Tapplawt kupra tiama ria kowi kowh achüng pre buk mih kowi dow chekmarawng singh rup ün uowi bowk chekhai. Tapplawt kowi kowh apün müa dawng dow uowi raiat bowk chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 40:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alak kowi kowh viadawng satlawt tapplawt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 40:32" />Nami kung kowi dow nami maru mih alak pra kowh viadawng satlawt prakowi pawla ang khai, now nakowi kowh tapplawt mih krawi khaiah khai. Nami tapplawt paw akeng mih tapplawt iawng anowk katsang chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 40:33" />Tapplawt kowi kowh kangchawngra rum, achüng pre buk mih hai tapplawt chur kowi kowh kimpuk mih akeng mih tapplawt kowi kowh nowk hown katsang chekhai. Akeng mih tapplawt kowi kowh iawng nami tapplawt kowi paw tawngpawk uowi chekhai. Nami tapplawt paw areng klang 50 muk hai auar 25 muk chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 40:34" />Nami tapplawt chur kowi kowh kimpuk plawt dang mih dow prang prakowi kowh viadawng prakowi chekhai. Tapplawt kowi kowh achüng pre buk mih kowi dow chekmarawng singh rup ün uowi bowk chekhai. Nakowi kowh pün müa dawng paw abowk uowi raiat bowk chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 40:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alak kowi kowh viadawng tawngphak tapplawt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 40:35" />Nami kung kowi nami maru mih tawngphak pra kowh tapplawt kowi kowpawla ang hanow nami tapplawt mih krawi khaiah khai. Nami tapplawt paw akeng mih tapplawt iawng anowk katsang chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 40:36" />Nakowi kowh kangchawngra rum, achüng pre buk mih hai towklak mih akeng mih tapplawt kowi iawng anowk katsang chekhai. Akeng mih tapplawt kowi iawng nami tapplawt kowi paw tawngpawk uowi chekhai. Nami tapplawt paw areng klang 50 muk hai auar 25 muk chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 40:37" />Nami tapplawt chur kowi kowh kimpuk plawt dang mih dow prang prakowi kowh viadawng prakowi chekhai. Tapplawt kowi kowh achüng pre buk mih kowi dow chekmarawng singh rup ün uowi bowk chekhai. Nakowi kowh pün müa dawng paw abowk uowi raiat bowk chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 40:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tawncher phuchua chang müa kamrütra rum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 40:38" />Uat kowi kowh viadawng kowi tawngphak pra kowh alak tapplawt chüng ria kowi dow abüng uowi dowi mih towklak uowi lowk chekhai. Nami dow tikah mih uanap chang müa tawncher saura rum chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 40:39" />Now kupra kimpuk kowi kowh rum lak kowi dow pawitang uowi pre buk chi chekhai. Naiawngün pawitang luk kowi dow tikah mih uanap, angak lawt lük müa uanap hai aprek lawt lük müa uanap kowi kowh tawncher nga mih tawpah khai. <verse eid="EZK 40:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 40:40" />Thurai chup kim tapplawt pünra dawng ria kowi dow pre prakowi pawitang uowi pre buk chi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 40:41" />Naiawng hai tapplawt kupra kimpuk kowi hai viadawng kowi pawitang uowi tali klüng chi chekhai. Naiawngün pawitang dow bowkbowk kowi raiat klüng chekhai. Naiawngün pawitang luk kowi dow chaknga mih tawpah khai. <verse eid="EZK 40:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 40:42" />Tikah mih uanap chang müa uanh kamrütra paw hua hown kowh pawitang uowi tali klüng tak chekhai. Naiawngün pawitang maten dow areng klang hai adowng phia amuk hown dawnglang chi chekhai, now akro dow pamuk chi chekhai. Phuchua müa uanh dow naiawngün pawitang kowi towah khai. <verse eid="EZK 40:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 40:43" />Naiawngün pawitang kowi dow tavir lut aphia apawk chi towla pe auer khai. Nachangla phuchua kown mih chaknga dow naiawngün pawitang kowi towah khai.<verse eid="EZK 40:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uamowuüa kowh rum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 40:44" />Nami kung kowi nami maru dow alak viadawng kowi kowh tapplawt kowi uang pawla ang khai. Nakowi dow abüng uowi dowi mih towklak uowi pre buk chekhai. Nami towklak pre buk mih kowi lowk mih dow tawngphak pra kowh tapplawt ria kowi chekhai, now nami towklak dang mih dow mrawkphak prakowi chekhai. Alowk mih towklak dow satlawt pra kowh tapplawt ria kowi chekhai, now nami towklak dang mih dow tawngphak prakowi chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 40:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 40:45" />Nami maru tek ang mih, “Mrawkphak pra kowh dang mih towklak dow Thurai chup kim mingkhet kownkow ka kurdik mih uamowuüa vüi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 40:46" />Now tawngphak pra kowh dang mih towklak dow mingkhet phuchuara kownkow ka kurdik mih uamowuüa vüi chekhai. Naiawngün uamowuüa dow Zadawk kowh chapauüa chekhai. Leviuüa pungmadawng kowi amatni chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nachang lup kownkow kownowng kowi khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 40:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 40:47" />Nami kung kowi dow nami maru mih alak kowi kowh viadawng krawi khaiah khai. Nami viadawng dow areng klang hai adowng phia 100 muk chi chekhai. Nami dow tali tingnui chekhai. Now phuchuara dow Thurai chup kim pur kowi chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 40:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim kowi kowh kimpuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 40:48" />Nami kung kowi dow nami maru mih Thurai chup kim kimpuk kowi pawla ang khai, now kimpuk ria kowi kowh achüng pre buk mih hai kimpuk plawt uar krawi khaiah khai. Naiawngün kimpuk kowi kowh achüng dow aphia tanga muk, now atat sum muk chi chekhai. Kimplawt uar dow laitali muk chekhai, now kimplawt uer tat dow sum muk chi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 40:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 40:49" />Now kimpuk iuk dow areng klang pirmi muk, now adowng phia dow laipre muk chekhai. Nakowi dow pün müa dawng uowi chekhai, now nami dawng ria kowi dow mapra lowk paipra lowk achüng uowi chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 40:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="EZK 41" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 41:1" />Nami kung kowi dow aia mih Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lang iuk mih towklak kowi kowpawla ang khai, now nami towklak kupra kimpuk mih krawi khaiah khai. Nami kimpuk reng klang dow taruk muk chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 41:2" />Nami kimpuk adowng phia dow hamüt muk chekhai, now mapra hai paipra kowh kimpuk ping tat dow tanga muk chi chekhai. Nami kung kowi aia dow towklak lang iuk mih krawi khaiah khai. Nami towklak uar dow areng klang 40 muk hai adowng phia 20 muk chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 41:3" />Nami kung kowi dow aia mih alak nowm nowm kowi kowh towklak kowi kowkowi hanow nakowi kowh kimpuk mih krawi khaiah khai. Nami kimpuk reng klang dow pre muk, now adowng phia taruk muk chekhai. Now mapra hai paipra kowh kimpuk ping tat dow ranit muk chi chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 41:4" />Nami kung kowi dow aia mih alak kowi kowh towklak krawi khaiah khai. Nami towklak uar dow areng klang hai adowng phia 20 muk chi chekhai. Now aia tek ang mih, “Mami dow lang chimsai mih arah chowbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim kowi kowh uanh nungra rum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 41:5" />Nami kung kowi dow aia mih Thurai chup kim kimbang krawi khaiah khai. Nami kimbang tat dow taruk muk chi chekhai. Nami kimbang uat hownia dow kimbang rinrin akhung hai areng pre pra trui kowi towklak ün uowi chekhai. Naiawngün towklak dow lowk kowi adowng phia tali muk chi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 41:6" />Naiawngün towklak dow sum krowng chi chekhai. Naiawngün dow pakrowng pakrowng kowi towklak uowi 30 klüng chi chekhai. Naiawngün towklak dik nahawt kham kownkow Thurai chup kim kimkhung hai areng pre pra trui kowi dow klowng tangra uowi bowk chekhai. Naiawngün towklak kowi kowh klowng dow naiawngün atangra kowi tangah khai. Naiawng changah mih dow naiawngün klowng mih Thurai chup kim kimbang kowi hang pakup lah pakowh chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 41:7" />Naiawng rakowi Thurai chup kim kimkhung hai areng pre pra trui pra kowh towklak reng klang dow adak hownia aluk krowng prakowi awr tadowr ngamlam chekhai. Adak krowng hownia aluk krowng kowi awr pünla kown mih dawng uowi lowk chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8-11" style="v" sid="EZK 41:8-11" />Nami kung kowi dow alowngma panow anaima mih arah luk kowi Thurai chup kim uowi mih ang khi khai. Nami arah luk kowi dow Thurai chup kim hai towklak uowi chekhai. Nami anaima mih arah dow akro taruk muk chekhai, now Thurai chup kim uat pra dow tanga muk mowr akuangma tavir lut chekhai. Naiawngün maten dow achüng luk kowi kowh uowi mih kangowh chekhai. towklak maten uat hownia kowh tap dow atat tanga muk chi chekhai. Thurai chup kim kimchüng hownia uamowuüa kowh kim mowr kowi akuangma mih arah uowi 20 muk chekhai. Thurai chup kim ria kowi kowh towklak ün kowi nakupla kownkow tawngphak prakowi hai mrawkphak prakowi kimplawt uowi lowk chi chekhai. Naiawngün kimplawt pre buk mih dow akuangma mih rah prakowi dang khai.<verse eid="EZK 41:8-11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Satkup pra kowh kim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 41:12" />Thurai chup kim satkup pra kowh akuangma mih arah chur kowi dow kim uowi lowk chekhai. Nami kim iuk dow adowng phia 70 muk hai areng klang 90 muk chekhai. Nami kim ping tat dow papra papra kowi tanga muk chi chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim uat kowi kowh talang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 41:13" />Nami kung kowi aia mih Thurai chup kim krawi khaiah khai. Nami Thurai chup kim areng klang dow 100 muk chekhai. Thurai chup kim kimkhung prakowi kowh kimbang hownia satkup pra kowh kim kimbang mowr akuangma mih arah dow 100 muk chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 41:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 41:14" />Alak kowi kowh viadawng uar dow satlawt pra kowh tap hownia tawngphak pra kowh tap mowr 100 muk chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="EZK 41:15-16" />Nami kung kowi aia dow Thurai chup kim satkup prakowi kowh kim mih khaiah khai. Nami kim dow aklang 100 muk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="EZK 41:15-16">Thurai chup kim lak kowi kowh towk lak</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 41:15-16">Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lang iuk mih towklak hai viadawng prakowi aplawt dang mih kimpuk ping dow singh phen hown khuah khai. Nami pre buk mih arah kowi kupla mih plawt pre pra trui kowh amawm hai tow pe lawkrachow mih tawngpawk maten dow singh phen hown pingah khai. <verse eid="EZK 41:15-16" /><verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="EZK 41:17-18" />Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lang iuk mih towklak hai Lang Chimsai Mih Towklak ping kowi dow chekmarawng singh rup hai Cherup rup uowi bowk chekhai. Naiawngün chekmarawng singh hai Cherup rup dow uowi krang takria seklek chekhai. Cherup rup maten kowh dow lumowr uowi pre buk chi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 41:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 41:19" />Lowk dow lusa maru lumowr, now alowk dow krangsi lumowr chekhai. Lusa maru lumowr dow papra pra kowh chekmarawng singh rup prakowi dang khai, now krangsi lumowr dow alowk mih pra kowh chekmarawng singh rup prakowi dang khai. Naiawngün rup dow Thurai chup kim lak kowi kowh aphai hownia aluk mowr uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 41:20" />towklak ping hownia kupra plawt luk mowr Cherup rup hai chekmarawng singh rup uowi bowk chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 41:21" />Lang iuk mih towklak plawt mawm dow tali tingnui chekhai, now Lang Chimsai Mih Towklak plawt paw nami iawng chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Singh hown kowh phuchuara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 41:22" />Lang iuk mih towklak kimpuk pur kowi dow akro sum muk, areng klang hai adowng phia pre muk chi mih singh hown kowh phuchuara uowi lowk chekhai. Nami dow tali tingnui chekhai. Nami phuchuara achüng, aphai hai aping dow singh hown kowh thawpah mih chekhai. Aia tek ang mih, “Nami dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowh uowi mih pawitang chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim kowi kowh kimbüng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 41:23" />Lang iuk mih towklak kowi hai Lang Chimsai Mih Towklak kowi dow pre pra hownia kowh abüngra uowi mih kimbüng uowi lowk chi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 41:24" />Naiawngün kimbüng dow papra prakowi singh phen hown kowh thawpah mih chekhai, naiawngün abüng kowi dow chawp pe akli khai. <verse eid="EZK 41:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 41:25" />Lang iuk mih towklak kowi kowh kimbüng kowi dow Cherup rup hai chekmarawng singh rup uowi bowk chekhai. Now Thurai chup kim kupra kimplawt luk kowi dow kimluk dakchow kowi achachow mih aluk uowi lowk chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 41:26" />Kimpuk kowi kowh lawkrachow uowi mih tawngpawk uowi chekhai, now naiawngün aping kowi dow chekmarawng singh rup uowi chekhai. Nami klen kowi Thurai chup kim kowi kowh aklowng maten kowi hai aria kowi kowh towklak maten kowi paw chekmarawng singh rup uowi chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 41:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="EZK 42" />
  <para style="s">Uamowuüa kowh kim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 42:1" />Nami kung kowi nami maru mih tawngphak pra kowh tapplawt hownia uat kowi kowh viadawng kowi pawla ang khai, now tawngphak pra kowh kim kowi kowpawla ang khai. Nami kim dow satkup pra kowh kim hown atawnchow chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 42:2" />Nami kim reng klang dow 100 muk chekhai, now adowng phia dow 50 muk chekhai. Nami kimplawt dang mih dow tawngphak prakowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 42:3" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">42:3-4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mami uan kowi kowh lawnguan kowi Hebrai lai hown arui uowi mih chim dowi chekhai.</char></note> Nami kim pur kowi dow alak pra kowh viadawng uowi chekhai, now nami viadawng 20 muk mowr mih dow nami kim pur kowi chekhai. Nami kimkhung kowi dow uat kowi kowh viadawng uowi chekhai. Nami kim dow sum krowng chekhai, now akrowng towng kowi kowh towklak pur kowi dow tiama uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 42:4" />Nami kim dawnglang kowi kowh tiama dow auar hamüt muk, now aklang dow 100 muk chekhai. Nami kim kowi kowh towklak plawt dow tawngphak prakowi auowma kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 42:4" /><verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="EZK 42:5-6" />Tawkche aluk krowng kowi kowh towklak dow asowmchow chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami kimkrowng dow akeng mih kimkrowng iawng thawpla pe achüng dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi adak kowi kowh krowng lak-e aluk krowng dow aiui takla khai. <verse eid="EZK 42:5-6" /><verse number="7-9" style="v" sid="EZK 42:7-9" />Uat kowi kowh viadawng pra khüa mih kimbang dow areng klang 50 muk chekhai, now kimbang ria kowi dow areng klang 50 muk mih tap uowi lowk chekhai. Tawkche alak kowi kowh viadawng pra khüa mih kimbang dow areng klang 100 muk chekhai. Uat kowi kowh viadawng hownia nami kim kowi nauang kupla kownkow nami kim satlawt prakowi aplawt uowi lowk chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 42:7-9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 42:10" />Thurai chup kim mrawkphak prakowi paw nami iawng mih kim uowi lowk chekhai. Nami kim dow alak pra kowh viadawng akuangma mih re-e hai satkup pra kowh kim re-e chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 42:11" />Tawngphak pra kowh kim iawng nami kim kowi paw tiama uowi lowk chekhai. Nami kim paw areng klang, adowng phia, kupra tiama hai alak kowi kowh uowi mih maten tawngphak pra kowh kim iawng chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 42:12" />Nami kim kowi kupla mih plawt dow mrawkphak prakowi chekhai, now nami kim satlawt prakowi paw kupra plawt uowi lowk tak chekhai. Nami kim pur kowi paw tap uowi lowk chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 42:13" />Nami kung kowi aia tek ang mih, “Tawngphak hai mrawkphak pra kowh kim pre buk mih dow chimsaima chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün kim dow Thurai pur kowi kowkowi reng mih uamowuüa changla lang chimsai mih phuchua müa uanh chakra kim chekhai. Now nakowi dow lang chimsai mih uanap natowah kown: Kawmdi uanap, angak lawt lük müa uanap hai aprek lawt lük müa uanap nakowi natowah kown. <verse eid="EZK 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 42:14" />Thurai chup kim kowi chang lup khe kowh uamowuüa khupah mih tawnguat dow klüpta now nami kim pre buk mih kowi natowah kown. Nami kung kowi chiang amatni mih prang kowi kowh viadawng kowi naia lawt kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün tawnguat dow chimsaima chekhai. Naiawng rakowi iawngpa mih maru-uüa uowi rah kowi cham kowi mih khin khe amatni mih akeng tawnguat nakhupla kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 42:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim uowi rah tapat lut mih tap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 42:15" />Naiawng hown aia mih Thurai chup kim uowi mih arah maten krawi khaiah khai. Nami kung kowi dow aia mih satlawt pra kowh tapplawt iawng Thurai chup kim uowi mih arah hownia prang kowi pawla ang khai, now nakowi kowh uat kowi kowh tap aia krawi khaiah khai. <verse eid="EZK 42:15" /><verse number="16-19" style="v" sid="EZK 42:16-19" />Aia dow akhai müa hown prang kowi kowh arah maten satlawt, satkup, tawngphak hai mrawkphak pra kowh tap krawi khaiah khai. Naiawngün tap dow bowkbowk prakowi 500 muk chi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 42:16-19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 42:20" />Chimsaima mih hai iawngpa mih uanh kowi nakraah kownkow bowkbowk prakowi aklang 500 muk mih tap uowi chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 42:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="EZK 43" />
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 43:1" />Nami kung kowi dow nami maru mih satlawt pra kowh tapplawt kowi kowpawla ang khai. <verse eid="EZK 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 43:2" />Nakhowk khe satlawt hownia Israeluüa kowh Thurai kraingra uang ting mih ang khi khai. Aia kowh klow dow tui hawr klunglung mih tün iawng chekhai, now aia kowh kraingra hown lusa mih anowima uang phaw khai. <verse eid="EZK 43:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 43:3" />Nami mukmang khita hanow krawng kowi ang tabawk krawm khai. Nami mukmang kowi ang khi mih dow Thurai uang piak Jerusalem marow khe kowh iawng hai Kebar aw pang kowi kowh ang khi-ah mih mukmang iawng chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 43:4" />CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra dow satlawt pra kowh tapplawt iawng uang kup hanow Thurai chup kim kowi kowkup khai. <verse eid="EZK 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 43:5" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowh lümla mih krowngla ang hanow alak kowi kowh viadawng kowi uang pawla ang khai. Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra dow Thurai chup kim kowi atekma chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 43:6" />Nakhowk khe nami maru dow ang ria kowi tawi iowng phülü khai, now Thurai chup kim hownia mia iawng mih chünchü klangah mih ang ta khai. <verse eid="EZK 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 43:7" />Aia tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, mami chowbowt ang kowh mang chowm rah hai ang kowh khawk towk rah. Mami re-e Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi chowngchowng saksakma ang natawi uowi kown. Israeluüa mih ang kowh ming chimsaima mih katpaw napiak ang kown nadowi bowt. Amatni hai amatni kowh manguüa chup arup mih hownia hai amatni kowh manguüa uak akroma mih phuchuara kowi pawla mih hownia nami ang kowh ming chimsaima mih dow nasürlawk ang kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EZK 43:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 43:8" />Manguüa dow ang kowh kim ria kowi amatni kowh kim thawpah khai. Amatni kowh kim hai ang kowh kim dow kimbang lowkchow towbowt taria. Amatni dow amatni kowh suiiai kaniaima mih lup hown ang kowh ming chimsaima mih piak ang büah khai. Naiawng rakowi ang kowh kunmaraura hown amatni kowi dow ang piakah khai. <verse eid="EZK 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 43:9" />Kawmat dow amatni kowh arup aren hai amatni kowh manguüa uak mih ang hownia pacham henta büah lah. Nahanow chowngchowng saksakma amatni pungmadawng kowi ang natawi uowi kown towbowt.<verse eid="EZK 43:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="EZK 43:10-11" />“Aw maru chapa, Israeluüa mih amatni kowh angak rakowi narukraila kownkow nami Thurai chup kim tawng iawng chow naown kown mih lawnguan kowi kowtek pe diah. Amatni changta mih lup rakowi narukraila büah kownkow Thurai chup kim chang krang natuakah büah kown mih tek pe diah. Amatni kowi dow Thurai chup kim chang krang, prang kowi kowh lawtra tiama hai alak kowi kowh kup müa tiama chang krang, ari aiang hai rirow ün tek pe diah. Nami achang krang iawng naia changla kownkow hai naiawngün rirow naia chünla kownkow naiawngün mih amatni pur kowi en ruiah diah.<verse eid="EZK 43:10-11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 43:12" />“Thurai chup kim vüi lang pankri mih ari aiang dow Thurai chup kim uowi mih hungh tavir lut chimsaima naown kown takla. Thurai chup kim vüi kowi kowh ari aiang dow naiawng chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 43:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phuchuara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 43:13" />“Thurai chup kim kowi kowh phuchuara nowk dow maiawng: Phuchuara adak nowm nowm mih krowng kro dow pamuk chekhai, now nami krowng phia dow nami luk kowi kowh krowng lak-e lang chüt amuk chi khai. Nami adak krowng kowi dow bowkbowk prakowi auer akro pakar chi changah khai. Phuchuara kro dow maiawng naown kown: <verse eid="EZK 43:13" /><verse number="14-16" style="v" sid="EZK 43:14-16" />Nami phuchuara dow adak kowi kowh achüng hownia aluk krowng prakowi akro pre muk chi chekhai, now aphia amuk chi chekhai. Nami luk kowi kowh krowng dow akro tali muk chi chekhai, now aphia amuk chi chekhai. Naiawngün maten luk kowi dow maih changra krowng akro tali muk, areng klang hai adowng phia laipre muk chi chekhai. Nami dow tali tingnui chekhai, now anui towng kowi dow anang uowi lowk chi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 43:14-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 43:17" />Dawnglang kowi kowh krowng paw tali tingnui chekhai. Nami krowng dow areng klang hai adowng phia laitali muk chi chekhai. Nami krowng dow aluk krowng lak-e aphia lang chüt pamuk chekhai, now nami krowng luk kowi dow bowkbowk prakowi auer kro pakar chi khai. Now Phuchuara dawng dow satlawt prakowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 43:18" />Nami kung kowi dow aia tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, ‘Ki thawpta phuchuara kung kowi CHAKRAMANG vüi nachang phuchua kown. Nami ni dow phuchuara luk kowi tikah mih uanap pawi naia changla kownkow hai naia thetla vi kownkow mami rirow nachün kown takla. <verse eid="EZK 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 43:19" />Levi chenchap kowi kowh Zadawk krungchak uamowuüa dow nachang ang lup kownkow ang tut-e uang reng chekhai. Amatni kowi dow nachangla angak lawt lük müa uanap kownkow chiala powrchow en napeah apum kown. <verse eid="EZK 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 43:20" />Nami chiala vi mih en napawah sangrum hanow phuchuara nang tali klüng mih kowi, adawnglang kowi kowh tali tingnui mih kowi hai auer tapat lut mih kowi en nakrawi plikah kown. Naiawng hai angak khu müa uanap pawi chang pe hanow phuchuara mih en nachimsaiah kown. <verse eid="EZK 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 43:21" />Now angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi kowi kowh ngenah mih chiala dow Thurai chup kim uat kowi kowh amülüng mih arah kowi pawla hanow en natikah kown.<verse eid="EZK 43:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 43:22" />“‘Pre ni mih ni khe dow aser auowk uowi dowi mih ruala en nauang pawla apum kown, now uamowuüa mih angak lawt lük müa uanap pawi nachang kown. Nami pawi khe paw chiala vi hown phuchuara kowi chimsaiah iawng en nachimsaiah kown. <verse eid="EZK 43:22" /><verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="EZK 43:23-24" />Phuchuara chimsaita kung kowi dow aser auowk uowi dowi mih chiala powrchow hai aser auowk uowi dowi mih ruapurla en nauang pawla hanow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nauang towah kown. Now nami chiala hai ruapurla luk kowi uamowuüa naprui pe awisa hanow CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap pawi nachangla kown.<verse eid="EZK 43:23-24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 43:25" />“‘Naiawng hai ranit ni mowr ni towng angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi en nauang pawla ruala apum chi kown takla. Nami klen kowi aser auowk uowi dowi mih chiala powrchow hai ruapurla paw en nauang pawla apum chi kown takla. <verse eid="EZK 43:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 43:26" />Uamowuüa mih ranit ni mowr phuchuara ngak khu müa pawi nachang hanow nami dow nachimsaiah kown. Naiawng hai phuchuara dow CHAKRAMANG vüi naap-ah kown. <verse eid="EZK 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 43:27" />Naiawngün chur kung kowi dow raiat ni mih ni hownia uamowuüa mih nami phuchuara luk kowi enni kowh tikah mih uanap hai taking tasangra uanap pawi nachang kown. Nakhowk khe dow ang nasak-ih enni bowt kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai mami laiklow ang tek khowk,’ pakhai,” pah ang khai.<verse eid="EZK 43:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="EZK 44" />
  <para style="s">Satlawt pra kowh tapplawt tawngkeng krang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 44:1" />Nami kung kowi nami maru mih Thurai chup kim satlawt pra uat kowi kowh tapplawt kowi kowplan pawla ang khai. Nami tapplawt dow abüngma chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 44:2" />CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Mami tapplawt hownia alak kowi miapaw nanowng kupla dowi kownkow mami tapplawt dow natabüng hüah kown; nauowta hüah kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow mami tapplawt hownia dow Israeluüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai uang kup khai. <verse eid="EZK 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 44:3" />Pren kruitown mih chowtaih mami tapplawt kowi chowm hanow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nanowng cha chakkham kown. Aia dow tapplawt kowi kowh kimpuk hownia nakowkup kown, now nami hownia aia mih nalawt iawk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim kowi nakup kown mih rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 44:4" />Nami kung kowi dow nami maru mih tawngphak pra kowh tapplawt hownia Thurai chup kim pur kowi pawla ang khai. Nakhowk khe Thurai chup kim kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra atekma mih ang khi khai, now ang tabawk krawm khai. <verse eid="EZK 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 44:5" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, müah kaneu hai süntaah kaneu diah, now ang kowh kim lawnguan kowi ari aiang hai rirow maten ang natek en kown mih kowi pe ching diah. Thurai chup kim kowi mia iawng miuüa chow nowng kup dowi kown mih ang natek kown mih kowi pe ching diah. <verse eid="EZK 44:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 44:6" />Kingküa dawma mih Israeluüa kowi en nakowtek pe kown mih maiawng: CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, ‘Aw Israeluüa, enni kowh suiiai kaniaima mih lup chang taingta bowt. <verse eid="EZK 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 44:7" />Enni kowh akeng mih suiiai kaniaima mih uowi krang hown ang tut-e chakkham, sau hai vi mih enni uang phuchua khai. Nami khin khe buk hai sak kowi hiah khampha uanpik dowi mih prenlang maru-uüa kowi ang kim kowi enni uang pawla khai, now ang kowh kim mih enni sürlawkah khai. Amatni kowh lup hown ang kowh sangbowk laitawm mih enni piakah khai. <verse eid="EZK 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 44:8" />Ang kim kowi kowh chimsaima mih lup dow enni nachang kown mih laiklow uowi chowdiah. Tawkche enni matia chang dowi kowi prenlang maru-uüa kowi enni peah kurdik khai. <verse eid="EZK 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 44:9" />Naiawngün prenlang maru-uüa dow buk hai sak kowi hiah khampha uanpik dowi mih chekhai. Amatni dow ang kim kowi nanowng kup kown nadowi; Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh tawi uowi mih prenlang maru-uüa khowm nanowng kup kown nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Leviuüa naka ripra kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 44:10" />“‘Atawima mih tiama kowi Israeluüa mang mih khin khe Leviuüa paw towla ang hüah hanow arup aren kowi tawi chupiia khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowh angak sung naka ripra büah ngengche kown. <verse eid="EZK 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 44:11" />Nachepaw namingkhet Thurai chup kim kown mih kurdik naka büah hanow ang kowh lup naia chang büah reng kown. Amatni mih tikah mih uanap vüi nanowng ngen tawncher kown, now maru-uüa kowi nachang pe lup kownkow maru-uüa pur kowi nanowng iowng büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 44:12" />Nachenganchepaw amatni dow nachup arup aren kownkow maru-uüa kowi peah süngürra khai, now Israeluüa kowi mih angak prakowi pawla khai. Naiawng rakowi ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih ang takham khowk, amatni kowh angak sung dow amatni naka ngengche kown. <verse eid="EZK 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 44:13" />Amatni dow uamow iawng nachang ang lup kownkow ang pur kowi naia uang kown nadowi, now ang kowh chimsaima mih hai lang chimsai mih uanh ria kowi khowm naia uang büah kown nadowi. Amatni kowh suiiai kaniaima mih uowi krang rakowi amatni mih naka rukrai ngengche kown takla. <verse eid="EZK 44:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 44:14" />Nachepaw Thurai chup kim mingkhet hai nakowi kowh lup maten nachang kown mih kurdik amatni luk kowi ang natang pe kown.<verse eid="EZK 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uamowuüa vüi rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 44:15" />“‘Ang hownia powt hanow tiama tawi kowi Israeluüa cham mang mih khin khe Levi krungchak hownia Zadawk machakuüa dow ang kim kowi kaah sakowmma hown amatni kowh lup mih chang büah reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ang kowh lup nowng chang kown mih hai ang pur kowi nowng uang kown mih dow amatni chowtaih. Amatni dow tawncher sau hai vi hown naphuchua ang kownkow ang pur kowi nauang nowng iowng kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai mami laiklow ang tek khowk. <verse eid="EZK 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 44:16" />Amatni chowtaih ang kowh kim kowi nowng kup kown. Ang kowh lup nachang kownkow ang kowh pawitang ria kowi hai ang kim kowi kowh lup maten nachang kown mih dow amatni chowtaih.<verse eid="EZK 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 44:17" />“‘Amatni dow adipükchow mih la hown kowh tawnguat khupma hown alak pra kowh viadawng kowi kowh tapplawt hownia nakowkup kown. Alak kowi kowh viadawng tapplawt re-e hai Thurai chup kim kowi chang lup büah khe ruapur pawi hown kowh tawnguat naia khup büah kown nadowi. <verse eid="EZK 44:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 44:18" />Amatni lu kowi dow adipükchow mih la hown kowh napawng nauowi kown, now amatni kowh klowng kowi dow adipükchow mih la hown kowh kraksa dawngh nakruala büah kown. Amatni dow ling towkla mih uan nakhup büah kown nadowi. <verse eid="EZK 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 44:19" />Uat kowi kowh viadawng kowi uowi mih maru-uüa tut-e kowkowi khe dow changla lup mih tawnguat naklüpla hanow chimsaima mih towklak kowi natowla büah kown, now akeng mih tawnguat nakhup büah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami chimsaima mih tawnguat rakowi maru mih hang pacham piakla pakowh chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 44:20" />“‘Amatni dow nakhaita sam kown nadowi, adawngma paw narai sam büah kown nadowi, now atownchowchi nakepta sam büah kown. <verse eid="EZK 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 44:21" />Mia iawng mih uamow paw khamla grep tui hanow alak kowi kowh viadawng kowi nakowkup kown nadowi. <verse eid="EZK 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 44:22" />Ahua khuata mih masiuüa kowi hai mamaimow kowi amatni dow naia chawng kown nadowi. Amatni dow Israel chenchap kowi kowh malauüa kowi hai kowng mih uamow kowh masi kowi chowtaih naia chawng kown. <verse eid="EZK 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 44:23" />Amatni dow ang maru-uüa kowi chimsai mih hai iawngpa mih lawnguan natüng nasangah kown, now sürlawkma mih hai sürlawk dowi mih lawnguan amatni kowi natüng nasangah kown.<verse eid="EZK 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 44:24" />“‘Tawng iawng mih lawnguan kowi chünchü tara chet takla khai hanow uamowuüa mih nachet pe tara kown, now ang ana pek iawng amatni mih nachet tara kown. Ang khowm bowkta mih pawi vüi kowi amatni mih ang kowh ari aiang hai rirow mih nachün büah kown, now Tanai Ni mih chimsaima nasunah kown.<verse eid="EZK 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 44:25" />“‘Uamowuüa mih kowng mih maru re-e tawi kowi hanow naia tasür talawk kown nadowi. Nachenganchepaw u-pa, chauüa, tainau hai chang dawngthawng dowi tak mih tuamowuüa kowng khe dow naia tasür talawk kown taih. <verse eid="EZK 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 44:26" />Now nami hownia tachim tasai kung kowi paw CHAKRAMANG kim kowi nachang lup kownkow ranit ni mowr nachawng tak kown takla. <verse eid="EZK 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 44:27" />Nami kung kowi dow nachang lup kownkow Thurai chup kim viadawng lak kowi kowkowi mih ni khe aiamat vüi angak lawt lük müa uanap pawi nachang kown takla. Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="EZK 44:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 44:28" />“‘Uamowuüa kowh dawngthawnguan dow ang chowtaih nauowi bowt kown. Amatni dow Israel pren kowi tawng iawng mih krawng bawn paw natawi ia powng kown nadowi. Ang chowtaih amatni kowh dawngthawnguan nachowng kown. <verse eid="EZK 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 44:29" />Amatni dow kawmdi uanap, angak lawt lük müa uanap hai aprek lawt lük müa uanap kowi kowh uanh nacha büah kown. Israel pren kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG vüi peah mih uanh maten dow amatni vüi nachowng kown. <verse eid="EZK 44:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 44:30" />Rik kuaah mih luprak chap maten lang iung mih hai enni uang ap-ah mih maten dow uamowuüa vüi nachowng kown. Enni kowh kimchak luk kowi prasira nauowila kownkow enni rik kaah mih kawmdi sar dow amatni kowi enni napeah kown. <verse eid="EZK 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 44:31" />Changla phuchua mih nadowi kowi iawngpa kowh kowng mih hai kaurawng uaramchak makah mih asadua nga dow uamowuüa mih naia cha kown nadowi.<verse eid="EZK 44:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="EZK 45" />
  <para style="s">Tabak süng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 45:1" />“‘Israel krungchakuüa vüi pren kowi kowh süng tabak mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG vüi nabakla pe süng para kown takla. Nami süng klang dow akhai müa hown 25,000 muk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">25,000 muk </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow 8.3 maing ngia chekhai. </char></note> hai aphia 20,000 muk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">20,000 muk </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow 6.7 maing ngia chekhai.</char></note> naown kown. Nami pasüngma dow CHAKRAMANG vüi chimsaima naown kown. <verse eid="EZK 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 45:2" />Nami hownia aklang 500 muk hai aphia 500 muk mowr mih arah dow Thurai chup kim vüi natowah kown; nami riaret kowi dow akuangma mih arah nauowi 50 muk kown. <verse eid="EZK 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 45:3" />Nami chimsaima mih arah maten hownia aklang 25,000 muk hai aphia 10,000 muk mowr nalang towah para kown. Nami arah kowi dow Thurai chup kim lang chimsai mih rah nauowi kown. <verse eid="EZK 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 45:4" />Nami arah dow uamowuüa vüi chekhai; nami dow chimsaima chekhai. Uamowuüa mih Thurai chup kim hai CHAKRAMANG vüi nachang lup kownkow nakowi nauowi kown. Nami arah kowi chowtaih amatni kowh kim hai Thurai chup kim nauowi kown. <verse eid="EZK 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 45:5" />Now ta lat mih aklang 25,000 muk hai aphia 10,000 muk mowr mih arah dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup chang mih Leviuüa kowh uowi rah naown kown. Nami arah dow Leviuüa kowh marow nachowng kown.<verse eid="EZK 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 45:6" />“‘Now nami chimsaima mih arah ria kowi aklang 25,000 muk hai aphia 5,000 muk mowr mih arah dow nachangla marow kownkow natowah kown. Nami marow kowi dow lowra mih Israeluüa nanowng uowi kown.<verse eid="EZK 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 45:7" />“‘Now chimsaima mih arah hai marow rihi satlawt pra hai satkup prakowi kowh krawng bawn dow pren kruitown miuüa vüi naown kown. Satkup pra kowh amatni kowh süng rihi dow Mediteranean Sata naown kown, now satlawt pra kowh amatni kowh süng dow satlawt pra kowh rihi mowr naown kown. Nami arah dow tawngphak hai mrawkphak pra kowh chimsaima mih arah hai marow tawngphak hai mrawkphak pra kowh rihi hown atengma naown kown. <verse eid="EZK 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 45:8" />Nami arah dow Israel pren kowi kowh kruitown miuüa vüi naown kown. Ang kowh kruitown miuüa mih ang kowh maru-uüa kowi nachangah nowng kown nadowi bowt. Amatni dow Israel chenchap kowi amatni kowh krungchak uowi iawng naret pe krawng bawn bowt kown.<verse eid="EZK 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 45:9" />“‘Aw Israel kowi kowh kruitown miuüa, ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek khowk, enni kowh angak chang na khowk tak. Kawmat dow kür hown krawi khün maru uanh mih hai krawi chang nowng mih lup towta büah hanow anowmma uowi hai chang lup iung büah bowt. Ang maru-uüa kowh krawng bawn nakrawi khün kown mih taingta büah bowt. <verse eid="EZK 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 45:10" />Enni mih set hai akeng mih uanh khai müa athikma mih tawngah büah bowt. <verse eid="EZK 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 45:11" />Akangma mih chap khai müa efa hai tui chap khai müa bat hown kowh uanh khai dow adik katsang naown kown. Efa lowk dik dow homer dik hamüt bak kowi pabak chekhai, now bat lowk dik paw homer dik hamüt bak kowi pabak dik chekhai. Nami pre chap mih uanh khai müa dow homer nowk iawng nanowkah kown. <verse eid="EZK 45:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 45:12" />Adik khai müa <char style="w">sekel</char> lowk kowi dow pirmi gera chi naown kown, now mina lowk kowi dow 60 sekel naown kown.<verse eid="EZK 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amülüngma mih uanap hai chimsaima mih ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 45:13" />“‘Uanh pek enni nape kown mih dow maiawng: Enni kowh püm maten hownia 60 bak kowi pabak, iakmow maten hownia 60 bak kowi pabak, <verse eid="EZK 45:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 45:14" />now kanrawn sau maten hownia 100 bak kowi pabak chekhai. Sau nowk dow bat hown nakhaiah kown takla. <verse eid="EZK 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 45:15" />Israel pren kowi kowh süng kowi taw mih rua hai ruapur hownia 200 pum kowi papum chi enni nape kown takla. Naiawngün dow maru-uüa kowh angak lawt lük müa kowi kawmdi uanap, tikah mih uanap hai taking tasangra uanap vüi natawngah kown. <verse eid="EZK 45:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 45:16" />Naiawngün awmrawm sung dow pren kowi kowh maru maten Israel kowi kowh kruitown mih kowi napeah kown. <verse eid="EZK 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 45:17" />Pren kruitown mih kowh kurdik dow pawi maten, Lacher pawi hai Tanai Ni vüi ün, Israel chenchap kowh amülüng mih pawi maten vüi tikah mih uanap, kawmdi uanap hai hüngah mih uanap chang müa uanh nakram kown mih chekhai. Aia dow Israel chenchap kowh angak nakhula pe kownkow angak lawt lük müa uanap, kawmdi uanap, tikah mih hai taking tasangra uanap chang müa uanh nakrawi kram kown.<verse eid="EZK 45:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 45:18" />“‘Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek khowk, la uown kowi kowh ni uown kowi aser auowk uowi dowi mih chiala powrchow pawla papum hanow Thurai chup kim mih enni nachimsaiah kown. <verse eid="EZK 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 45:19" />Angak lawt lük müa uanap kowi kowh ngar vi dow uamow mih napawah ne hanow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh kimplawt mawm pre pra trui kowi, phuchuara aluk pra kowh anui tali nui kowi hai alak pra kowh viadawng kowi kowh tapplawt mawm pre pra trui kowi nakrawi plikah kown. <verse eid="EZK 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 45:20" />La uown kowi kowh ranit ni mih ni khe dow maiawng chang büa diah: Tawita mata hai tuk dowi kowh Thurai chup kim kowi kingküala mih lup ngak changta mih uowi khai hanow nami maru vüi lacher ranit ni mih ni khe nami angak lawt lük müa uanap pawi nachang pe kown. Naiawng hown angak khu müa pawi chang hanow Thurai chup kim mih enni nachimsaiah kown.<verse eid="EZK 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 45:21" />“‘La uown kowi kowh lacher laitali ni khe dow Takat Pawi enni nachang kown. Nami pawi dow ranit ni mowr enni nasunah kown; nami khin khe dow the pe tuah dowi mih kawm enni nacha kown takla. <verse eid="EZK 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 45:22" />Nami ni khe dow pren kruitown mih hownia prenchak maten vüi hai aiamat vüi kowi nachangla angak lawt lük müa uanap kownkow nape chiala apum kown. <verse eid="EZK 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 45:23" />Ranit ni mowr mih pawi kowi ni towng aia mih CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap chang müa kowi aser auowk uowi dowi mih chiala ranit pum hai ruapurla ranit pum nape kown, now angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi pani kowi papum chi nape ruala kown. <verse eid="EZK 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 45:24" />Kawmdi uanap iawng hown aia mih chiala hai ruapurla papum vüi kowi kawmdi lairaiat set hai sau sum set hown sum pua chi nape kown takla.<verse eid="EZK 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 45:25" />“‘Now ranit la kowi kowh lacher laitanga ni khe dow ranit ni mih Te Pawi natarowng kown. Nakhowk khe paw Takat Pawi khe kowh iawng pren kruitown mih hownia angak lawt lük müa uanap, tikah mih uanap hai kawmdi uanap chang müa uanh nape kown, now sau paw nape kown.<verse eid="EZK 45:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="EZK 46" />
  <para style="s">Tanai Ni hai Lacher pawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 46:1" />“‘Ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk, viadawng lak kowi kowh satlawt pra kowh tapplawt dow asapta kowi taruk ni mowr natabüng kown. Tawkche nami dow Tanai Ni hai lasi lakra ni khe naia uow kown. <verse eid="EZK 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 46:2" />Nami khin khe kruitown mih dow prang hownia tapplawt chur kowi kowh towklak iawng nauang kup kown, now aia dow tapplawt mawm re-e naiowng kown. Nakhowk khe uamowuüa dow aia kowh tikah mih uanap hai taking tasangra uanap nachang pe kown. Now aia dow nami tapplawt mowr kowi chupiiala Thurai kung kowi prang kowi nalawt iawk kown. Tapplawt dow satkup dowi mowr nata ho hüah kown. <verse eid="EZK 46:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 46:3" />Iawngpa mih maru-uüa dow Tanai Ni hai Lacher Pawi khe nami tapplawt uat kowi CHAKRAMANG kowi nachupiia kown. <verse eid="EZK 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 46:4" />Tanai Ni khe kruitown mih maru dow CHAKRAMANG vüi nachangla tikah mih uanap kownkow ruapur chah taruk pum hai ruapurla apum nauang pawla kown takla. Naiawngün dow aser auowk naia uowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="EZK 46:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 46:5" />Now ruapurla hown dow kawmdi uanap chang müa kawmdi lairiat set aia nathe kown takla, now ruapur chah hawmh hown paw kawmdi mih sak nau mowr aia nathe kown takla. Kawmdi lairiat set vüi kowi kanrawn sau sum set hown sum pua chi nathe kown takla. <verse eid="EZK 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 46:6" />Aia dow lasi lakra ni khe chiala powr apum, ruapur chah taruk pum hai ruapur papum nauang phuchua kown takla. Naiawngün dow aser auowk naia uowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="EZK 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 46:7" />Now chiala hown dow kawmdi lairiat set aia nathe kown takla, now ruapurla hown paw kawmdi lairiat set aia nathe kown takla. Now ruapur chah hown dow kawmdi mih sak nau mowr aia nathe kown takla. Kawmdi lairiat set vüi kanrawn sau tali set hown apua chi aia nathe kown takla. <verse eid="EZK 46:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 46:8" />Kruitown mih maru dow tapplawt chur kowi kowh towklak iawng alak kowi nauang kup kown takla, now nami tiama iawng aia nauang lawt iawk kown takla.<verse eid="EZK 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 46:9" />“‘Khowm bowkta mih pawi khin kowi nauang chupiia CHAKRAMANG kownkow prenchakuüa dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nauang kown. Nami khin khe tawngphak pra kowh tapplawt hownia uang kup miuüa dow mrawkphak pra kowh tapplawt iawng nalawt kown. Now mrawkphak pra kowh tapplawt hownia kowh uang kup miuüa dow tawngphak pra kowh tapplawt iawng nalawt kown. Uang kupla mih tiama hownia dow amiapaw nalawt kown nadowi. Tawkche uang kupla mih tapplawt hown kowh tatang mih paipra kowi kowh tapplawt iawng nalawt kown takla. <verse eid="EZK 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 46:10" />Kruitown mih maru dow alak kowi uang kup mih khin khe maru kawmuüa hown akrowksang nauang kup kown takla, now prang kowi lawt mih khin khe paw maru kawmuüa hown akrowksang nalawt kown takla.<verse eid="EZK 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 46:11" />“‘Pawi khin hai khowm bowkta mih takua talawm khin kowi chiala apum vüi kawmdi lairiat set, now ruapurla vüi kawmdi lairiat set aia nathe kown takla. Now ruapur chah vüi dow kawmdi mih sak nau mowr aia naia the kown. Kawmdi lairiat set vüi kowi kanrawn sau tali set hown apua chi aia nathe kown takla. <verse eid="EZK 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 46:12" />Kruitown mih maru che CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowmatia sak nau hown chang phuchua kown nau khai—nami dow tikah mih uanap pana lah, taking tasangra uanap pana lah—nami phuchua vüi kowi satlawt pra kowh tapplawt mih nauowta kown takla. Nami tikah mih uanap hai taking tasangra uanap dow Tanai Ni khe kowh iawng nasunah kown. Nami kung kowi prang kowi aia lawt khe dow tapplawt mih nabüngta kown.<verse eid="EZK 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ni towng nachang phuchua kown mih rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 46:13" />“‘CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap chang müa aser auowk uowi dowi mih paningchow mih ruapur chah rau towng apum chi pren kruitown mih nakram kown takla. <verse eid="EZK 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 46:14" />Nami klen kowi nami ruapur chah hown dow rau towng kawmdi uanap paw kruitown mih natowla kown takla. Nami kowi nauowi kown mih dow kawmdi sum set hai kawm ngai müa kanrawn sau aset hown apua chekhai. CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi nami kawmdi uanap pawi dow anikma mih ari aiang chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 46:15" />Naiawng hai rau towng tikah mih uanap chang müa ruapur chah, kawmdi hai kanrawn sau mih nahing apta hüah kown takla.<verse eid="EZK 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 46:16" />“‘Ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk, kruitown mih maru che aia kowh krawng bawn hownia aia chapa kowi aia peah parah hanow nami dow aia kowh chapa hai aia kowh chuprek chaprekuüa naka powng kown. <verse eid="EZK 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 46:17" />Tawkche kruitown mih maru che aia kowh krawng bawn hownia aia kowh nar kowi peah krawng bawn parah hanow nami krawng bawn dow <char style="w">Jubili</char> ning uang talen dowi mowr aia kowh nar naia towla kown. Nami kung kowi dow nami krawng bawn mih kruitown mih kowh naplan chowng iawk kown. Nami dow aia hai aia kowh chuprek chaprekuüa chowtaih anikma naka powng kown. Nami dow amatni kowh chowtaih naphaw kown. <verse eid="EZK 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 46:18" />Kruitown mih maru dow maru kowi krawi prüt hanow amatni kowh krawng bawn ia powng kown nadowi. Aia kowh chapauüa kowi dow aia kowh krawng bawn hownia chowtaih naia pe kown. Nahanow ang maru-uüa hownia dow amatni kowh krawng bawn iah amatni nachowng reng kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim kowi kowh sikua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 46:19" />Nami kung kowi dow nami maru mih tapplawt ria kowi kowh kupra iawng uamowuüa vüi khowm bowkta mih rum ün re-e pawla ang khai. Naiawngün rum dow tawngphak pra kowh tapplawt ria kowi chekhai, now naiawngün rum dang mih dow tawngphak pra chekhai. Aia dow satkup pra naiawngün rum chur kowi tüng ang arah lowk khai. <verse eid="EZK 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 46:20" />Aia tek ang mih, “Mami arah kowi dow uamowuüa mih aprek lawt lük müa phuchua ngar hai angak lawt lük müa phuchua ngar nabut kown, now kawmdi uanap chang müa uanh paw nakreng büah kown. Nahanow naiawngün chimsaima mih uanh dow prang kowi kowh viadawng kowi nauang pawla büah kown nadowi bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün kak miuüa dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi nalang takra kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 46:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 46:21" />Nami kung kowi aia dow prang kowi kowh viadawng kowi uang pawla ang khai, now nami viadawng tali tingnui kowi krawi lenla ang khai. Now anui towng kowi dow aluk uowi dowi mih kim chalachow uowi lowk chi mih ang khi khai. <verse eid="EZK 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 46:22" />Nami chalachow mih viadawng kowi dow tap tapat lut chekhai. Nami viadawng dow aklang 40 muk, now adowng phia 30 muk chekhai. Nui towng kowi kowh nami viadawng dow anowk katsang chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 46:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 46:23" />Nami tali klüng mih viadawng kowi dow hua hown kowh tap tapat lut chekhai, now nami tap rinrin dow hawm eng kan engra tapat lut chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 46:24" />Aia tek ang mih, “Naiawngün dow hawm eng kan engra chekhai. Nami hawm eng kan engra kowi dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup chang miuüa mih maru uang phuchuaah mih uanh nabutah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 46:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="EZK 47" />
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim hownia tui uang lawt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 47:1" />Nami kung kowi aia dow Thurai chup kim kimplawt re-e uang pawla ang khai, now Thurai chup kim kimplawt dak hownia tui uang lawt hanow satlawt prakowi hawr mih ang khi khai. Nami Thurai chup kim dang mih dow satlawt prakowi chekhai. Nami tui dow Thurai chup kim mrawkphak hownia uang hawr hanow phuchuara hawmlawm prakowi hawr khai. <verse eid="EZK 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 47:2" />Nami kung kowi aia dow tawngphak pra kowh tapplawt iawng uang lawtla ang khai, now prang kowi kowh tiama iawng cham kuila ang hanow satlawt prakowi kowh tapplawt re-e uang pawla ang khai. Nami tapplawt mrawkphak ria iawng dow tui hawr ditchowchi mih awchawng uowi lowk chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 47:3" />Aia dow mang se mang se akhai müa leng hown krawi khaila hanow satlawt prakowi 1,000 muk mowr pawla ang khai. Nakowi dow aia mih klingnik mowr mih tui dawng iawng pawla ang khai. <verse eid="EZK 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 47:4" />Nami kung kowi aia dow krawi plan khai hanow 1,000 muk mowr pawla ang khai. Nakowi dow kung mowr mih tui dawng iawng aia pawla ang khai. Nami kung kowi paw aia dow krawi plan khai hanow 1,000 muk mowr pawla ang khai. Nakowi dow kelang mowr mih tui dawng iawng aia pawla ang khai. <verse eid="EZK 47:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 47:5" />Nami kung kowi aia dow plan khai 1,000 muk khai iawk. Tawkche nakowi dow tui büp lai rakowi ang nowng pown dowi chekhai, now iau paw ang nowng iau dowi chekhai. Nami tui dow aw iawng uang chowng khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi khawk hown amiapaw nowng powt dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 47:6" />Aia tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, en khi-ah mih kaneuma en müah tak bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 47:6">Nami kung kowi aia dow aw pang kowi pawla ang khai. <verse eid="EZK 47:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 47:7" />Nami aw pang kowi dow mapra pang hai paipra pang kowi singh uowi ahuma mih ang khi khai. <verse eid="EZK 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 47:8" />Aia tek ang mih, “Nami tui dow satlawt prakowi hawr khai, now Araba süng iawng panow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowhawr khai. Sata Kowng kowi kowkla mih khin khe dow nami tui mih achimma naphaw kown. <verse eid="EZK 47:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 47:9" />Nami aw tui cham hawrra maten kowi dow asadua chap maten hai dam ahuma nauowi kown. Nami tui krawi hawr mih rah maten kowi dow tui mih nachim kown. Naiawng rakowi nami tui cham hawrra kowi dow nakowi kowh uowi mih chap maten nasing kown. <verse eid="EZK 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 47:10" />Dam pawk miuüa dow sata pang kowi naiowng kown. Amatni dow En-Gedi aw hownia En-Eglaim aw mowr nadia lawk kown. Mediteranean Sata kowi kowh kaah mih dam iawng nakowi paw dam chap maiow naka kown. <verse eid="EZK 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 47:11" />Tawkche sata hownia kowh krawi pün mih awchawng awlang tui dow akham naiung kown nadowi. Naiawngün tui dow awisa thawp müa nachowng kown. <verse eid="EZK 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 47:12" />Aw pang pre prakowi dow auih uowi mih singh maten naru kown. Naiawngün singh dow aram nakeu kown nadowi, auih paw naplui kown nadowi. La towng nauih reng kown, tawngplawng kowchow panow Thurai chup kim hownia dow nakowi tui nauang hawr reng kown. Naiawngün uih dow nachaah kownkow hai aram dow nachangla chakhang kownkow natawngah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh pren sünghi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="EZK 47:13-14" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Enni mih Israeluüa laipre krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi pren mih dawngthawnguan iawng hai maiawng enni naretah kown. Nami pren dow riri enni naretah kown. Tawkche Josef krungchakuüa kowi dow enni nalang chüt pe pre bak kown. Mami pren dow enni pipu-uüa kowi napeah kown mih ang khamta sawi khowk chekhai, now mami pren dow enni kowh dawngthawnguan nachowng kown.<verse eid="EZK 47:13-14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 47:15" />“Mami dow pren sünghi chekhai: Tawngphak pra kowh rihi dow Mediteranean sata hownia Hetlawn rowkrowk Lebo-Hamat iawng panow Zedad marow mowr chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 47:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 47:16" />Zedad marow hownia dow Damaska hai Hamat rihi kowi kowh uowi mih Berawtha hai Sibraim marow mowr chekhai. Nami hownia Hauran süng rihi ria kowi kowh Hazer-Hatikan marow mowr chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 47:17" />Naiawng rakowi tawngphak pra kowh rihi dow Mediteranean Sata hownia Hazar-Enan marow mowr. Damaska hai Hamat marow dow nami rihi tawngphak prakowi uowi mih chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 47:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 47:18" />Jawrdan aw mapra pown dow Israel pren sünghi chekhai, now akeng pra pown dow Gilead pren sünghi chekhai. Nami rihi dow Sata Kowng mrawkphak iawng panow Tamar kowi kowchur khai. Mami dow satlawt prakowi kowh rihi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 47:19" />Mrawkphak prakowi kowh rihi dow Tamar marow hownia Kades-Meriba tui uowi rah mowr nakowkowi hanow nami hownia Aigupta pren kowi kowh tui kangkhawngma mih aw rowkrowk Mediteranean sata mowr namang kown. Nami dow mrawkphak prakowi kowh rihi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 47:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 47:20" />Satkup prakowi kowh rihi dow Mediteranean Sata chekhai. Nami dow mrawkphak pra kowh rihi hownia tawngphak pra kowh rihi uown Lebo-Hamat mowr chekhai. Nami dow satkup prakowi kowh rihi chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 47:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 47:21" />“Israel krungchakuüa vüi mami pren mih enni naret pe kown. <verse eid="EZK 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 47:22" />Enni pungmadawng kowi uowi khe ka chah mih prenlang maru-uüa vüi hai enni vüi pren mih dawngthawnguan iawng hown enni naretah kown. Prenlang maru-uüa kowi dow pren kowi kowh dia mih Israeluüa iawng hai enni nadowkah kown. Amatni paw enni hown Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi dawngthawnguan iawng hai natawi ka krawng bawn kown. <verse eid="EZK 47:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 47:23" />Nami prenlang maru-uüa kowi dow amatni tawi uowiah mih süng kowi kowh krungchak mih napela krawng bawn kown takla. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 47:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="EZK 48" />
  <para style="s">Israel krungchakuüa tabak süng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 48:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Chowlowkkow krungchakuüa kowi dow pren kowi kowh süng mih maiawng nabakah kown. Tawngphak pra kowh lang khüa nowm nowm mih pren pra dow Dan krungchakuüa naka süng para kown. Mami dow pren sünghi chekhai: Tawngphak pra kowh rihi dow Mediteranean sata hownia Hetlawn rowkrowk Lebo-Hamat iawng panow Zedad marow mowr chekhai. Zedad marow hownia dow Damaska hai Hamat rihi kowi kowh uowi mih Berawtha hai Sibraim marow mowr chekhai. Nami hownia Hauran süng rihi ria kowi kowh Hazer-Hatikan marow mowr chekhai. Naiawng rakowi tawngphak pra kowh rihi dow Mediteranean Sata hownia Hazar-Enan marow mowr. Damaska hai Hamat marow dow nami rihi tawngphak prakowi uowi mih chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 48:2" />Aser krungchakuüa kowh süng nauowi kown mih dow Dan krungchakuüa kowh süng mrawkphak prakowi naown kown. Amatni kowh süng dow satkup pra kowh Mediteranean Sata hownia satlawt pra kowh rihi mowr naown kown. <verse eid="EZK 48:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 48:3" />Naptali krungchakuüa kowh süng nauowi kown mih dow Aser krungchakuüa kowh süng mrawkphak prakowi naown kown. Amatni kowh süng dow satkup pra kowh Mediteranean Sata hownia satlawt pra kowh rihi mowr naown kown. <verse eid="EZK 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 48:4" />Manase krungchakuüa kowh süng nauowi kown mih dow Naptali krungchakuüa kowh süng mrawkphak prakowi naown kown. Amatni kowh süng dow satkup pra kowh Mediteranean Sata hownia satlawt pra kowh rihi mowr naown kown. <verse eid="EZK 48:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 48:5" />Efraim krungchakuüa kowh süng nauowi kown mih dow Manase krungchakuüa kowh süng mrawkphak prakowi naown kown. Amatni kowh süng dow satkup pra kowh Mediteranean Sata hownia satlawt pra kowh rihi mowr naown kown. <verse eid="EZK 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 48:6" />Reuben krungchakuüa kowh süng nauowi kown mih dow Efraim krungchakuüa kowh süng mrawkphak prakowi naown kown. Amatni kowh süng dow satkup pra kowh Mediteranean Sata hownia satlawt pra kowh rihi mowr naown kown. <verse eid="EZK 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 48:7" />Juda krungchakuüa kowh süng nauowi kown mih dow Reuben krungchakuüa kowh süng mrawkphak prakowi naown kown. Amatni kowh süng dow satkup pra kowh Mediteranean Sata hownia satlawt pra kowh rihi mowr naown kown.<verse eid="EZK 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 48:8" />“Juda krungchakuüa rihi mrawkphak pra kowh süng dow pankrima mih lup chang müa enni nalang kraah parah kown. Nami süng dow adowng phia 25,000 muk mowr naown kown, now areng klang dow akeng mih Aser krungchakuüa kowh iawng satlawt pra kowh pren sünghi hownia satkup pra kowh rihi mowr naown kown. Nami süng takra kowi dow Thurai chup kim nauowi kown. Nami süng rihi dow satlawt hownia satkup pra mowr naown kown. <verse eid="EZK 48:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 48:9" />Nami lang kraah mih süng hownia dow CHAKRAMANG chup kim vüi enni nape süng parah kown. Nami dow aklang 25,000 muk hai adowng phia 20,000 muk naown kown. <verse eid="EZK 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 48:10" />Uamowuüa naka süng kown mih dow nami chimsaima mih arah kowi chekhai. Amatni kowh süng dow satlawt hownia satkup prakowi aklang 10,000 muk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">48:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">10,000 muk </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow 3.3 maing chekhai.</char></note> naown kown, now tawngphak hownia mrawkphak prakowi aklang 25,000 muk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">48:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">25,000 muk </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow 8.3 maing chekhai.</char></note> naown kown. CHAKRAMANG kowh kim dow nami lak kowi nauowi kown. <verse eid="EZK 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 48:11" />Nami chimsaima mih arah dow ang vüi kowi kowh lang kraah mih Zadawk krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh uamowuüa vüi naown kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow kaah sakowmma hai ang kowh lup chang reng chekhai. Amatni dow Israeluüa hown kowh tiama ngak kowi tawi mang mih Levi chenchapuüa iawng tawi mang dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZK 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 48:12" />Amatni kowh süng dow lainowmma chimsaima mih süng naown kown, now nami süng dow Leviuüa vüi kowi kowh lang kra pe mih süng ria kowi nauowi kown.<verse eid="EZK 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 48:13" />“Uamowuüa kowh süng rihi ria kowi dow Leviuüa mih aklang 25,000 muk hai aphia 10,000 muk mih süng naka lowk kown. <verse eid="EZK 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 48:14" />Nami süng dow uamowuüa hai Leviuüa mih naia sum kown nadowi, now pha paw naia pha kown nadowi. Nami süng dow amülüng mih süng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nami süng dow akeng miuüa rut kowi cham ia pe kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh chimsaiah mih chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 48:15" />“Marat mih aphia 5,000 muk hai aklang 25,000 muk mih süng dow marow kowi kowh iawngpa mih lup chang müa kowi natawngah kown. Nami dow kim changra hai tawncher thing rah vüi natawngah kown. Jerusalem marow dow nami takra kowi nauowi kown. <verse eid="EZK 48:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 48:16" />Now nami marow tapat lut dow 4,500 muk chi nauowi kown. <verse eid="EZK 48:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 48:17" />Marow tapat lut dow tawncher thing rah süng 250 muk chi nauowi kown. <verse eid="EZK 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 48:18" />Nami marow satlawt pra hai satkup pra dow süng 10,000 muk chi nauowi kown. Nami süng kowi kowh sawtah mih luprak dow marow kowi kowh maru iukuüa kowh chakkham nachowng kown. <verse eid="EZK 48:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 48:19" />Lowra mih krungchak hownia marow kowi uang chang lup miuüa dow nami süng kowi naia chang lup kown. <verse eid="EZK 48:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 48:20" />Nami lang kraah mih süng dow aklang hai phia 25,000 muk chi naown kown. Nami süng kowi nauowi kown mih dow chimsaima mih arah, marow hai marow riaret kowi kowh arah chekhai.<verse eid="EZK 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="EZK 48:21-22" />“Nami lang kraah mih süng satlawt hai satkup prakowi kowh uowi mih süng dow kruitown miuüa vüi chekhai. Nami pre buk mih süng dow tawngphak hai mrawkphak prakowi 25,000 muk chi naown kown. Nami pre buk mih süng rihi dow satlawt prakowi kowh pren sünghi hai satkup prakowi kowh pren sünghi mowr namang kown. Naiawng hai kruitown miuüa kowh süng takra kowi dow Thurai chup kim hailawm uamowuüa kowh süng, Leviuüa kowh süng hai marow kowi kowh süng nauowi kown. Kruitown miuüa kowh nami süng dow tawngphak pra kowh Judauüa kowh süng hai mrawkphak pra kowh Benjaminuüa kowh süng rihi takra kowi nauowi kown.<verse eid="EZK 48:21-22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 48:23" />“Ta lat tanga krungchak miuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh Benjamin krungchakuüa dow naka süng para kown. Nami süng dow amülüng lang kraah mih süng dak kowi naown kown. Amatni kowh süng dow satkup pra kowh Mediteranean Sata hownia satlawt pra kowh rihi mowr naown kown. <verse eid="EZK 48:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 48:24" />Simiawn krungchakuüa kowh süng nauowi kown mih dow Benjamin krungchak kowh süng mrawkphak prakowi naown kown. Amatni kowh süng dow satkup pra kowh Mediteranean Sata hownia satlawt pra kowh rihi mowr naown kown. <verse eid="EZK 48:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 48:25" />Isakar krungchakuüa kowh süng nauowi kown mih dow Simiawn krungchak kowh süng mrawkphak prakowi naown kown. Amatni kowh süng dow satkup pra kowh Mediteranean Sata hownia satlawt pra kowh rihi mowr naown kown. <verse eid="EZK 48:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 48:26" />Zebulun krungchakuüa kowh süng nauowi kown mih dow Isakar krungchak kowh süng mrawkphak prakowi naown kown. Amatni kowh süng dow satkup pra kowh Mediteranean Sata hownia satlawt pra kowh rihi mowr naown kown. <verse eid="EZK 48:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 48:27" />Gad krungchakuüa kowh süng nauowi kown mih dow Zebulun krungchak kowh süng mrawkphak prakowi naown kown. Amatni kowh süng dow satkup pra kowh Mediteranean Sata hownia satlawt pra kowh rihi mowr naown kown. <verse eid="EZK 48:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 48:28" />Mrawkphak pra kowh Gad krungchakuüa kowh süng rihi dow Tamar marow hownia Kades-Meriba tui uowi rah mowr nakowtowm kown. Nami hownia Aigupta awkang rowkrowk Mediteranean sata mowr namang kown.<verse eid="EZK 48:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 48:29" />“Nami pren dow Israel krungchakuüa kowi dawngthawnguan iawng hai enni nabakah kown, now naiawngün enni bak pe mih süng dow amatni kowh nachowng kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="EZK 48:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Marow tapplawt maten kowi nachap pe ming kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="EZK 48:30-31" />“Jerusalem marow hownia prang kowi nalawtla kown mih tapplawt nauowi sangrum kown. Naiawngün tapplawt kowi dow chowlowkkow Israel krungchakuüa ming nachap pe kown. Tawngphak prakowi kowh aklang 4,500 muk mih tap kowi dow tapplawt nauowi sum buk kown. Naiawngün tapplawt kowi dow Reuben tapplawt, Juda tapplawt hai Levi tapplawt pahai aming nauowi kown. <verse eid="EZK 48:30-31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 48:32" />Satlawt prakowi kowh aklang 4,500 muk mih tap kowi dow tapplawt nauowi sum buk kown. Naiawngün tapplawt kowi dow Josef tapplawt, Benjamin tapplawt hai Dan tapplawt pahai aming nauowi kown. <verse eid="EZK 48:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 48:33" />Mrawkphak prakowi kowh aklang 4,500 muk mih tap kowi dow tapplawt nauowi sum buk kown. Naiawngün tapplawt kowi dow Simiawn tapplawt, Isakar tapplawt hai Zebulun tapplawt pahai aming nauowi kown. <verse eid="EZK 48:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 48:34" />Satkup prakowi kowh aklang 4,500 muk mih tap kowi dow tapplawt nauowi sum buk kown. Naiawngün tapplawt kowi dow Gad tapplawt, Aser tapplawt hai Naptali tapplawt pahai aming nauowi kown. <verse eid="EZK 48:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 48:35" />Marow kowi kowh tapat lut mih tap dow 18,000 muk nauowi kown. Nami khin hownia dow marow ming mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG dow makowi uowi reng,’ napape büa kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZK 48:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 48" />
</usx>